śrīḥ ||

|| śrīgaṇeśāyanamaḥ ||

|| {śivārcanacandrikā} ||

yasyāhurāgamavidaḥ paripūrṇaśakte raṃśe kiyatyapi niviṣṭamamuṃ 
prapañcam |
tasmai tamālarucibhāsurakandharāya nārāyaṇīsahacarāya namaśśivāya 
||


avaśyakāryaṃ śaivānāmātmārthaśivapūjanam | tacca 
vaidikamiśrābhyāmeteṣāṃ śaivamuttamam || tadapyaśaktikācchuddhāt 
miśrātsaurādikādapi | saśakti kevalaṃ ślāṣyaṃ saṃkṣiptaṃ 
bhuktimuktidam | tasmādātmārthayajanaṃ śambho raṃbikayā saha | 
saṃgṛhya darśayiṣyāmi sarvadivyāgamoddhṛtam | 
divyāgamārthasāṅkaryamaikataṃtryānnadoṣakṛt | kintu pāśupatārthaṃ 
ca sāṅkaryaṃ teṣu doṣakṛt | teṣvapyekaṃ samāśritya 
grāhyamanyadapekṣite | ityetanmānuṣe liṅge natu svāyaṃbhuvādiṣu || 
ekāgamāvalaṃbe'pi pravihāya tadīritam | 
(praśastamityārabhyārcanāṅgamapekṣitamityantaṃ pustakāṃtare nāsti |) 
praśastamanyato grāhyamityupādiśadīśvaraḥ || 
prāśastyasyobhayossāmye'pyarcanāṅgamapekṣitam | tatrokta  
(anyatroktamiti ) manyatantroktaṃ samamityapyupādiśat || 
tasmāddivyāgamebhyo'sau akhilebhyassamuddhṛtaiḥ | apekṣitāṃśaiḥ 
kriyate śrīśivārcanacandrikā ||

ācamya bhasmarudrākṣavibhūṣitakalevaraḥ | sakalīkṛtya 
saskuryātsāmānyarghyaṃ yathāvidhi | śuddhavidyātmakaṃ dhyātvā 
śivapūjāniketanam | tadvāre'nuttare kuryāt dvārapālārcanaṃ kramāt || 
<p. 2> vighnatrayaṃ samutsārya praviśyāstrādipūjanam | kṛtvā 
pūjopakaraṇaṃ sakalaṃ sannidhāpayet | devasya dakṣiṇe bhāge 
(pāvakecottarāmukhaṃ) pāvakasyottarāmukham | vihitāsanamāsthāya 
pañcaśuddhiṃ samācaret | ādityasyodayātpūrvaṃ muhūrtadvitaye sthite | 
utthāya dhautāṃghrikaraḥ kṛtabhasmāvakuṇṭhanaḥ || hṛdi 
sāmānyasamayī cintayetparameśvaram | viśiṣṭasamayī bindau mūrdhni 
nirvāṇadīkṣitaḥ || ācāryabodhakaścainaṃ (sādhakaścaitamiti) 
dvādaśānte vicintayet | nāmāni cāsya hṛdyāni caritrāṇi ca kīrtayet || 
viṇmūtrotsarjanaṃ kuryāt gatvā deśaṃ yathocitam || 
udaṅmukho'hassandhyāsu rajanyāṃ dakṣiṇāmukhaḥ | prākpratyagvadano 
yadvā dinapūrvāparārdhayoḥ | udaṅmukhastu madhyāhne rajanyāṃ 
dakṣiṇāmukhaḥ | nabhoviṇmūtradikcandra 
(sūryeṃdradhanustārābhidarśanamiti) sūryatārāgnidarśanam || 
(devālayadvijāśvattha) devagomuniviprastrīsammukhaṃ ca vivarjayet | 
tṛṇaiḥpāyu mayajñārhai rijyādyanupayogibhiḥ || loṣṭādyairvā na 
satpuṣpaparṇakāṣṭhaphalādibhiḥ | adhodṛṣṭiḥ prajananaṃ 
gṛhṇanvāmena pāṇinā | jalābhyāśamupāgamya śaucaṃ kurvīta 
mṛjjalaiḥ | ekā liṅge gude pañca daśa vāmakare mṛdaḥ | ṣaṣṭhaṃ ca 
pṛṣṭhe cāgre ca karayossapta mṛttikāḥ || vālmīke vṛkṣamūle ca gṛhe 
mārge jalāntare | ūṣare mūṣikotkhāte govraje devatālaye || 
vāpīkūpataṭākādimūle ca sikatāsthale || vīthyāṃ śmaśāne 
kīṭāsthituṣāṅgārādidūṣite | pāṃsule 
paraśaucārdhaśiṣṭamṛtkīrṇabhūtale || halotkhāte ca jabāle śarkare 
nāharenmṛdam || śuddhabhūmau ca mṛtagrāhyā vyapohyopari mṛttikām | 
yathā syāt śaucaparyāptā nāvaśiṣyeta vā yathā || prathamaṃ 
pāyuśaucaṃ syādardhaprasṛtimānataḥ | tadardhamānataḥ 
paścāttadardhena tataḥ param || <p. 3> ārdrāmalakamānaṃ 
syānmūtraśaucetu mṛttikā | dviguṇaṃ mṛttikāśuklye triguṇaṃ 
dārasaṅgatau || etacchaucaṃ gṛhasthasya bhāvaśuddhyai tato'dhikam | 
brahmacāryādikānāṃ tu kramāt dvitricaturguṇam || yasya 
yāvaddivāśocaṃ tadardhaṃ niśi tasya tat | tadardhamāture 
coktamāturārdhaṃ vanādhvani || āgulpha caraṇau mṛdbhiḥ 
karāvāmaṇibandhakau | saṃkṣālya kṣālayetpaścādājānvākūrparaṃ 
jalaiḥ || dhārāśaucaṃ na kartavyaṃ śaucaśuddhimabhīpsatā | culakaireva 
kartavyaṃ hastau śuddhividhānataḥ || śauce mṛjjaladānārthaṃ kartavyau 
paricārakau | savyahastagṛhītā ca kṣepyā mṛdvāmahastake || 
kuryādvādaśa gaṇḍūṣān purīṣotsarjane kṛte | kurvīta caturo mūtre 
bhojanānte tu ṣoḍaśa || (prāṅmantrīti) prāṅmukhaḥ kṣālayetpādau 
hastau vaktramudaṅmukhaḥ | (prāṅmukhovāthakurvīteti) udaṅmukhaḥ 
prāṅmukho vā tatastvācamanaṃ caret ||

|| [dantadhāvanavidhiḥ] ||

hṛnmantreṇa tato grāhyaṃ dantakāṣṭhaṃ tvaganvitam | 
aparvāgrasamacchedamādyamagre ca kūrcitam || kaniṣṭhikāsamasthaulyaṃ 
sūkṣmaṃ vā dantasaukṣmyataḥ | aṣṭāṃgulaṃ naiṣṭhikānāṃ 
bhogināṃ dvādaśāṃgulam | varṇānāṃ daśakaṃ 
cāṣṭasaptāṃgulikameva ca || ṣaḍaṃgulaṃ prahīṇānāṃ nārīṇāṃ 
caturaṃgulam | jaṃbbāmlakakubhāśoka kapitthavakulodbhavam || 
plakṣaudumbaraphullāṃghrī jājīcampakaśaṃkhajam | 
atimuktakadaṃbotthamapāmārgaṃ ca bhoginām | grāhyametacca śairīṣa 
ciribilvakarañjakam | śrīparṇadārunirguṇḍī sārasaṃ khādirāyate || 
akṣakṣīridhavaraiṇḍavaṭāśvatthāgraśigrujam | akulīśeluvānīra dhātrī 
(nimbaśarodbhavamiti) codumbarodbhavam || kharjūranālikerotthaṃ 
pālāśaṃ tālavaṃśajam | 
tṛṇaparṇapiśācotthamiṣṭakāṅgārabhasmajam | aṃgulīca vivarjyāni 
suvarṇādikṛtaṃ tathā || pratipannavamīṣaṣṭhī dvādaśī pañcaparvakam | 
upavāsadinaṃ janmatrayaṃ ca śanivāsaram || bhānuvāraṃvyatīpātaṃ 
grahaṇaśrāddhavāsaram | sūryodayānantaraṃ ca vivarjyaṃ 
dantadhāvanam || alābhe dantakāṣṭhānāṃ niṣiddhadivaseṣu ca | 
gaṇḍūṣairdvādaśāvṛttairdalairvā śodhayedradān | jihvānirlehanaṃ 
kuryājjihvāmalaviśodhanaiḥ || 
phālākṣiśrotranāsāsyaretoviṇmūtragātrajam | karapādagataṃ 
yadvacchoddhyaṃ tatsakalaṃ malam || nāsikāśrotranetrādikṣālanena 
viśudhyati || evaṃ malāni saṃśodhya vāruṇasnānamācaret | 
aśeṣamālinyaharaṃ dusvapnādivināśanam ||

|| atha [snānavidhiḥ] ||

vidhivadācāntaḥ kṛtakaranyāsaḥ prāṇānāyamya 
darbhāndhārayan || amukasthe ravau māsi tithau vāre saridvare | snānaṃ 
deva kariṣyāmi tvatpūjārthaṃ prasīda me || iti vijñāpya śuddhabhūmi 
maṣṭāṃgulaparyantaṃ huṃphaḍantāstreṇa khātvā tenaiva mantreṇa 
mṛdamuddhṛtya tadvastuni mṛdaṃ mūlamantreṇa 
namontahṛdayenavā'dāya namontahṛdayena prathamamuddhṛtayā mṛdā 
khātamāpūrya namontaśirasā saritsarastaṭākāditīre viśuddhe nikṣipet | 
saridādīnāṃ dakṣiṇatīraṃ snānārtha matipraśastam | tato 
huṃphaḍantāstreṇa mṛdamabhyukṣya namontaśirasā mṛdamastreṇa 
mūlādīnyuddhṛtya namontakavacena tāṃ tridhā vibhajya 
nābhyādipādānta mekāṃśena prakṣālya dvitīyamaṃśaṃ saptavāra 
mastramantrajaptamastraraśmisamparkāddīptaṃ vibhāvya sarvamaṅgaṃ 
tenālipya jalaṃ praviśya jalamastreṇāloḍyāṃguṣṭhābhyāṃ karṇau 
tarjanībhyāmakṣiṇī madhyamābhyāṃ nāsike ca dṛḍhaṃ pidhāya 
praṇavaṃ mūlasahitaṃ vā japan hṛdaye jvaladastraṃ dehaṃ 
tattejaḥpuñjapiñjaracchaviṃ vibhāvayan jale nimagno yāvacchakti 
avatiṣṭheta | athavā mṛdaṃ dvedhā vibhajya astrajaptena ekena bhāgena 
sarvamaṅgamālipya snāyāt | <p. 5> tadetanmalasnānam | yadvā(-)
vakṣyamāṇavidhisnānārthameva mṛdāharaṇam | malasnānaṃ tu 
haridrāmalakādipiṣṭaireva kāryam | atra 
retoviṇmūtranāsikāmukhacakṣuśrotranakhapādamalarūpāṇāṃ 
śārīramalānāṃ śaucādimalasnānāntakarmāntargataiḥ 
mṛddantakāṣṭhaharidrāmalakādigharṣaṇairudakasecaneśca śuddhiḥ | 
(śuddhirvāmūrdhniniṣicyajalāduttīryācamyārthinako) 
vācikamalasnānaṃ snānakālikaiḥ praṇavādijapaiḥ | 
malasnānamastramantrasnānādibhiḥ | tato jalādutthāya ādityaṃ nirīkṣya 
astreṇa mūrdhni nikṣipya jalāduttīryācamyāvirakto 
dvijaścedvaidikasandhyā mupāsya saṃkṣepataḥ śaivīmapi 
sandhyāmupāsīta | virakto dvijaścaturthaśca śaivīmevopāsīta ||

|| [saṃkṣiptaśaivasandhyāprakāraḥ] ||

astramantreṇa śirasi trivāramaṃgulyagragatairjalabindubhiḥ prokṣya 
śivāstrāyavidmahe kālānalāya dhīmahi | tannaśśastraḥ pracodayāt | 
ityastragāyatryā sūryamaṇḍalasthāya astrāya trivāramarghyaṃ datvā 
yathāśaktyastragāyatrīṃ japet | yadvā astrasandhyāsthāne hṛdaye 
jvalantamastramantraṃ dhyāyet | tato vidhisnānārthaṃ 
bindusthānādgaṃgāditīrthānāṃ madhye ekatamaṃ tīrthaṃ 
aṃkuśamudrayā vauṣaḍantahṛdayenākṛṣya udbhavamudrayā 
namontahṛdayena puratassaṃsthāpya tenāpūritaṃ sarittaṭākādikaṃ 
sañcintayet | tadanu vidhisnānārthaṃ sthāpitamṛdbhāgamādāya 
nābhidaghnajalaṃ praviśya | nadīṣu pravāhābhimukho'nyatra prāṅmukha 
udaṅmukho vā matsyamaṇḍūkādivāsabhūta jaladoṣaparihārārthaṃ 
hastamātraṃ caturaśraṃ śivatīrthaṃ purataḥ parikalpayet | tatrāyaṃ 
kramaḥ mṛdbhāgaṃ vāmakare pūrvayāmyasaumyadikṣu tridhā vibhajya 
pūrvaṃ saptavārāvṛttenāstramantreṇābhimantrya 
yāmyamaṣṭavārāvṛttena kavacāntairaṅgairvā saumyaṃ 
daśavārāvṛttenāstramantreṇa śivenacābhimantrya tatrāstrajaptaṃ 
<p. 6> huṃphaḍantāstreṇa nārācamudrayā pūrvādiṣu sarvāsu dikṣu 
kṣipet | evaṃ digvighnānāmadhipasya indrasya diśi sthitasya mṛdbhāgasya 
dikṣu kṣepeṇa tattaddigvasthitāḥ sarve vighnāśśamaṃ yāṃti | tadanu 
śivajaptamṛdbhāgārdhaṃ mūlena jale śivatīrthasidhyarthaṃ nikṣipya 
tadaparārdhaṃ śivatīrthasamānasidhyarthaṃ mūlamantrakṛtena 
bāhuparibhramaṇena samantānnikṣipet | evaṃ somadiśi sthāpito 
mṛdbhāgaḥ kevalamamṛtamayassanśivamantreṇa lolanāt kṣaratīti 
tattīrthamamṛtamayaṃ bhavati | itthaṃ śivatīrthaṃ parikalpya 
vidhitassnāyāt | tadarthaṃ prathamaṃ brahmāṅgajaptena mṛdbhāgena 
sarvamaṅgaṃ lipet | dharmarājadiśi sthitasya mṛdbhāgasya 
saṃsparśanātsarvapāpakṣayo bhavati | ataṣṣaṇmukhīkaraṇamudrayā 
śrotrādidvārāṇi pidhāya śivatīrthamadhye nimajjya śivamantraṃ 
dhyāyannantarjale yāvacchakti avatiṣṭheta | antarjale 
sarvāṅganimajjanamuttamamarddhāṅganimajjanaṃ madhyamaṃ 
mukhamātranimajjanaṃ kanīyaḥ | tato jalādutthāya vāmadakṣiṇahastau 
somasūryātmakau śaktiśivau vā vicintya tābhyāṃ kṛtayā 
kumbhamudrayā vauṣaḍantasahitābhimaṃtritaiḥ jalaiśśirasyabhiṣicya 
huṃphaḍantāstreṇa vighnaśamanārthaṃ jalaṃ dikṣu vidikṣu ca vinikṣipya 
tattīrthajale śivatīrthasiddhyarthaṃ nikṣipya tadaparārddhaṃ 
śivatīrthasīmani saṃhāramudrayā upasaṃharet | itthaṃ saridādikaṃ 
gatvā snātumaśaktau gṛha eva śuddhe gomayalipte bhūbhāge pīṭhasyaḥ 
śītajalapūritaiśśivamantrajaptaiḥ navabhiraṣṭabhiḥ pañcabhirvā 
kumbhaissnāyāt | rājānaḥ strībālarogiṇaḥ pravāsinaśca 
śītodakasnānāśaktau uṣṇodakenasnānaṃ kuryuḥ || śirasisnānāśaktau 
kaṇṭhasnānādikaṃ kuryuḥ | rājānaścet śivapūjārthaṃ 
śivasnapanoktasarvopacārasnānasahitasnānavidhānāt suvarṇapīṭhe 
sthitvā 
suvarṇakumbhāhṛtairjalaiśśaṅkhādimaṅgalavādyaghoṣapurassaraṃ 
snānaṃ kuryuḥ | tadanu śuddhamṛduvastreṇa dehasammārjanaṃ 
dhautavastradvayaparidhānaṃ ācamanaṃ sakalīkaraṇaṃ bhasmasnānaṃ 
tripuṇḍradhāraṇamityetatsarvaṃ nirvartya sandhyāṃ vandet ||

śaivasandhyāprakāraḥ ||

|| [tatprakāraḥ] ||

<p.7> saṃhitayā gāyatryāvā triḥ prāṇānāyamya hauṃ 
netrābhyāṃ nama ityaṃguṣṭhābhyāṃ netrayordivyamudrāṃ vinyasya 
namontamūlena jalaṃ nirīkṣya tenaiva santāḍya 
vauṣaḍaṃtakavacenābhyukṣya vauṣaḍaṃtahṛdayenāṃkuśamudrayā 
bindusthānādgaṅgādīnā mekatamaṃ tīrthamākṛṣya 
namontahṛdayenodbhavamudrayā tattīrthaṃ jale nikṣipya mūlenābhimantrya 
huṃphaḍantāstreṇa saṃrakṣya namontakavacenāvakuṇṭhya 
vaiṣaḍantaśaktimantreṇa dhenumudrayā amṛtīkuryāt | atha saṃdhyāṃ 
dhyāyet | saṃdhyā trividhā brāhmī vaiṣṇavī raudrīti | tatra 
raktasragvasanāraktā raktālaṅkāraśobhitā | haṃsāsanasamāsīnā 
yajñasūtrajaṭādharā || caturbhujācaturvaktrā locanāṣṭakabhūṣitā | 
akṣamālāṃ srucaṃ savye vāme daṇḍaṃ kamaṇḍalum || dadhānā 
brahmadevatyā prātassandhyā tridhā ca sā | prātaḥkāle'lpanakṣatre 
subālā muktidā prabhuḥ || prātastu luptanakṣatre bhuktimuktipradāyinī | 
jñānaśaktisvarūpā sā madhyamā bālyamāśritā || bhuktipradāyinī 
bhānorarddhamaṇḍaladarśane | kriyāśaktisvarūpā sā prauḍhā bālyaṃ 
samāśritā || suvarṇapaṅkajāsīnā sitavastrādibhūṣitā | 
vanamālopavītābhyāṃ bhūṣitā ca dvilocanā || ekavaktrā caturhastā 
dakṣiṇe sagadāṃbujā | śaṅkhacakradharā vāme maddhyā sandhyā tu 
vaiṣṇavī || sā ca dvitīyā yāmasya turyabhāge tridhā bhavet | ādyāṃśe 
muktidā sā ca kiñcidudbhinnayauvanāṃ | madhyāṃśe madhyatāruṇyā 
vāgīśī bhuktimuktidā || jvālābhidhā tṛtīyāṃśe muktidā 
prauḍhayauvanā | vṛṣapaṅkajamadhyasthā triṇetrā candraśekharā | 
śārdūlacarmavasanā meghaśyāmalavigrahā | triśūlākṣadharā savye 
vāme sābhayaśaktikā || sāyaṃ sandhyā smṛtāraudrī trividhāsāpi 
pūrvavat | āraktārkakare kāle kiñciccalitayauvanā | vāmābhidhānā 
sāraudrī dhyātṝṇāṃ muktidāyinī |
<p. 8> yauvanārdhacyutā'rdhārke jyeṣṭhākhyā bhuktimuktidā || 
bhuktidāstamite sūrye raudryākhyā gatayauvanā | evaṃ 
navavidhāssaṃdhyāśśivaśāstre śivoditāḥ || sākṣibhūtāssamastasya 
pūjitā vāṃchitapradāḥ || brāhmī hṛtpaṅkajagatā vaiṣṇavī 
bindumadhyagā | brahmarandhragatā raudryassvasvakāleṣu cintayet || 
prātassandhyā samayino madhyamā ca viśeṣiṇaḥ | nirvāṇadīkṣitasyaiva 
saṃdhyātritayamiṣyate || tatra yassyātsaptakalāprāsādapravaṇo budhaḥ | 
sabinduśaktissamanāsthānatritayavartinīḥ | mṛṇālatantuvattanvī 
rāraktaśvetacāmarāḥ || dhyāyetkriyādṛgicchākhyāḥ 
prāsādoccārapūrvakam || yasya tu dvādaśakale prāsāde niṣṭhitāmatiḥ | 
tena sandhyā parā cintyā yā niśīthe vibhāvyate || 
nābhyādidvādaśāntāntaṃ tato (nāsā) nābhyavasānakam | 
gamāgamavatī turyā nirūpā mecakā'thavā || jñānināṃ tu varā 
sandhyā śivabodhasvarūpiṇī | dvādaśāṃtasthitaṃ śaṃbhuṃ 
candrikendumivāśritā || ekaiva vastutassandhyā śivaśaktisvarūpiṇī | 
kālādhikāribhedena saiva bhinnā tridhā matā || sandhyācintanamevedaṃ 
sandhyāvandanamucyate | aṅgamasya pradhānasya yadanyanmārjanādikam || 
evaṃ kṛtasandhyopāsanādikarmaṇā śivapūjā samārammaṇīyā || 
tatrāyaṃ kramaḥ(-)tatoṃguṣṭhamīśāna manāmikā mamṛtakalāṃ 
ca dhyātvā aṃguṣṭhayuktayā'nāmikayā cakṣuṣī nāsike śotre aṃsau 
hṛdayaṃ nābhiṃ śiraśca krameṇa ādityastṛpyatu viṣṇustapyatviti 
bhāvayanneva spṛśet | evaṃ kṛte śivatejassaṃparkāt 
kṣubhitānāmikāmṛtapravāhatṛptāḥ netrādyadhiṣṭhātārassūryādayo 
viṣṇavantā devāḥ karturadhiṣṭhānopabrahmikā bhavanti | tadanaṃtaraṃ 
śarīragatapañcatriṃśattatvaśuddhyarthaṃ cinmātrācamanaṃ kuryāt ||
tatrāyaṃ viśeṣaḥ(-)suvarṇavarṇaṃ 
padmākṣamālāsrakkuṇḍikālaṃkṛtakaracatuṣṭayaṃ
<p. 9> caturvaktramātmatatvarūpaṃ brahmāṇaṃ dhyāyāmīti 
ātmatatvadhyānapūrvakaṃ hāṃ ātmatatvāyasvadheti prathamamācāmet 
| anena svaśarīre pṛthivyādimāyāṃte ekatriṃśattatvaśuddhiṃ bhāvayet | 
tato nīlavarṇaṃ cakrabāṇakamalacinmudrāśaṅkhakārmukaṃ 
kamaṇḍalvabhayamudrāṃkitakarāṣṭakamekavaktraṃ vidyātatvarūpaṃ 
viṣṇuṃ dhyāyamīti vidyātatvapūrvakaṃ hi vidyātatvāya 
svadhetyācāmet | anena śuddhavidyeśvarasadāśivākhyatritatvaśuddhiṃ 
bhāvayet | tatasphaṭikavarṇaṃ 
padmākṣamālāśūlakamaṇḍaludharakaracatuṣṭayaṃ pañcavaktraṃ 
śivatatvarūpaṃ rudraṃ dhyāyāmīti śivatatvajñānapūrvakaṃ huṃ 
śivatatvāyasvadhetyācāmet | anena śaktitatvaśuddhiṃbhāvayet | 
tato'stramantreṇa oṣṭhaṃ dviḥ pramṛjya hṛnmantreṇa netrādīnspṛśet | 
anyattu tattaddevatātṛptidhyānādikaṃ pūrvavatkuryāt || 
ityācamanakramaḥ ||
tato'bhiṣicya deveśaṃ niveśya kamalāsane | tatrāsanaṃ ca mūrti ca 
vidyādehaṃ ca pūjayet || āvāhyātha mahādevaṃ saṃpūjya 
sthāpanādibhiḥ | manasā snāpayitvā ca dadyādvastropavītakam || 
tatassampūjya deveśaṃ gandhapuṣpavibhūṣaṇaiḥ | dhūpaṃ dīpañca 
datvā'tha kuryādāvaraṇārcanam | naivedyaṃ mukhavāsañca tāṃbulaṃ 
ca samarpayet || dhūpamārātrikāṃ datvā pavitrañca samarpayet | 
dhārayitvā sitaṃ bhasma darpaṇādyaiḥ prapūjayet || baliṃ datvā'tha 
pādyādyaiḥ gandhapuṣpaiśca pūjayet | 
japastotranamaskārapradakṣiṇapurassaram || aṣṭapuṣpikayā'bhyarcya 
viśeṣārghyeṇa pūjayet || parāṅmukhārghyeṇodvāsya śivaṃ 
sāvaraṇādikam | kāle śivaṃ hṛdi dhyāyan aśnīyāttanniveditam ||
evaṃ saṃkṣipya kathitaḥ śivapūjāvidhikramaḥ | vivicya 
darśayiṣyāmo nātisaṃkocavistaram || tatra tāvadācamanamucyate | hiṃ 
śirase namaḥ | ājānupādā vā maṇibandhañca pāṇiṃ prakṣālya 
prāṅmukha udaṅmukhovā kukkuṭāsanasthaḥ pāṇidvayaṃ jānunī antarā 
nidhāya pāṇidvaye'pi kaniṣṭhikādiṣu aṅgulīṣu hāṃ hṛdayāya namaḥ | 
<p. 10> hoṃ śirasenamaḥ | hūṃ śikhāyainamaḥ | haiṅkavacāyanamaḥ | 
hauṃ netratrayāyanamaḥ | haḥ astrāyaphaḍiti vinyasya dakṣiṇapāṇiṃ 
gokarṇākṛtiṃ kṛtvā tena māṣamajjanārhaṃ jalaṃ gṛhītvā 
saṃvīkṣyāṃguṣṭhakaniṣṭhike muktvā tajjalaṃ śuklapakṣe somarūpaṃ 
kṛṣṇapakṣe sūryarūpaṃ ca vicintya tatprāśanena rasanāgrasthitāyā 
bhāratyāstṛptiḥ svasyāṃtardehaśuddhiñca dhyātvā antarāntarā 
hastaprakṣālanapūrvakaṃ brahmatīrthena svadhāṃtena mūlamantreṇa 
trirācāmet | tatassvasyānanaśuddhiṃ oṣṭhasaṃpuṭasthitāyāḥ 
praṇavadevatāyāḥ śuddhiṃvibhāvayan aṃguṣṭhamūlena dviroṣṭhau 
dvivāraṃ mārjayet ||

atha [bhasmadhāraṇam] ||

caturvidhaṃ bhasma kalpamanukalpamupakalpamakalpañcaiti | tatra 
vyādhyādirahitāṃ savatsāṃ gāṃ saṃpūjya tadīyaṃ gomayaṃ 
bhūmāvapatitaṃ ākāśasyameva gṛhītvā piṇḍīkṛtya viśoṣya 
pañcabrahmamantraiśśivavahnau dagdhvā mūlena viśoddhya 
yatsaṃpāditaṃ yaccāgnihotre samudbhūtaṃ tadubhayaṃ kalpam | vane 
śuṣkaṃ gomayaṃ gṛhītvā śivavahnau dagdhvā mūlena viśoddhya 
saṃpāditamanukalpam | aṭavīgṛhe govāse iṣṭakāpākādiṣu 
dāvāgnyādibhirdagdhaṃbhasmagṛhītvā vastreṇa saṃśoddhya 
gomūtreṇa piṇḍīkṛtya punaśśivāgnau dagdhaṃ mūlena 
śodhitamupakalpam | mantrādihīnaṃ brāhmaṇaiḥstrīśūdrādibhirvā śuci 
gomayaṃ gṛhītvā saṃpāditaṃ (śrotriyāgāraculyādivahnaudagdhamiti) 
śrotriyāgāracullyādibhyogṛhītaṃ vā yattadakalpam | 
akalpañcettadgṛhītvā'stramantreṇa digbandhanaṃ kṛtvā hoṃ 
īśānamūrdhnenamaḥ | heṃ tatpuruṣavaktrāyanamaḥ | huṃ 
aghorahṛdayāyanamaḥ | hiṃ vāmadevaguhyāyanamaḥ | haṃ 
sadyojātamūrtayenamaḥ | hāṃ hṛdayāyanamaḥ | hīṃ śirasenamaḥ | 
hūṃ śikhāyainamaḥ | haiṃ kavacāyanamaḥ | <p. 11> hauṃ netrāyanamaḥ 
| haḥ astrāyanamaḥ | hāṃ nivṛttikalāyainamaḥ | hrīṃ 
pratiṣṭhākalāyainamaḥ | hrūṃ vidyākalāyai namaḥ | hrauṃ 
śāntikalāyainamaḥ | hauṃ śāntyatītakalāyainamaḥ | iti 
pañcabrahmaṣaḍaṅgena kalāmantraissaṃśodhayet | evaṃ bhūtasya 
bhasmano dhāraṇaṃ dvividhaṃ uddhulanaṃ tripuṇḍraṃ ca | 
uddhūlanamapi dvividham | malasnānarūpaṃ vidhisnānarūpaṃ ca | 
ambhasāsnātasya dvividhe'pi bhasmasnāne adhikāraḥ | tadaśaktau 
kaṇṭhaparyantaṃ kaṭiparyantaṃ jānuparyantaṃ vā saṃkṣālya 
kṣālitāṃgānyārdravastreṇa saṃmṛjya vastrāntaraṃ paridhāyācamya 
tatohuṃphaḍaṃtāstreṇa dakṣiṇapādāṃguṣṭhotthitavahninā 
dehagatabāhyamalamātraṃ dagdhaṃ vicintyavahnisaṃbandhakṣubhita 
bindusthānasthitaśaktimaṇḍalasravadamṛtapravāheṇa śarīramāplāvayet | 
atha manasā mūlamantrannādāntamuccaranneva 
tatsaṃparkakṣubhitaśaktiparisṛtabahulāmṛtadhārayā dehamabhiṣiktaṃ 
bhāvayet | idaṃ mānasasnānamaśucitvaśaṅkāyāṃ 
sadāsarvatravidheyam | athavā tāmeva śaktiṃ gorūpāṃ dhyātvā 
tatpucchakiraṇāmṛtapravāheṇa śarīramāplāvayet | etadbhāvasnānam | 
gaṅgāyamunādidivyajalairvā śarīraṃ prokṣayet | 
tatkṣetramṛttikārajobhirvā 
pañcabrahmaṣaḍaṅgamūlamantrairdehaṃspṛśet | eṣāmekatamaprakāraṃ 
kṛtvā pañcabrahmaṣaḍaṅgamūlamantramekavāraṃ trivāraṃ vā japet | 
tataḥ prāgvadācamanadvayaṃ kṛtvā 
saṃbhāvitasakalabāhyābhyantarāśuddhinirāsakaṃ bhasmasnānaṃ 
kuryāt ||

[tatkramaḥ] ||

gobrāhmaṇadevatāgniguruvidyāsannidhiṃ pariddhṛtya 
mlecchāntyajakṛtasnadarśanādirahite mārgabhinne śucau deśe prāṅmukha 
udaṅmukho vā | niveśya kalpānukalparūpaṃ muṣṭimātraṃ 
viprādikrameṇa niṣkasārdhaniṣkadvayasārdhaniṣkadvayapramāṇaṃ vā 
bhasmādāya nair(-)ṛtakoṇe tadrākṣasāṃśaṃ nirasyākalpaṃ bhasma 
ceddigbandhanapūrvakaṃ <p. 12>pañcabrahmaṣaḍaṅgamantraissaṃśoddhya 
caturvidhamapi bhasma saptavāraṃ huṃphaḍantāstreṇābhimantrya tena 
viraktaścetpādādārabhyamastakānta maviraktaścenmastakādārabhya 
pādāntaṃ dakṣiṇāṃguṣṭhatarjanyapragṛhītena svalpena bhasmanā 
tadgamyakarapādavyatiriktāṅgasaṃsparśarūpa muddhūlanaṃ kuryāt | 
tadetanmalasnānam | tataṣṣaḍaṅgamantrajaptena 
bhasmaneśānādipañcabrahmamantraiḥ 
mūrddhahṛdayaguhyapādāvaryavānāṃ 
sadyojātamantreṇavāṃ'sayostaditarasarvāṅgānāṃ ca dakṣiṇahastena ca 
tadagamyāṅgānāṃ vāmahastena coddhūlanaṃ kuryāt | avaśiṣṭaṃ 
bhasma mūlena kuṃbhamudrayā śirasyabhiṣiñcet | evaṃ 
sarvāṅgoddhūlanaṃ brāhmaṇaḥ kuryāt | kṣatriyādayaḥ krameṇa lalāṭe 
caturaśratryaśravṛttāni kṛtvā kaṇṭhādadho nābherūrddhva 
muddhūlayeyuḥ | śūdraḥ uddhūlanaṃ varjayitvā 
vakṣyamāṇatripuṇḍrātmakameva vā bhasmasnānaṃ kuryāt | 
tadetattapasvivyatiriktaśūdraviṣayam | ata eva jñānaratnāvalyām (-) tapasvī 
cedvidhivadbhasmasaṅgṛhya tenasnānamācare dityādinā 
malasnānavidhisnānayoradhikāriviśeṣeṇa tapasvināmuktam | evaṃ 
kṣatriyavaiśyāvapyatapasvinau tripuṇḍrātmakameva vā bhasmasnānaṃ 
kuryātām | brāhmaṇādayañcatvārovā'pyuddhūlanāśaktau 
tripuṇḍrātmakameva bhasmasnānaṃ kuryuḥ | 
kevalatripuṇḍrātmakabhasmasnānābhiprāyeṇaiva keṣucidāgameṣvapi 
viprādikrameṇa niṣkaṃniṣkārddhaṃ tadarddhaṃ tadarddhaṃ ceti 
bhasmapramāṇamuktam | idaṃ ca vidhisnānarūpaṃ 
dīkṣitagṛhasthaissandhyātraye'pi jalasaṃyuktaṃ kāryam | 
strībhiryatibhiśca jalavarjitaṃ 
vrativānaprasthakanyakādibhirdīkṣāhīnaiśca 
madhyāhnātprāgjalasaṃyuktaṃ paratojalavarjitañca kāryam | evaṃ 
bhasmasnānānuṣṭhāne vastrāṃtaraṃ paridhāyācāmet | apidhāya vā 
kevalamācāmet ||
 
[tripuṇḍravidhiḥ] ||

|| atha tripuṇḍram ||

<p. 13> tacca varṇānāṃ krameṇa saptapañcacatustryaṃgulaṃ 
sarveṣāṃ vā lalāṭe hṛdi vāhvoścaturaṃgulaṃ 
avayavāntareṣvekāṃgulamityādinānāgamoktapakṣāṇāṃ madhye 
pūrvācāraprāptaṃ kañcitpakṣaṃ parigṛhya lalāṭādiṣu sthāneṣu 
tarjanīmadhyamānāmikābhistisṛbhiraṃgulibhiḥ kartavyam | lalāṭe 
madhyamānāmikāṃguṣṭhairvā kartavyam | tripuṇḍraṃ sāndravalitrayaṃ 
vyaktañca yathābhavati tathā kartavyam | tripuṇḍradhāraṇaṃ ca 
bhasmasnānañca trivaktraṃ trihastaṃ tripādaṃ triṇetraṃ bhasmarūṣitaṃ 
tāṇḍavaṃ kurvantaṃ raudraṃ raktapuṣpālaṃkṛtaṃ bhasmadevaṃ 
dhyātvā kartavyam | tripuṇḍrasthāne kulācāraprāptaṃ 
caturaśrārddhacandradīpaṃ tripuṇḍrāṃtaraṃ vā dhāraṇīyam | sarvañca 
puṇḍraṃ kevalabhasmanā candanayuktabhasmanā jalasiktena kāryam | 
lalāṭe yādṛśaṃ puṇḍraṃ tādṛśaṃ lalāṭahṛdayāṃsanābhiṣu 
pañcasu sthāneṣu śivamaheśvararudraviṣṇupitāmahadaivatyaṃ 
śirolalāṭagalāṃsahṛdayanābhipṛṣṭheṣvaṣṭasu sthāneṣu 
brahmavāṇīlakṣmīviṣṇuśivasūryāgnicandradaivatyaṃ 
lalāṭakandharāṃsabāhukūrparamaṇimrandhavakṣaḥ 
kukṣinābhipārśvadvayapṛṣṭheṣu ṣoḍaśasthāneṣu 
śivamaheśvarādipañcakavāmādinavakāśvidvayadaivatyaṃ 
śirolalāṭanetrakarṇanāsāvaktragalāṃsakūrparamaṇibandhahṛdaya(-)
pārśvanābhiguhyadvayasphigūrujānujaṅghāpādarūpeṣu 
dvātriṃśatsthāneṣu 
aṣṭamūrtyaṣṭavidyeśvarāṣṭadikpālāṣṭavasudaivatyaṃ 
karapādāṃgulipaṅktibhissaha ṣaṭtriṃśatsthāneṣu 
śivaśaktimaheśvarasadāśivaśuddhavidyāmāyāvidyākalārāgakālaniya
ti puruṣaprakṛtyahaṅkārabuddhimanaśśrotra 
tvakcakṣurjihvāghrāṇavākpāṇipādapāyupasthaśabdasparśarūparasagan
dhākāśavāyuvahnisalilapṛthivībhūtatatvadevatākaṃ 
deśakālādyapekṣayā yathāvasaṃbhavaṃ kartavyam | ṣaṭtriṃśat 
sthānapakṣe śivādyākāśāntatatvāni vṛttākārāṇi sphaṭikasūryakānta 
candrakāntagokṣīra <p. 14> 
vidrumaharitāñjanendrāyudhendrakopameghapadmarāga 
vidrumendranīlakuṃkumajapākusumendrāyudha sūryakāntakanaka durvā 
haridrā karavīra kālameghanīlamaṇi mauktika 
maṇikkakanakasphaṭikavarṇāni kṛṣṇaṃ caturaśraṃ vāyuṃ vṛttaṃ 
tryaśraṃ vahniṃ sitamarddhacandrākāraṃ jalaṃ pītaṃ caturaśraṃ 
pṛthivītatvañca vibhāvya hāṃ śivatatvarūpāya śivāyanama 
ityādimantraistattatsthāneṣu puṇṭrāṇi dhārayet | evaṃ 
pakṣāntareṣvapyūhaniyameva | 
tattatpūrvācāraprāptanānādivyāgamasmṛtipurāṇādyuktasthāna(-)
saṃkhyādivyāntaradevatāntarayuktāni vā  puṇṭrāṇi dhāraṇīyāni | iti 
bhasmadhāraṇakramaḥ ||

|| [rudrākṣadhāraṇavidhiḥ] ||

atharudrākṣadhāraṇam | tadapi bhasmadhāraṇavat śivapūjāyāṃ 
nityam | rudrākṣañca brāhmaṇādibhiḥ krameṇa śvetaraktapīta 
kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ grāhyam | uktavarṇālābhe brāhmaṇaiścaturvidhamapi 
dhāraṇīyam | raktādivarṇatrayaṃ kṣatriyaiḥ | pītādidvayaṃ vaiśyaiḥ | 
śūdraistu kṛṣṇameva dhāryam | sarvaṃ vā sarvairyathālābhaṃ dhāryam 
| śirasi kaṇṭhe karṇayorbāhvoṃrmaṇibandhayo rurasi ca 
svaśiraḥpramāṇādyucitasaṃkhyāviśeṣayuktaṃ vā | śirasi catvāriṃśat 
kaṇṭhe dvātriṃśat karṇayoḥ pratyekaṃ ṣaṭvāhvoḥpratyekaṃ 
ṣoḍaśamaṇibandhayoḥ pratyeaṃ dvādaśa vakṣasi aṣṭottaraśatamityevaṃ 
aṣṭacatvāriṃśadadhikaśatadvayasaṃkhyākaṃ vā | 
śikhāyāmekamityekādhikaṃ vā | śikhāyāmekaṃ mastake ṣaṭtriṃśa 
dvakṣasi pañcāśat sāṣṭaśatamupavītaṃ kaṇṭhakarṇa bāhumaṇibandhe 
pūrvavaditi pañcanavatyuttaradviśatasaṃkhyākaṃ vā | śirasi 
aṣṭottaraśatasaṃkhyā nābhyantamālikātrayaṃ kaṇṭhakarṇavakṣo 
bāhumaṇibandhe pūrvavaditi dvyaśītyuttarapañcaśatasaṃkhyākaṃ vā 
dhāraṇīyam | vajramāṇikyavaiḍūrya 
pravālamauktikarūpapañcaratnasahitarudrākṣadhāraṇaṃ jvaragnahapi 
śāca meha kuṣṭhabhagandharakumāragrahāpasmāranivārakaṃ 
makuṭakuṇḍalakarṇikāhārakeyūrakaṭakodarabandhādiṣu <p. 16> 
taddhāraṇa mapamṛtyuvināśakaṃ āyuśśrīkīrtivarddhanamanyatra 
rudrākṣadhāraṇāt | śikhāyāṃ taddhāraṇaṃ koṭiguṇaphalaṃ karṇayoḥ 
kaṇṭhe bhujayo ruttarottaradaśaguṇaphalaṃ hastayoraparimitaphalaṃ | 
ekavaktrasya rudrākṣasya śikhāyāṃ saṅgopya dhāraṇaṃ 
brahmahatyādoṣaśastrāgni coravṛṣṭyādimahābhayaharaṃ 
āyuśśrīkīrtivarddhanaṃ bhuktimuktikaraṃ sarvasiddhipradañca | 
dvivaktraṃ gohatyādoṣaharam | trivaktraṃ strīhatyādoṣaharam | 
caturvakramagamyāgamanābhakṣyabhakṣaṇadoṣaharam | pañcavaktraṃ 
sarvapāpaharam | ṣaḍvaktraṃ dakṣiṇakare dhṛtaṃ bhrūṇahatyāharam | 
saptavaktraṃ suvarṇasteyagohatyādoṣaharam | viṣaharañca | aṣṭavaktraṃ 
gurutalpadoṣaharaṃ sarvakūṭavyavahāradoṣaharañca | navavaktraṃ 
vāmakare dhṛtaṃ ca lakṣakoṭimahāpātakadoṣaharam | daśavaktraṃ 
grahapiśācavetālabrahmarākṣasasarpasiṃhavyāghrādibhayaharam | 
ekādaśavaktraṃ śikhāyāṃ dhṛtaṃ 
sahasrāśvamedhaśatavājapeyaśatasahasragodānaphalapradañca | 
dvādaśavaktraṃ kaṇṭhadeśedhṛtaṃ 
bahudakṣiṇagomedhāśvamedhaphalapradamaiśvaryābhivṛddhikāri 
daṃṣṭriśṛṅginvorāgnibhayaharaṃ sarvapāpakṣayakarañca | 
trayodaśavaktra matulabhogapradaṃ rasasādhanadhātuvādaghuṭikādi 
siddhikaraṃ pitṛmātṛbhrātṛstrīvadhadoṣaharam | caturdaśavaktraṃ 
sarvakāryasiddhikaraṃ sakalavyādhipāpaharaṃ jñānayogasiddhikarañca | 
mūrddhabhujakaṇṭhakarṇavyatirekeṇānyeṣvaṅgeṣu 
kṣayavṛddhisutakastrīsaṅgatimalamūtrotsarjanamatsyamāṃsalaśunakataka(-)
śipruśleṣmātakabhakṣaṇādisamayeṣu rudrākṣadhāraṇaṃ varjayet | 
rudrākṣadānakalpoktaprakāreṇa taddānaṃ sarva 
vedapurāṇāddhyayanasarvayajñadānānuṣṭhānasarvatīrthābhigamana(-)
phalapradaṃ sarvarogaharaṃ 
śataliṅgasthāpanaśataliṅgadānasahasraśrīmūrtidānasahasrakandhā(-)
dānaphalapradaṃ putramitrādisahitasakalaiśvaryabhogapradaṃ 
śivasāyujyadaṃ pratigrahīturapi śivabhaktasya tāvatphaladañca | 
paurṇamāsyamāvāsyāsaṃkrāntyuparāgajanmanakṣatrādidivaseṣu 
rudrākṣadhāraṇaṃ sarvapāpakṣayakaram | <p. 16> pūjākāle 
rudrākṣadhāraṇamīśānamantreṇa śirasikāryaṃ 
karṇayostatpuruṣamantreṇa kaṇṭhādiṣvaghoramantreṇa vakṣasi 
vyomavyāpimantreṇa ||

|| [sakalīkaraṇaprakāraḥ] ||

atha karanyāsāṅganyāsarūpaṃ sakalīkaraṇam | tat trividham (-) 
gṛhasthānāṃ sṛṣṭinyāsarūpaṃ brahmacāriṇāṃ sthitinyāsarūpaṃ 
yativānaprasthānāṃ saṃhāranyāsarūpaṃ | iha sṛṣṭinyāsarūpamucyate 
(-) karau gandhādilepitau kṛtvā vāmakaratalaṃ tatpṛṣṭhaṃ ca 
maṇibandhātsamārabhya dakṣiṇapāṇinā haḥ astrāya phaḍiti 
pratimārjanaṃ astramantreṇa dviḥparimṛjya tenaiva mantreṇa 
dakṣiṇakaratalaṃ tatpṛṣṭhañca vāmakareṇaikavāraṃ pramṛjya 
karāvāmaṇibandhamastratejasā vyāptau sañcintya 
saṃpuṭīkṛtyāṃguṣṭhadvayamaddhye amṛtarūpaṃ śaktimaṇḍalaṃ 
dhyātvā tenāmṛtena hāṃśaktayevauṣaḍiti kavacadvayamāplāvya 
yojitāṃguṣṭhadvayakarṇikekarasaṃpuṭakamale oṃ hāṃ 
śivāsanāyanamaḥ iti vinyasya tanmadhye oṃ hāṃ haṃ hāṃ 
śivamūrtayenama iti tejomayīṃ sthiravidyunnibhāṃ sitavarṇāṃ śivasya 
sūkṣmamūrti vinyasya hoṃ īśānamūrdhne namaḥ 
ityaṃguṣṭhayostarjanībhyāṃ vinyasya tarjanyādiṣu kaniṣṭhānta 
maṃguṣṭhābhyāṃ heṃ tatpuruṣavaktrāya nama ityādi 
caturomantrānvinyasya hāṃ hauṃ vidyādehāyanama 
ityaṃguṣṭhābhyāṃ karatalayoraṣṭatriṃśatkalāmayaṃ 
sadāśivātmakaṃ sthūlaṃ vidyādehaṃ vinyasya netrebhyonama iti netraṃ 
karatalayorvinyasya hāṃ hauṃ śivāyanama iti aṃguṣṭhānāmikābhyāṃ 
sadāśivadehavyāpakaṃ śivamāvāhayet | tataḥ kaniṣṭhikādiṣu hāṃ 
hṛdayāyanama ityādi netramantravyatiriktān pañcamantrānkrameṇa 
vinyasya vāmadakṣiṇakarau taditarakarābhyāṃ kavacāyanama iti 
avakuṇṭhya karadvayaṃ saṃyojya vauṣaḍantamūlena paramīkuryāt | 
nyastānāṃ hṛdayaśiraśśikhādīnāṃ kalānāñca 
bhinnabhinnavarṇānāmāvāhitaparamaśivatejasā'tidhavalena 
tattadūrṇatāptibhāvanaṃ paramīkaraṇam | tataḥ aṅganyāsaṃ kuryāt ||
<p.17> dakṣiṇāṃguṣṭhānāmikābhyāṃ hāṃ śivāsanāyanama iti 
dehamadhye hṛdi vā mūlādhārāt samudbhūtaṃ śvetaṃ 
śivasyāsanapaṅkajaṃ vinyasya oṃ hāṃ hāṃ hāṃ śivamūrtaye nama 
iti nābhīkandādi hṛdayādi vā bhrūmadhyaparyantaṃ tejomayīṃ śivasya 
sūkṣmamūrtiṃ vinyasya muṣṭiṃ badhvā'ṅguṣṭhena īśānamantraṃ 
mūrdhni vinyasya aṅguṣṭhayuktatarjanyādibhirvaktre hṛdi guhye 
pādayośca tatpuruṣamantrādīn krameṇa vinyasya(,) 
bhrūmadhyādibrahmarandhrāntaṃ hāṃ hauṃ vidyādehāyanama iti 
vidyādehaṃ vinyasya netramantraṃ netreṣu 
madhyamāṃgulibhistisṛbhirvinyasya tasminnaṃguṣṭhānāmikābhyāṃ 
hāṃ hauṃ śivāyanama iti paramaśivamāvāhayet | tato 
hṛdayaśiraśśikhāsthāneṣu 
svāṃguṣṭhayuktakaniṣṭhikānāmikāmadhyamābhirvinyasya 
kaṇṭhaprāvaraṇatvena stanamadhyāntaṃ kavacatarjanībhyāṃ vinyasya 
hastatalayorastramanāmikāṃguṣṭhābhyāṃ trivāraṃ vinyaset | 
sarve'pyete mantrā namontāḥ | astramantrastu huṃphaḍantaḥ  | tato 
huṃphaḍantāstramantreṇa tālatrayapurassaraṃ digbandhanaṃ kṛtvā 
kavacenāveṣṭya vauṣaḍantamūlena mahāmudrāṃ pradarśayet | 
mastakādipādāntaṃ hastābhyāṃ saṃsparśanaṃ mahāmudrā | 
tataśśivasamānarūpatā mātmanaścintayet | itthaṃ kṛtāṅganyāso 
baddhapaṭṭaśiroveṣṭanamastakatrāṇakaṃkaṭakakaragṛhītāstrabhīṣaṇo 
bhaṭa iva kṣudrāṇāmapradhṛṣyobhavatīti sakalīkaraṇam | atha 
sāmānyārghyapātra mastramantreṇa prakṣālya 
bindusthānasravadamṛtatayā bhāvitena śuddhajalena hāṃ hṛdayāya 
vauṣaḍiti āpūrya hāṃ hṛdayāyanama iti saptavāramabhimantrya 
kavacenāvakuṇṭhya gandhapuṣpādibhirabhyarcya dhenumudrāṃ 
pradarśayet | idaṃ sāmānyārghyajalaṃ śivamapahāya anyeṣāṃ 
dvārapālādīnāṃ sādhāraṇam ||

|| [dvārapālārcanam] ||

atha dvārapālārcanam | tasyāyaṃ kramaḥ (-) 
astrapañjaramadhyasthaṃ ātmānaṃ bhāvayan 
pṛthivyādimāyāntamekatriṃśattatvavargaṃ manasā'tilaṅghya 
śivapūjāmandiraṃ <p. 18> vṛttākāraṃ 
raktavarṇaśuddhavidyātatvātmakaṃ bhāvayan bhogamokṣakāmaḥ 
pūrvadvāre dvārapālānarcayet | kīrtivijayasaubhāgyakāmaḥ 
dakṣiṇadvāre | kevalaṃ mokṣakāmaḥ paścimadvāre | udagdvāre tu pūjā 
na karttavyā | sāmānyārghyodakena dvāramastramantreṇa saṃprokṣya 
bahirdvārapālānarcayet | te ca gaṇapatyādayaḥ | tatra 
dvārasyorddhvodumbaramukhe dakṣiṇavāmabhāgayormadhye ca 
gaṇapatisarasvatīmahālakṣmyaḥ upaviṣṭāḥ | vāmadakṣiṇavyavasthā ca 
devamapekṣya dvāre praviśantaṃ pūjakamapekṣya vā grāhyā | dvārasya 
bahiḥpradeśe dakṣiṇapārśve nandī dakṣiṇapārśva eva nandina 
uttarabhāge gaṅgā vāmapārśve mahākālaḥ vāmapārśva eva tasya 
dakṣiṇabhāge yamunā ca sthitāḥ | hāṃ gaṇapataye namaḥ | 
śyāmavarṇaṃ tatokṣasūtrapāśāṅkuśān puṣkareṇa bījāpūrañca 
dhārayantaṃ gaṇapatiṃ pūjayāmi | hāṃ sarasvatyai namaḥ | śvetavarṇā 
makṣamālāpustakadharāṃ vīṇāvādanavyāpṛtakaradvayāṃ sarasvatīṃ 
pūjayāmi | hāṃ mahālakṣmyai namaḥ | 
śrīphalakamalābhayavaradhāriṇīṃ 
ubhayapārśvasthitagajayugalahastoddhṛta hemakumbhāmṛta 
dhārābhiṣicyamānāṃ mahālakṣmīṃ pūjayāmi | hāṃ nandine namaḥ | 
aruṇajaṭāmakuṭadharaṃ triśūlākṣamālātarjanīmudgaradhāriṇaṃ 
sthūladehaṃ nandinaṃ pūjayāmi | hāṃ gaṅgāyai namaḥ | 
dhavalavarṇāṃ makaravāhanā mamṛtakalaśacāmaradhāriṇīṃgaṅgāṃ 
pūjayāmi | hāṃ mahākālāya namaḥ | kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ 
daṃṣṭrākarālabhrukuṭībhīṣaṇasthūladehaṃ 
śūlakapālamudgaratarjanīmudrādhāriṇaṃ mahākālaṃ pūjayāmi | 
hāṃ yamunāyai namaḥ | śyāmavarṇāṃ kūrmavāhanāṃ 
cāmarāmṛtakalaśadhāriṇīṃ yamunāṃ pūjayāmi | tattatsthāneṣu 
pūjayet | sarva ete dvārapālāḥ gaṅgāyamunevinā triṇetrāḥ | sarvecete 
dvārasamānamukhāḥ | ślokaiḥ kavāṭoddhāṭanaprārthanāpūrvaka 
mastramantreṇa kavāṭamuddhāṭya | hauṃ śivāyanama iti netrayorvinyasya | 
divisthitān vighnān divyadhyānadṛṣṭisantrastān kṛtvā | nabhogatān 
vighnān tarjanyaṃguṣṭhokṣiptapuṣpasantrastān kṛtvā | <p.19> bhūmigatān 
vighnān dakṣiṇapārṣṇighātatrayatrastān kṛtvā | astrāya huṃphaḍiti 
mantreṇa trividhān vighnānutsārayet | atha dvārasya dehalīśākhāṃ 
vāmāṃsaṃśrito dakṣiṇāṃ dehalīmaspṛśan dakṣiṇapādena 
śivamandiraṃ praviśya | hāṃ astrāya namaḥ | agnivarṇaṃ caturvaktraṃ 
śaktiśūlābhayavarānvitakaracatuṣṭayaṃ jaṭāmakuṭālaṃkṛta 
mardhenduśekharaṃ sakalavighnanivārakaṃ astraṃ pūjayāmīti 
dehalīmadhye śivamandirābhimukhatayā sthitaṃ astrarājaṃ prītyā 
parāvṛtya tadabhimukhaḥ pūjayet | rājā brahmāṇaṃ parāvṛtya 
tadabhimukhaḥ pūjayet | tataḥ hāṃ brahmaṇe namaḥ | kanakavarṇaṃ 
saśmaśrucaturānanaṃ tundilaṃ 
daṇḍākṣavalayasrakkamaṇḍaludhāriṇaṃ vāstvadhipatiṃ brahmāṇaṃ 
pūjayāmīti | brahmāṇamapi dehalīmadhya eva pūjayet | tato 
dvārasyābhyantare dakṣiṇapārśve hāṃ nandikeśvarāya namaḥ | 
raktavarṇaṃ triṇetraṃ candrakalālaṃkṛtajaṭāmakuṭaṃ 
mṛgaparaśunamaskāramudrānvitakaracatuṣṭayaṃ bāhumūle vetraṃ 
kaṭyāṃ kṣurikāṃ ca dhārayantaṃ bhasmarudrākṣadhāriṇaṃ 
vānarāsyaṃ nandikeśvaraṃ pūjayāmīti dvārasyābhyantaradakṣiṇe 
pārśve pūjayet | hāṃ suṃ suyaśāyai namaḥ | śyāmavarṇā 
mutpalālaṃkṛtadakṣiṇakarāṃsuyaśādevīṃ pūjayāmīti 
dvārasyābhyantare suyaśādevīṃ pūjayet | tataśśivaṃ pradakṣiṇīkṛtya 
nir(-)ṛtikoṇe brahmāṇaṃ pūjayet | pūjācaiteṣāṃ āsanadānāvāhana 
sthāpana sannidhāna sannirodhana pādyācamanārghya 
gandhapuṣ.padhūpadīpadānāntaṃ naivedyatāmbūladānāntaṃ vā 
pratyekaṃ kartavyā | aśaktau madhya eva sarvebhyo dvārapālebhyo nama iti 
gandhapuṣpādibhiḥ pūjayet | dvārapā devadevasya dvāraṃ rakṣata 
yatnataḥ | nirvārya vighnasaṅghāta mityājñā pārameśvarīti 
śivājñāṃ śrāvayet | idañca dvārapālārcanaṃ 
ātmārthapūjāyāmāgamabhedena vihitapratiṣiddhatvāt tadvikalpakamiti 
navaikalyam | tadakaraṇe napratyavāyaḥ karaṇe abhyudayaḥ 
ṣoḍaśigrahanyāyena ||
<p.20> atha pūjopakaraṇaṃ sarvaṃ śivāgre sannidhāpya devasya 
dakṣiṇabhāge āgneyabhāge vā uttarābhimukhaḥ sthitvā ruciraṃ 
svastikaṃ vā'bhyastamāsanamāsthāya 
pañcānāmātmasthānadravyamantraliṅgaśuddhīnāṃ maddhye 
prathamamātmaśuddhiṃ kuryāt | ayamūrddhvoduṃbarādiṣu 
gaṇapatyādipūjāprakāro yathoktalakṣaṇaśivamandirasadbhāve 
ātmaśuddheḥ pūrvaṃ kartavyaḥ | taddhyevaṃ vihitam | 
gṛhasyeśānadigbhāge śilāmayaṃ pakveṣṭakāmayaṃ 
śuddhadārumayaṃ mṛnmayaṃ vā caturaśramāyataṃ vṛttaṃ 
pūjāgṛhaṃ vā 
yajamānamadhyāṃguliparvatṛtīyaparvāntarālamadhyaparvadaivatyarūpa 
uttamamadhyamādhamabhedabhinnāṃgulicaturviṃśatyākhyahastamānena 
tripañcasaptanavatrayodaśasaptadaśaviṃśatyekaviṃśatidvātriṃ(-)
śaddhastānyatamapramāṇamekaṃ dvibhūmaṃ tribhūmaṃ vā 
pūjāgāraṃ nirmāya tatpañcadhā vibhajya tanmaddhyabhāge śilāsudhe 
varjayitvā mṛnmayī miṣṭakāṃcitāṃ vā catuṣkoṇastaṃbhayuktāṃ 
staṃbharahitāṃ vā ṣoḍaśāṃgulotsedhāṃ aṣṭādaśāṃgulotsedhāṃ 
vā vedikāṃ viracayya tadupari paścimabhāge ekatālavistārāyāmaṃ 
pañcāṃgulotsedhaṃ garbhagṛhasthānīyadeśaṃ tasya pūrvabhāge 
tādṛśāyāmavistārotsedhamarddhamaṇṭapasthānīyadeśaṃ ca kṛtvā 
tasya pūrvabhāge pañcatālāyāmaṃ 
catustālavistāramaṣṭāṃgulotsedhaṃ veramaṇṭapasthānīyadeśaṃ ca 
kalpayet | tatra garbhagṛhasthānīyadeśe sauvarṇaṃ rājataṃ tāmraṃ 
dārumayaṃ vā caturaśramāyataṃ vṛttaṃ vā peṭakaṃ sthāpayet | 
veramaṇṭapasthānīyadeśe dvihastāyata mekahastavistṛtaṃ vā 
dvādaśāṃgulocchrāyaṃ vā kamalabhūṣitapeṭakaṃ vinyasya tadupari 
namanīṃ tanmānāṃ prasārya tanmadhye jīvagajadantādinirmitaṃ 
pīṭhaṃ vinyasya tadupari suvarṇādiracitaṃ padmapīṭhaṃ 
paścimabhāgaracitaprabhāmaṇḍalasahitaṃ pūrvābhimukhaṃ sthāpayet | 
pūjāmaṇṭapañca prakīrṇakusumadhūmāmodacandana carcāvitāna 
muktādāmadhvajapatākādarpaṇa pradīpādibhiralaṃkurvīteti | evaṃ 
vidhapūjāmaṇṭapābhāve śivapūjāsthānameva tādṛśaṃ 
pūjāmaṇṭapaṃ manasi bhāvayet | śivapīṭhasamīpopaviṣṭaḥ tatraiva 
dvārapālārcanamātmaśuddheḥ pūrvaṃ paścādvā kuryāt || iti 
dvārapālārcanam || 

|| [ātmaśuddhiprakāraḥ] ||

<p.21> atha ātmaśuddhiḥ | sā dvividhā | pūjakajīvasya 
śivabhāvāpādanātmikā jīvaśuddhirūpā pūjakadehasya 
śivadehatvāpādanātmikā dehaśuddhirūpā ca | tatrāyaṃ 
jīvaśuddhiprakāraḥ | triḥ prāṇānāyamya dehāntargatamaśuddhavāyuṃ 
recakatriprāṇāyāmenāstramantreṇotsārya bāhyavāyunodaraṃ prapūrya 
pādāṃguṣṭhadvayādārabhya yāvanmūlādhāraṃ dvidhābhūtāṃ tata 
ūrddhvamābrahmaraṃdhramekībhūtā madhomukhaiḥ padmamukulaiḥ 
yuktāṃ śarīrāntarāletisūkṣmāṃ vidyullekhāmiva bhāsvarā 
mantassuṣirayuktāṃ suṣumnānāḍīṃ saṃcintya tanmadhye hūmiti 
śikhābījaṃ jvalantaṃ saṃcintya 
hṛtkaṇṭhatālubhrūmadhyabrahmarandhreṣvadhomukhatayā sthitāni 
padmamukulāni 
pūrakakuṃbhakarecakairvikasitottaṃbhitorddhvamukhīkṛtāni bhāvayitvā 
mūlādhārapradeśe dīpaśīkhāvat jvalantaṃ hūṅkāraṃ huṃphaḍiti 
santatoccāraṇena ūrddhvamudgacchantaṃdhyāyan tena pañcāpi 
brahmādigrandhīnpadmanālagraṃdhīn bhinnān bhāvayitvā huṃkāraṃ 
pratinivṛtya vāyuṃ virecayet | punarapi hūṅkāraṃ mūlādhāre dhyāyan 
pūrakavāyunopasaṃhṛtasarvaśarīravyāpakacaitanyaṃ hṛtpaṅkajāśritaṃ 
pūryaṣṭakarūpasūkṣmadehānvitaṃ jīvaṃ pūryaṣṭakādādāya 
sphurattārakākāramatisūkṣmamekākinaṃ hāmiti hṛdayabījasaṃpuṭitaṃ 
kṛtvā hūṅkāraṃ mūrdhni niveśya kuṃbhakaṃ kṛtvā 
vāyumūrddhvaṃ pravartayan saṃhāramudrayā tamādāya 
dvādaśāntaparyantaṃ nītvā tadupari sthiteparamaśive yojayet | evaṃ ca 
jīvaḥ sthūlasūkṣmāśuddhadehopādhinirmuktaḥ 
śivasāyujyaprāptanirmalajñānakriyāśaktiyuktaḥ śuddhobhavati | yadvā 
jīvaṃ dvādaśāntaparyantaṃ nītvā hṛdayakamala (hṛ*ya-) eva 
śaktimaṇḍalasaṃpuṭitaṃ kṛtvā bhūtaśuddhisamayakartavyadehadāhato 
rakṣet | tatrāyaṃ kramaḥ hṛtkamalakarṇikopari hāṃ sūryamaṇḍalāya 
namaḥ | hāṃ somamaṇḍalāya namaḥ | hāṃ agnimaṇḍalāya namaḥ | 
<p.22> hāṃ śaktimaṇḍalāya nama iti vinyasya hāṃ haṃ hāṃ ātmane 
namaḥ iti dehavyāpakaṃ jīvātmānamādāyopasaṃhṛtavyāpakarūpaṃ 
sphurattārakākāraṃ sañcintya taṃ śaktimaṇḍalasyopari vinyasya tasyopari 
ca śaktivahnisomasūryamaṇḍalāni krameṇa vinyasya 
ūrddhvādhasthitaśaktimaṇḍaladvayavinissṛtāmṛtapariplutaṃ bhāvayet | 
evaṃ jīvasya rakṣāmātraṃ kartavyam | tasya dīkṣākāla eva śuddhatvān 
pratidivasaṃ pūjāsamaye śuddhirnāpekṣiteti ||

|| [dehaśuddhiprakāraḥ] ||

atha dehaśuddhiḥ | sādvividhā sūkṣmadehaśuddhiḥ 
sthūladehaśuddhiśca | tatra 
śabdasparśarūparasagandhabuddhyahaṅkāramanorūpapuryaṣṭakātmaka(-)
sūkṣmaśarīraśuddhyarthaṃ 
hṛtkaṇṭhatālubhrūmaddhyabrahmarandhrasthiteṣu brahmādiṣu 
kāraṇapuruṣeṣu brahmaṇi śabdasparśau pravilāpayāmi | rasaṃviṣṇau 
pravilāpayāmi | rūmagandhau rudre pravilāpayāmi | 
buddhyahaṅkārautvīśvare pravilāpayāmi | manassadāśive 
pravilāpayāmīti sūkṣmaśarīrāṃśān śabdādīn pravilāpayet | tataḥ 
sthūlaśarīraśuddhyarthaṃ svaśarīre pādādi dvādaśāntasthāneṣu 
sthitāni vaśyamāṇasthānākṛtirūpādiyuktāni pañcamahābhūtāni 
dhyātvā pṛthivīmapsu pravilāpayāmi | apo'gnau pravilāpayāmi | agniṃ 
vāyaupravilāpayāmi | vāyumākāśe pravilāpayāmi | ākāśaṃ 
parāśaktau pravilāpayāmi | parāśaktiṃ paraśive 
pravilāpayāmītibhāvayet | iyaṃ svakāraṇeṣu 
pṛthivyādipravilāpanarūpā bhūtaśuddhiḥ | anyātattatguṇakṣapaṇarūpā 
| guṇakṣapaṇarūpā ca dvividhā | pratyekaśodhanarūpā 
parasparaśodhanarūpā ca | tatrādyāyathā(-)pādādyārabhya 
jānuparyantaṃ caturaśraṃ pītavarṇaṃ kaṭhinasvabhāvaṃ 
vajralāṃchitaṃ hāmiti hṛdayavījena pārthivabījasahitena yuktaṃ 
brahmaṇā kāraṇeśvareṇādhiṣṭhitaṃ nivṛttikalārūpaṃ 
pārthivamaṇḍalaṃ bhāvayāmīti vicintya hāṃ nivṛttikalāyai huṃphaḍiti 
mantreṇa pañcabhi ruddhātaiḥ pṛthivyā 
gandharasarūpasparśaśabdaguṇānutsārayet |
<p. 23> tatojānvādinābhiparyantamardhacandrākāraṃ śvetavarṇaṃ 
dravasvabhāvaṃ padmalāṃchitaṃ hīmiti śirovījenāpyavījasahitena 
yuktaṃ kāraṇeśvareṇa viṣṇunā'dhiṣṭhitaṃ 
pratiṣṭhākalārūpamāpyamaṇḍalaṃ bhāvayāmīti vicintya hrīṃ 
pratiṣṭhākalāyai huṃphaḍiti mantreṇa caturbhiruddhātai rapāṃ 
rasarūpasparśaśabdaguṇānutsārayet | tato 
nābhyādikaṇṭhaparyantantryaśraṃ raktavarṇaṃ pacanasvabhāvaṃ 
svastikalāṃchitaṃ hūmiti śikhāmantreṇāgnibījasahitena yuktaṃ rudreṇa 
kāruṇeśvareṇādhiṣṭhitaṃ vidyākalārūpamagnimaṇḍalaṃ 
bhāvayāmīti vicintya hūṃ vidyākalāyai huṃphaḍiti mantreṇa 
tribhiruddhātairagnigatān rūpasparśaśabdaguṇānutsārayet | tataḥ 
kaṇṭhādi bhrūmadhyaparyantaṃ ṣaḍaśraṃ kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ 
calanasvabhāvaṃ ṣaḍbindulāṃchitaṃ haimitikavacamantreṇa 
vāyubījasahitena yuktaṃ maheśvareṇa kāraṇeśvareṇādhiṣṭhitaṃ 
śāṃtikalārūpaṃ vāyumaṇḍalaṃ bhāvayāmīti vicintya hrauṃ 
śāntikalāyai huṃphaḍiti mantreṇa dvābhyāmuddhātābhyāṃ 
vāyoḥsparśaśabdaguṇāvutsārayet | tato 
bhrūmadhyādidvādaśāntaparyantaṃ vṛttākāraṃ dhūmravarṇaṃ 
ākāśasvabhāvaṃ binduśaktilāṃchitaṃ haḥ iti astramantreṇa saṃyuktaṃ 
sadāśivena kāraṇeśvareṇādhiṣṭhitamākāśamaṇḍalaṃ bhāvayāmīti 
vicintya hauṃ śāntyatītakalāyai huṃphaḍiti mantreṇa ekodvātena 
ākāśasya śabdaguṇamutsārayet | etāni pṛthivyādimaṇḍalāli 
hṛtkaṇṭhatālubhrūmadhyabrahmarandhragatāni vibhāvyaśodhayet | iti 
pratyekaśodhanaprakāraḥ || parasparaśodhanetvayaṃ viśeṣaḥ (-) sarvāṇi 
pṛthivyādimaṇḍalāni tattatśodhanasamaye pādādimūrdhāntavyāpakāni 
bhāvayet | pṛthivīśodhane tadguṇapañcakotsāraṇānantaraṃ pṛthivīṃ 
svaviruddhavāyvabhibhūtāṃ vāyvākārāpannāṃ vāyuśodhanasamaye 
vāyuṃ svaviruddhapṛthivyabhibhūtaṃ pṛthivyākārāpannañca bhāvayet | 
evaṃ jalānalāvapi tattadguṇotsāraṇānantaraṃ 
svaviruddhānalajalābhibhūtāvanalajalākārāpannau bhāvayet | 
ākāśaguṇotsāraṇānantaramākāśaṃ <p.24> 
nityatvavyāpakatvaśuddhatvāditadviruddhaguṇayuktaparaśaktyātmakapara(-)
mākāśābhibhūtaṃ tadākārāpannaṃ śuddhasphaṭikanirmalaṃ 
bhāvayediti | itthaṃ mahābhūtānāṃ pratyekaśodhanena 
parasparaśodhanenavā guṇakṣayāt kṣīṇaśaktikasya 
bhūtasamudāyātmakasya śarīrasya śoṣaṃ vibhāvya 
pādāṃguṣṭhotthitena śivaśaktyadhiṣṭhitena kālāgninā haḥ astrāya 
huṃphaḍiti mantreṇa śarīraṃ dagdhaṃ niravaśeṣaṃ 
nivṛtyādikalāmātraśeṣaṃ śarīragatadoṣamātraṃ vā dagdhaṃ 
bhāvayitvā 
dvādaśāntasthitaśaktimaṇḍalasva(khra)vadamṛtavarṣeṇāplāvayet | evaṃ 
śarīraśopārthamuktaśaktiprakāraṃ 
śarīrārambhakabhūtaguṇotsāraṇaṃ kṛtvā vā sthūlaśarīraṃ 
pṛthivyādipañcabhūtabījaṃ māyākṣetravinikṣiptaṃ 
dharmādharmamūlamindriyaśākhopaśākhaṃ 
śabdādiviṣayālocanapallavaṃ bhāvaprapañcakusumaṃ 
sukhaduḥkhaphalaṃ 
puruṣavihaṃgopabhogyamūrddhvamūlamadhaśśākhaṃ vaṭavṛkṣaṃ 
vibhāvya prāṇāyāmaṃ kurvan ṣaṇmātreṇa pūrakapūrvārdhena 
hlāmityuccārapañcakayuktena patrapuṣpaphalarahitaṃ stabdhaṃ vicintya 
pūrakāparārdhena hrīmityuccāracatuṣṭayayuktena 
snigdhapatrapuṣpaphalopetaṃ vibhāvya ekasminnevoddhātena 
dvādaśamātreṇa kumbhakena hrūmityuccāratrayayuktena 
savyapādāṃguṣṭhotthitena kālāgninā śuṣkaṃ dagdhaṃ vibhāvya 
recakapūrvārdhena hyemityuccāradvayayuktena bhasmībhūya dikṣu 
viprakīrṇaṃ vibhāvya recakāparārdhena haumityekoccārayuktena 
sphaṭikanirmalaṃ śuddhavyomarūpaṃ cintayitvā'mṛtenāplāvayet | evaṃ 
dehadāhaṃ kṛtvā 
yathoktasaṃkhyairuddhātaistattadguṇotsāraṇaparyaṃtāmeva vā 
guṇotsāraṇādibhāvanāṃ vinā pṛthivyādikaṃ bandhakatvānnivṛttaṃ 
bhavatītyanusaṃdhānapūrvakaṃ tattatsthāneṣu 
vāyumanodhāraṇāparyantameva vā bhūtaśuddhiṃ kuryāt | 
uddhātaśabdena uddhanyate utsāryate aneneti vyutpattyā bhūtaguṇānāṃ 
tadaśuddhervā utsāraṇasādhanamucyate | 
tattatkalāmantroccāraṇapūrvakaṃ pūrakaṃ kṛtvā suṣumnayā 
yāvadvādaśāntaṃ prāṇavāyorūrddhvapravartanarūpaṃ karma | tacca 
pūrakaṃ kṛtvā kuṃbhakakāle prāṇavāyorūrddhvaṃ preraṇaṃ kṛtvā 
taṃ pratinivartya dakṣiṇanāḍyā tadrecakaparyantam | <p.25> evaṃ ca 
ekaikasminnuddhāte pūrakādyāstrayastrayaḥ prāṇāyāmā iti pṛthivyāṃ 
pañcānāmuddhātānāṃ pañcadaśaprāṇāyāmāssaṃpadyante | 
jalādiṣu dvādaśa nava ṣaṭtrayaśca bhavanti | ekaikasmiṃśca 
recakādirūpe prāṇāyāme dvādaśamātrākālaḥ | tataścaikaika 
uddhātaḥ ṣaṭtriṃśanmātrākālo bhavati | yadvādhāraṇārthe 
kumbhakaprāṇāyāma eva dvādaśamātrākālaniyamaḥ | 
pūrakarecakayoryathāsaṃbhavaṃ kālo grāhyaḥ | 
jānumaṇḍalamadrutamavilaṃbitamekavāraṃ pradakṣiṇīkṛtya 
aṃgulisphoṭanakālo mātrākālaḥ | triḥpradakṣiṇīkṛtya 
aṃgulisphoṭanakāla iti tu siddhāntaśekharādiṣuktam | ayañca 
kaniṣṭhomātrākālaḥ | dviguṇo madhyamaḥ | triguṇa uttamaḥ | itthaṃ 
kālaviśeṣāvacchinnaprāṇavāyupravartanātmakamudghātamanapekṣya 
tattadguṇasamasaṅkhyakalāmantroccāraṇena 
tattadguṇotsāraṇānusandhānarūpāṃ vā ekavāraṃ 
tattatkalāmantroccāraṇena 
tattatkalātatvabhuvanavarṇapadamantrayuktānāṃ 
pārthivamaṇḍalādīnāṃ svātmānaṃprati 
pratibandhakatvanivṛtyanusandhānātmakapāśacchedamātrarūpaṃ vā 
bhūtaśuddhiṃ kuryāt ||
pārthivādimaṇḍalāni ca nivṛttipratiṣṭhāvidyāśānti 
śāntyatītakalāmayāni śarīre pādādi jānvādi nābhyādi kaṇṭhādi 
bhrūmadhyādi ca sthitāni | 
hṛtkaṇṭhatālubhrūmadhyabrahmarandhrāśritāni vā śatakoṭiyojana 
parimāṇamārabhya uttarottaradaśaguṇaparimāṇāni caturaśrārdhacandra 
trikoṇa ṣaḍaśra vṛttarūpāṇi vajrapadmadvaya svastika 
ṣaḍbiṃdvekabindulāṃchitāni pītaraktaśvetakṛṣṇadhūmravarṇāni 
kaṭhinadravoṣṇacalanāvakāśasvabhāvāni 
gandhādipañcacatustridvyekaguṇāni 
brahmaviṣṇurudramaheśvarasadāśivādhiṣṭhitāni 
binduyuktalakāravakārarephayakārahakārarūpaiḥ 
pārthivādibījairyuktāni bhāvanīyāni | tatra nivṛttikalāyāṃ 
pṛthivītatvamekaṃ aṣṭottaraśataṃ bhuvanāni kakāra ekovarṇaḥ 
aṣṭāviṃśatipadāni sadyojātahṛdayākhyau dvau mantrau | 
pratiṣṭhākalāyāṃ jalādiprakṛtyantāni <p. 26> trayoviṃśatitatvāni 
ṣaṭpañcāśatbhuvanāni khādimāntāścaturviṃśativarṇāḥ 
dvātriṃśatpadāni vāmadevaśirassamākyau dvau mantrau | 
vidyākalāyāṃ puruṣādimāyāṃtāni saptatatvāni 
saptaviṃśatibhuvanāni yādisāntāssaptavarṇāḥ ekaviṃśatipadāni 
aghoraśikhākhyau dvau mantrau | śāntikalāyāṃ śuddhavidyā 
maheśvaraśceti dve tatve aṣṭādaśabhuvanāni hakṣau varṇau 
dvādaśapadāni puruṣakavacākhyau dvau mantrau | śāntyatītakalāyāṃ 
sadāśivaśaktī dve tattve pañcadaśabhuvanāni svāṣṣoḍaśavarṇāḥ 
ekaṃ padaṃ mūleśānāstrākhyāstrayomantrāḥ | 
evamekādaśamantrātmako mantrādhvā | vyomavyāpī 
mantragatacaturnavatipadātmakaḥ padādhvā | pañcāśadvarṇātmakaḥ 
varṇādhvā | nivṛtyādipañcakalātmakaḥ kalādhvā | evaṃ 
sakalādhvagarbhāṇi pṛthivyādimaṇḍalāni vibhāvanīyāni | yadvā (-) 
saṃkṣepeṇa sarvādhvagarbhatvaṃ vibhāvanīyam | tadyathā (-) 
sadyādipañcamantrātmako mantrādhvā | 
jāgratsvapnasuṣuptituryaturyātītarūpa pañcāvasthātmakaḥ padādhvā | 
pādādi hṛdayādi vā pārthivamaṇḍalādisthānapañcakarūpo 
bhuvanādhvā | akārādivarṇatrayabindunādātmako 
mūlamantrapañcavarṇātmako vā varṇādhvā | pañcakalātmakaḥ 
kalādhveti | evaṃ vā sarvādhvagarbhāṇi vibhāvya prāguktaprakāreṇa 
saṃsthānavarṇasvabhāvalāṃchanabījamātrayuktāni vā vibhāvya 
śodhanīyāni | evaṃ pṛthivyādipravilāpanarūpā tattadguṇakṣepaṇena 
dehadāharūpā dehagatabāhyābhyantaradoṣamātradahanarūpā 
guṇakṣapaṇaṃ vinā kevaladehadāharūpā dāhaṃ vinā 
kevalatattadguṇakṣapaṇarūpā 
bandhakatvanivṛttyanusandhānātmakapāśacchedamātrarūpā ca 
bhūtaśuddhiḥ | sarvā'pyeṣā soddhātā niruddhātā ceti dvividhā | 
tattadguṇakṣapaṇaṃ ca pratyekaśodhanarūpaṃ 
parasparaśodhanādimantreṇa ceti dvividham | 
sarvādhvagarbhatvenasaṃsthānaṃ ca dvividhaṃ | bhūtacintanamapi 
sarvādhvagarbhatvena saṃsthānādimātreṇacetidvividhaṃ |
<p. 27> sarvādhvagarbhatvaciṃtanañca prapañcena saṃkṣepeṇaceti 
dvividhaṃ | 
evamuktaprakārāsubhūtaśuddhiṣupūrvācāradeśakālādyanusāreṇayā
kācidbhūtaśuddhiranuṣṭheyā | evaṃ 
bhūtaśuddhyātmikādehaśuddhiruktā | tatvaśuddhyātmikāṃ 
dehaśuddhiṃ kuryāt |
yathā(-)prakṛtyahaṅkārabuddhimanaḥ 
śrotratvakcakṣurjihvāghrāṇavākpāṇipādapāyūpasthaśabdasparśarūpa
rasagandhākāśavāyuvahnisalilabhūmitatvabhūtamarūpamaśuddhamātma
tatvaṃ sthūladehaṃ māyākalāvidyārāgakālaniyatipuruṣatatvarūpaṃ 
śuddhāśuddhaṃ vidyātattvaṃ sūkṣmadehaṃ 
śivaśaktīśvarasadāśivaśuddhavidyātatvarūpaṃ śuddhaṃ śivatattvaṃ 
paradehañca vibhāvya sthūladehaṃ sūkṣmadehe tatparadehe ca 
pravilāpayet | uktaprakārāṇāmanyatamaśodhanānuṣṭhānānantaraṃ 
hauṃ śāntyatītakalāyai nama 
ityādibhirmantraissūkṣmapañcakalāmayasya śuddhasūkṣmaśarīrasya 
sṛṣṭiṃ pañcabhiḥ kalāmantraireva sthūlapañcakalāmayasya 
sthūladehasya sṛṣṭiṃ ca tattadhvaṃsanapakṣe vibhāvya hāṃ śaktaye 
vauṣaḍiti śaktimaṇḍalasrutāmṛtadhārayā'plāvayet | 
tatohṛtkamalakarṇikāyāṃ hābhādhāraśaktaye namaḥ | hāṃ 
dharmāsanāya namaḥ | hāṃ jñānāya namaḥ | hāṃ vairāgyāya namaḥ | 
hāmaiśvaryāya namaḥ | hāṃ padmāya nama iti madhyāgneyādikoṇa 
catuṣṭayamadhyeṣu ṣaḍutthāsanaṃ vinyasya tatra 
punassthūlasūkṣmadehātmikāmavibhaktakaracaraṇādirūpāṃ mūrti 
hāṃ haṃ hāṃ ātmamūrtaye nama iti vinyasya hauṃ vidyādehāyanama iti 
aṣṭatriṃśatkalārūpaṃ sadāśivarūpaṃ dhyātvā śivāyanama iti 
dvādaśāntastha paramaśivasāyujyaṃ nirmalajñānakriyāśaktikaṃ 
yajamānamūrtirūpaṃ jīvātmānaṃ tatrāvāhya hṛdayādisthāneṣu 
hṛadayādimantrānvinyasya mūlena paramīkṛtya vauṣaḍantaśaktimantreṇa 
dvādaśāntasthitaśaktimaṇḍalasrutabahulābhūtadhārayā'bhiṣiñcet | tato 
daṇḍamuṇḍakalāśrīkaṇṭhādinyāsānkuryāt ||
tatrāyaṃ kramaḥ (-) śivāsanamavyaktāṃ śivamūrtiñca hṛdaye 
vinyaset | <p.28> homīśānamūrdhne nama iti samuṣṭikāṃguṣṭhāgreṇa 
mūrdhni | heṃ tatpuruṣavaktrāya nama ityaṃguṣṭhatarjanībhyāṃ mukhe | 
humaghorahṛdayāya nama iti aṃguṣṭhamadhyamābhyāṃ hṛdaye | hiṃ 
vāmadevaguhyāya nama ityaṃguṣṭhānāmikābhyāṃ guhye | haṃ 
sadyojātamūrtaye nama ityaṃguṣṭhakaniṣṭhikābhyāṃ pāde | 
homīśānāyorddhvavaktrāya namaḥ | heṃ tatpuruṣāya pūrvavaktrāya 
namaḥ | huṃ aghorāya dakṣiṇavaktrāya namaḥ | hiṃ vāmadevāya 
uttaravaktrāya namaḥ | huṃ sadyojātāya paścimavaktrāya nama 
ityūrddhva pūrvadakṣiṇottarapaścimasthāneṣu pūrvoktaprakāreṇa 
tattadaṃgulibhirvinyaset | evaṃ daṇḍavaktrabhaṃginyāsānantaraṃ 
saśaktikāḥ kalāśaktirahitā vā vakṣyamāṇasthāneṣudīkṣitabrāhmaṇaḥ 
nyāsaṃ kuryāt | kṣatriyavaiśyau yugāntare nyāsaṃ kuryātām | 
taditareśaktīrevanyaseṣu | yathā heṃ śaśinyainamaḥ | hoṃ aṅgadāyai 
namaḥ | homiṣṭadāyai namaḥ | hoṃ marīcyai namaḥ | hoṃ jvālinyai namaḥ 
| ityūrddhvapūrvadakṣiṇottarapaścimamūrdhasu 
samuṣṭikāṃguṣṭhamudrayā nyaset | heṃ śāntyai namaḥ heṃ vidyāyai 
namaḥ | heṃ pratiṣṭhāyai namaḥ | heṃ nivṛtyai namaḥ | iti 
pūrvadakṣinottarapaścimavaktreṣu aṃguṣṭhatarjanībhyāṃ nyaset | huṃ 
tamāyai namaḥ | huṃ mohāyai namaḥ | huṃ kṣudhāyai namaḥ | huṃ 
nidrāyai namaḥ | huṃ mṛtyave namaḥ | huṃ māyāyai namaḥ | huṃ 
bhayāyai namaḥ | huṃ tārāyai namaḥ | ityaṃguṣṭhamadhyamābhyāṃ 
hṛdayakaṇṭhāṃsadvayanābhijaṭharapṛṣṭhavakṣassu nyaset | hiṃ rajāyai 
namaḥ | hiṃ rakṣāyai namaḥ | hiṃ ratyai namaḥ | hiṃ pālyai namaḥ | hiṃ 
kāmāyai namaḥ | hiṃ saṃyamāyai namaḥ | hiṃ kriyāyai namaḥ | hiṃ 
buddhyai namaḥ | hiṃ kāryai namaḥ | hiṃ dhātryai namaḥ | hiṃ 
brāhmaṇyai namaḥ | hiṃ mohinyai namaḥ | hiṃ manonmanyai namaḥ | 
ityaṃguṣṭhānāmikābhyāṃ 
mūlādhāraguhyavṛṣaṇorudvayajaṃghādvayasphigdvayakaṭidakṣiṇapārś
veṣu vinyaset | hāṃ siddhyai namaḥ haṃ ṛddhyai namaḥ | haṃ dūtyai 
namaḥ | haṃ lakṣmyai namaḥ | haṃ medhāyai namaḥ | haṃ kāntyai namaḥ | 
haṃ svadhāyai namaḥ | haṃ dhṛtyai namaḥ | 
ityaṃguṣṭhakaniṣṭhikābhyāṃ 
pādadvayakaradvaghrāṇaśirobāhudvayeṣu nyaset | 
namassvāhādijātiṣaṭkayuktamaṅganyāsaṃ ca kuryāt | <p.29> 
yasyāvasaro'sti matikṣobhaśca na bhavati sa 
śrīkaṇṭhādinyāsaṣaḍadhvanyāsādikamapi kuryāt | evaṃ jīvaśuddhi 
dehaśuddhipūrvakanyastamantratanusvarūpeṇa vigraheṇa ca śivarūpatāṃ 
prāptaḥ śivārcanayogyo bhavati | nā śivaśśivamarcayedityāmananti | 
evaṃ jīvadehaśuddhikaraṇāśaktau nyāsamātraṃ kuryāt | nyāsasyāpi 
kṛtsnasya karaṇāśaktau daṇḍanyāsamātraṃ ṣaḍaṅganyāsamātraṃ vā 
kuryāt | tāvataiva dehātmanośśuddhyāśivarūpatāpattyā ca 
śivārcanayogyobhavati || evaṃ kṛtāṅganyāso'ntaryāgaṃ kuryāt ||

|| [antaryāgakramaḥ] ||

tasyāyaṃ kramaḥ (-) antarhṛdayāvakāśe divyaratnamayaṃ 
śivārcanamaṇḍapaṃ manasā saṅkalpya tatra śivārcanopayuktāni 
sarvāṇi dravyāṇi manasopanīya viśoddhya 
dvādaśāntasthitacandramaṇḍalagaladamṛtadhārayā'rghyapātrādipū(-)
raṇaṃ tatsaṃskārañca kṛtvā dvārapālārcanaṃ 
vidhāyavakṣyamāṇaprakāreṇagaṇeśagurubandanānujñāprārthanā(-)
pūrvakaṃ 
māṇikkavarṇanābhikandasamutthitanīlavarṇanālañcātidhavala(-)
varṇāṣṭhadalahṛdayakamalakarṇikākārasaṃsthitakuṇḍalinīśaktirūpa(-)
biṃdvātmake pīṭhe śravaṇāṃguṣṭhasaṃyogādhigamyanādarūpaṃ 
dīpaśikhākāraliṅgaṃ vicintya pīṭhe vakṣyamāṇaprakāreṇa 
śaktyādiśaktyantaṃ śivāsanamabhyarcya liṅge śivamūrti vidyādehaṃ 
cābhyarcya tatra paramaśivamāvāhanādikrameṇa 
dhyātvā'ntassaṃskārairabhyarcya 
dvādaśāntasthitabahulāmṛtadhārayābhiṣicya vastrābharaṇādibhiḥ 
vairāgyacandanena cālaṃkṛtyāhiṃsāpuṣpaṃ samarpya 
yāmityādiprakāreṇa ahiṃseṃdriyanigrahakṣamādāna 
jñānatapassatyabhāvarūpairaṣṭabhiḥ puṣpaiḥ abhyarcayet | tato manasi 
pātre prāṇamagni mahaṅkāradhūpaśikhāṃ ca saṅkalpya dhūpaṃ 
dadyāt | śivajñānameva dīpaṃ saṅkalpya dadyāt |

