<p.32> sya vāmabha(,) niveśya vastrapūtaśuddhajalaparipūrṇajalapātraṃ ca 
dakṣiṇabhāgeniveśya ātmārcanādhareṇapūjārthaṃ gandhapuṣpādikaṃ 
śivārthadravyebhyaḥ pṛthagniveśya arghyapādyācamanīyajalāni pūrayet | 
catvāryarghyāṇi || sāmānyārghyaṃ viśeṣārghyaṃ nirodhārghyaṃ 
parāṅmukhārghyamiti | dvārapālāvaraṇadevatādīnāṃ 
sāmānyārghyaṃ śivasyārghyakāleṣu viśeṣārghyaṃ śivasyaiva 
nirodhanasaṃskārasamaye nirodhārghyaṃ visarjanasamaye 
parāṅmukhārghyam | caturṇāmeteṣāmarghyāṇāṃ catvāri pātrāṇi 
daśapalapramāṇena vā pañcapalapramāṇena vā 
sārdhadvipalapramāṇena vā yathā sambhavapramāṇena vā 
suvarṇarajatatāmrānyatamadravyeṇa vā pañcaparvonnatāni 
pañcaparvavivṛtāni vṛttākārāṇi caturaśrākārāṇivā 
bahiraṣṭadalapadmāṃkitāni ekāṃgulipramāṇāni 
aṃgulacaturthāṃśaghanāni uktaprakārādardhapramāṇānivā 
tadardhapramāṇānivā arghyapātrāṇi grāhyāṇi | (suvarṇādyabhāve 
śuktikhaḍgaśṛṅgaśilādārunālikerakaraṃkādinirmitā 
nivānavamṛtpātrarūpāṇi vā 
palāśābjakadalīdalādikṛtaparṇapuṭarūpāṇi vā'rghyaṃpātrāṇi 
grāhyāṇīti pustakāntare'dhikaṃ vartate) 
pādyācamanapañcagavyapañcāmṛtagandhadhūpadīpapātraghaṇṭā(-)
dīnyapi pūrvoktadaśapalādipramāṇenaiva kartavyāni | tatra pādyapātraṃ 
ṣaḍaṃgulavistāraṃ caturaṃgulotsedhaṃ caturaṃgulavistārotsedhapādaṃ 
caturaṃgulanāsikaṃ ekāṃguloṣṭhaṃ tadardhamānaṃ 
tadardhamānaṃvā kartavyam | (ācamanapātraṃ) 
pādyakṣe(?)papātramaṣṭāṃgulotsedhaṃ ṣoḍaśāṃgulavistāraṃ 
caturaṃgulotsedhamaṣṭāṅgulavistārapādayuktaṃ 
ekāṅguloṣṭamuktaprakārārdhapramāṇaṃ tadardhapramāṇaṃ vā 
vṛttakaṅkaṇayuktapārśvadvayaṃ kartavyam | ācamanapātraṃ 
dvādaśāṃgulotsedhaṃ vistārakukṣikaṃ ṣaḍaṃgulavistāreṇa 
ṣaḍaṅgulotsedhenavā pādena yuktaṃ dvyaṃgulatryaṃgulotsedhakaṇṭhaṃ 
ekāṃguloṣṭhaṃ tryaṃgulavistāramukha 
maicchikapramāṇamukulākāravitānasaṃyuktaṃ 
caturaṃgulapramāṇatrivaktrayavapramāṇarandhramūlaprabhṛtikramāpacita
parimāṇanāsikāyuktaṃ tadardhaparimāṇaṃ vā kartavyaṃ yadvā 
pādyācamanīyapātre apyarghyapātradevavṛttākārekartavye | <p. 33> 
ācamanakṣepapātramapipādyakṣepapātravatkartavyam | 
arghyapādyācamanādhārayaṃtrikāstu tripadīrūpāḥ 
trivaktrapādasaṃyuktāḥ aṣṭāṃgulotsadhoḥ pādādūrddhvabhāge 
valayasyādhastātsiṃhmavaktrāṃkitāḥ kartavyāḥ | suvarṇādyasaṃbhave 
pādyādipātrāṇyapi arghyapātravat śilādārumayapatrapuṭādirūpāṇi 
grāhyāṇi | tatra sāmānyārghyadravyāṇi tilataṇḍulāḥ | viśeṣārghyasya 
elālavaṅgakarpūratiṃvūjātiphalamuravrīhitilāvā 
jalakṣīrakuśāgrataṇḍulasumanastilayavasiddhārthāvā 
darbhadūrvādivrīhitilakṣarinīrasiddhāddhārthāvāyavasiddhārthaṃvyatiri
ktādarbhādayaṣṣaḍvādarbhasiddhārthajalatilāścatvāro vā 
dūrvākuṅkumakarpūrāstrayo vā dravyāṇi | nirodhārghyasya 
darbhadūrvāyavataṇḍulasiddhārthāḥ pañcadravyāṇi | 
tilasahitāṣṣaṭparāṅmukhārghyasya dravyāṇi | 
pādyasyadūrvācandanasiddhārthośīrahrīberakuṅkumāni ṣaḍvā | 
tānyeva kuṃkumaṃ vinā pañcavā | dūrvāsiddhārthacandanośīrāṇi 
catvārivā hrīberacandanośīrāṇi trīṇi vā dravyāṇi | ācamanīyasya 
elālavaṅgakarpūrajātīkoṣṭhatiṃbutriphalacandanośīrāṇi(-)ekādaśavā(-)
elālavaṅgakarpūratiṃbūmurajātiphalāniṣaḍvā 
elālavaṅgakarpūrahrīberajātiphalāni pañcavā elāvaṅgakarpūrāṇi 
triṇivā dravyāṇi | elādīni cārghyādidravyāṇi pratyekaṃ 
uttamamadhyamādibhāvena 
aśīticatvāriṃśadviṃśatidaśapañcavrīhiparimitāni deyāni ||

|| [pādyādipūjā] ||

athapādyādipūjāvidhānamucyate | 
pādyācamanīyasāmānyārghyaviśeṣārghyanirodhārghyaparāṅmu(-)
khārghyapātratripadīrdevasyapurato vāmādikrameṇa vinyasya tāsāṃ 
pādeṣu brahmaviṣṇurudrān valayeṣviḍādhāraśaktiṃ cābhyarcya 
pādyādipātrāṇyastramantreṇa saṃkṣālya tripadīṣu vinyasya 
astramantreṇa vauṣaḍantahṛdayamantreṇa vā śuddhatoyenāpūrya | 
kavacamantreṇa pādyādidravyāṇi tattatpātreṣu nikṣipet | dravyālābhe 
śuddhodakapūraṇamātraṃ kuryāt | <p.34> tataḥ pādyādipātrāṇi 
biṃdvantaṃ samuddhṛtya binduprasṛtāmṛtadhārāmayena 
gaṅgādisakalatīrthodakenāpūrṇāni bhāvayitvā 
yantrakāṇāmuparisthāpayet | athavā 
bindusthānādaṅkuśamudrayādivyāmṛtamayaṃ gaṅgāditīrthamākṛṣya 
saṃhāramudrayā tamādāya vauṣaḍantahṛdayenodbhavamudrayā 
yantrakāṃtastheṣveva pādyādipātreṣu vinikṣipet | tato viśeṣārghyajale 
śivāsanamūrtipañcabrahmavidyādehanetra mūlāṅgāni vinyasya mūlena 
gandhapuṣpākṣataissaṃpūjya brahmāṅgamūlairabhimantrayet ||
kevalaṃ vā brahmāṅgamūlairabhimantrayet | nirodhārghyaṃ 
brahmabhiḥ 
parāṅmukhārghyamaṅgaissāmānyarghyamastramantreṇābhimantrayet | 
pādyācamanīye brahmabhiraṅgairastreṇa vā abhimantrayet | tato'streṇa 
digbandhanaṃ kṛtvā kavacenāvakuṇṭhanaṃ kṛtvā 
vauṣaḍantaśaktimantreṇa dhenumudrāṃ pradarśyāmṛtīkuryāt | 
pādyādiparāṅmukhārghyaparyanteṣu 
tripadīvinyāsādyamṛtīkaraṇāntaṃ pratyekaṃ kāṇḍānusamaye na vā 
kuryāt | atha parāṅmukhārghyasamīpe śaṅkhapūjākartavyā | 
prasthamānikāḥ kuḍavajalapūraṇīyāśśṅkhā 
uttamamadhyamakanīyāṃsaḥ tathā mūlāgramūlasthūlāgrasthūlāḥ 
puṃstrīnapuṃsakarūpāḥ śaṅkhārghyamūlevasuṃdharā valaye sūryaḥ 
kukṣau viṣṇuḥ pārśve candramāḥ dhārāyāmaghoraḥ 
mukhesaptatīrthāni ca santi | tathāpi śaṅkho 
bahirmūlāgrayorasthivadaśucirititayorhemaratnādibhūṣitaḥ kartavyaḥ | 
evaṃ bhūtaṃ śaṅkhaṃdagdhantuṣaśodhitāstramantrakṣālitaṃ 
pūrvavadarcitāyāntripādyāṃvinyasya viśeṣārghyavatpūjayitvā 
ātmānaṃ śirasi tattoyaistrivāramabhiṣiñcet | evaṃ 
bahupātrasaṃpādanatatpūjanāśaktau nirodhārghyaparāṅmukhārghye 
nirodhārghyajalenaiva kartavye | viśeṣārghyajalenaiva vā 
arghyapātratrayamapi kartavyam | evaṃ pādyācamanīyadvayamapi 
viśeṣārghyeṇaiva kartavyam | viśeṣārghyasyāpi pātrāntarābhāve 
śaṅkhajalenaiva pādyācamanadvaya marghyatrayaṃ ca kartavyam | 
āvaraṇadevatādyarthaṃ sāmānyārghyamātraṃ pātrāntare saṃskāryam 
| <p.35> evaṃ pātrasaṅkocapakṣe yadīyajalena upacārāntaraṃ kriyate 
tadīyameva pātramādāya tatsaṃskārāḥ kartavyāḥ | anyadīyasaṃskārā 
api vā paridhau yūpadharmavadaviruddhāḥ kartavyāḥ | athavā nityaṃ 
viṣuvāyanoparāgādiṣu kartavyam ||

|| [pañcagavyavidhiḥ] |

atha pañcagavyavidhānamucyate (-) devasya pūrvabhāge 
īśānādibhāge vā dvihastamātraṃ hastamātraṃ vā caturaśraṃ 
gomayenopalipya caturbhiḥ prācīnaiścaturbhirudīcīnaiśca sūtraiḥ 
pratyekaṃ tālapramāṇāni navakoṣṭhānyuddhṛtya pratikoṣṭhaṃ 
āḍhakaṃ tadarddhamānān vrīhīn tadarddhamānān taṇḍulānkuśānvā 
prasārya uttarābhimukhaḥ pratīcīṃ diśaṃ pañcasaṃkhyairudagagraiḥ 
prāgagraiśca darbhaiḥ paristīrya paritaḥ puṣpairalaṅkṛtya 
śivatatvāyanamaḥ | sadāśivatatvāya namaḥ | vidyātatvāyanamaḥ | 
puruṣatatvāya namaḥ | kālatatvāya namaḥ | pṛthivītatvāya namaḥ | 
jalatatvāya namaḥ | vāyutatvāya namaḥ | prakṛtitatvāya namaḥ  iti 
maddhyapūrvadakṣiṇottarapaścimāgneyanai(-)ṛtamārutaiśānakoṣṭhāni 
saṃpūjya sauvarṇāni kāṃsyāni abhinnākṛṣṇanavamṛnmayāni vā 
pātrāṇi saṃkṣālya navasu koṣṭheṣu saṃsthāpya supratiṣṭhapātrāya 
namaḥ | suśāntapātrāya namaḥ | tejomayapātrāya namaḥ | 
ratnodakapātrāya namaḥ | amṛtapātrāya namaḥ | avyaktapātrāya namaḥ | 
sūryapātrāya namaḥ saṃyuktapātrāya namaḥ | avyaktapātrāya namaḥ iti 
prāguktakoṣṭhakrameṇa pātrāṇisaṃpūjya | tāmravarṇāyāḥ kṣīraṃ 
trikuḍavaṃ madhyapātre śuklavarṇāyāḥ dadhi dvikuḍavaṃ pūrvapātre 
kapilavarṇāyāḥ ghṛtaṃ kuḍavaṃ dakṣiṇapātre śyāmavarṇāyāḥ 
gormūtraṃ prasthaṃ uttarapātre(,) kṛṣṇavarṇāyāḥ gomayaṃ kuḍavaṃ 
pramāṇaṃ pañcakuḍavajalasaṃyuktaṃ vastrapūtaṃ paścimapātre 
kapitthaphalapramāṇānitadarddhapramāṇāni tadardhapramāṇānivā 
taṇḍulāmalakaharidrāpiṣṭā nyāgneyanair(-)ṛtavāyavyakoṇapātreṣu <p.36> 
kuśodakaṃ ṣaṭtriṃśatpañcaviṃśatidvādaśañca tadardhakṛtena 
pradakṣiṇaṃ darbhaṃ vāyavyaparivītena hastamānena tālamānena vā 
dvyaṅgulagranthinā caturaṅgulāgreṇa kūrcena 
saṃyuktamāḍhikamānakaṃ gandhadūrvāyuktamaiśānakoṇapātre ca 
hṛdayena prakṣipya kṣīrādigomayāntāni pañcagavyāni 
kramātpañcacatustri dvayekasaṃkhyairīśānādimantraiśśālipiṣṭaṃ 
hṛdayenāmalakaṃ śirasā haridrāṃ kavacena kuśodakaṃ 
ṣaḍvārāvṛttabrahmapañcakenābhimantrayet | tadanantaraṃ gomayaṃ 
gomūtre tadubhayaṃ ghṛte tattrayaṃ dadhni taccatuṣṭayaṃ kṣīreca 
hṛdayamantreṇa nikṣipya tatraiva kuśodakaṃ mūlamantreṇa kṣipet || 
pañcabrahmaṣaḍaṅgairabhimantrya astreṇa saṃrakṣya kavacenāvakuṇṭhya 
dhenumudrāṃ pradarśya gandhapuṣpairabhipūjyāstramantreṇa 
dhūpadīpau pradarśya mūlenābhimantrayet |

|| [pañcāmṛtavidhiḥ] ||

atha pañcāmṛtavidhānamucyate (-) tatpūjā pañcagavyapūjāyāḥ 
prāgbhāge kartavyā | tatra pātrapūjāparyantaṃ 
pūrvamdhyādipaścimānteṣu kṣīradadhighṛtamadhuśarkarāḥ pratyekaṃ 
prasthamānāḥ pādonaprasthamānāvā 
prasthārddhamānāvā'gneyādikoṇeṣu yathāsaṃbhavaṃ 
kadalīpanasāmraphalānīśānakoṇe kuśodakavadgandhodakaṃ 
tattatsthānasthitānāmabhimantraṇaṃ pūrvavat | śarkarā 
gomayavajjalayuktā | saṃyojanantu nāsti | athavā 
saṃyojanayuktapañcāmṛtavidhānaṃ kuryāt | tasyāyaṃ kramaḥ (-)
pūrvavadupakḷpte vrīhimaye sthaṇḍile pūrvādidikṣu maddhyeca pañca 
koṣṭhāniśānadiśi aṣṭadalapadmañca vilikhya 
śivaniyatikālavyaktāvyaktasumaṅgalānāmabhiḥ 
ṣaḍbhirmaddhyādikrameṇa tānisaṃpūjya teṣu ṣaṭpātrāṇi 
amṛtasomavidyāratnodaka sudhāprīta suraprītanāmabhissaṃpūjya 
pūrvoktakrameṇa maddhyādipātreṣu pañcāmṛtāni aiśānakoṇapātre 
nālikerodakañca nikṣipya tāni pañcagavya <p.37> kuśodakavadabhimantrya 
śarkarādīni gomayādivat krameṇa kṣīre saṃyojya 
kuśodakavannālikerodakaṃ ca saṃyojayet | tatassamṛddhaṃ kadalīphalaṃ 
mūlābhimantritaṃ kṣiptvā mūlena mardayet | 
pañcagavyavadgandhapuṣpādyupacarāṃśca kuryāt | pañcagavyādyartha 
muktadravyābhāve dadhikṣīreparasparaṅgomayagomūtre ca parasparaṃ 
pratinidhiḥ | śarkarāyā ikṣurasaḥ | 
pañcagavyādyuktapātradravyaparimāṇālābhe 
gomayamaṅguṣṭhārdhamānaṃ 
gomūtraghṛtadadhikṣīrakuśodakānyekadvitripañcaikapalāni grāhyāṇi | 
pañcāmṛte kṣīrādīni devasya liṅgasekārhāṇigrāhyāṇi | 
gavāmuktavarṇānāmabhāve nirdoṣāyāssavatsāyā rogagarbharahitāyā 
goḥ kṣīrādīni grāhyāṇi | kṣīraṃ vatsalālājalāspṛṣṭaṃ 
dadhyamathyaṅgomayamākāśasthaṃ ghṛtaṃ gomūtraṃ ca vastrapūtaṃ 
grāhyam ||

|| [snapanodakavidhānam] ||

atha snapanodakavidhānumucyate(-)śuddhaṃ jalakumbhamādgāya 
śivāllabdhānujñaḥ praśastavarṇagandharasanadītaṭākaṃ 
devakhātādiśuddhatīrthaṃ gatvā tajjalaṃ 
brahmāṅgairaṃbhimantryāstrasaṃkṣālitaṃ kuṃbhaṃ vastrapūtena tena 
hṛdayamantreṇāpūrya āhṛtya devasya dakṣiṇabhāge sthāpayitvā 
elośīralavaṅgakarpūra vāripāṭalotpala padmakaravīrādivāsitaṃ kuryāt | 
idaṃ pañcagavyapañcāmṛtastapanodakasaṃvidhānaṃ 
ātmaśuddherdvārapālārcanāccaprāgeva kartavyaṃ | snapanodakaṃ 
sūryarahitekālenāhartavyaṃ | puṣ.pāharaṇamapi 
pūjakenasvayamevakartavyaṃ | aśaktau samayālābhe ca 
puṣpodakāharaṇaṃ 
gandhagharṣaṇanaivedyapākādivatsnātairvāśuddhavastraiḥ 
pavitrapāṇibhiḥparicārakaiḥ karaṇīyaṃ | chinnepiṣṭa iti nyāyasāmyāt | 
evaṃ sakalamapi vakṣyamāṇopayogadravyajātaṃ sannidhāpya 
tasyaśuddhiṃ kuryāt ||
|| dravyaśuddhiḥ ||

tatrāyaṃkramaḥ (-) aṅguṣṭhānāmikāspṛṣṭena cakṣuṣā mūlena 
nirīkṣyamāṇaṃ dṛkkriyecchātmakairarkavahnisomanetreḥ kramāt 
śuṣkaṃ dagdhamamṛtāṣlāvitaṃ ca bhāvayet | 
tataśśuddhyarthamastramantreṇa patākayā prokṣya 
cicchaktyabhivyaktyarthaṃ astramantreṇaiva madhyamāṃgulyā tāḍayet | 
tatovauṣaḍantakavacena tatsarvaṃ viśeṣārghyajalena śaṅkhajalena vā 
kuśapuṣpairabhyukṣan tāḍitātpāṣāṇādvahnisphuliṅgādivatdravyajātā 
cidagnisphuliṅgānāmudgatiṃ dhyāyet | evaṃ 
nirīkṣaṇādisaṃskāracatuṣṭayena dravyajātamaśuddhena māyārūpeṇa 
parityaktaṃ śuddhacicchaṃktyātmakaṃ śivayogyatārhaṃ bhavati | 
tatassadyojātena gandhaṃ vāmadevena vastraṃ aghoreṇābharaṇaṃ 
tatpuruṣeṇa naivedyamīśānena puṣpaṃ hṛdayamantreṇānyāni 
śivārthadravyāṇi āvaraṇapūjādyarthadravyāṇi cābhimantrayet | 
tatassarvaṃdravyajātamastreṇa saṃrakṣya kavacenāvakuṇṭhya 
vauṣaḍantaśaktimantreṇa dhenumudrayā'mṛtīkṛtya śivārthaṃ kalpita 
metatsarvaṃ śivātmakameveti bhāvayan gandhapuṣpadhūpadīpaiḥ 
hṛdayāstramantrābhyāṃ pūjayet | 
tatassvaśarīrasyārghyajalabindumastreṇa nikṣipya svāsane 
śivāsanāyanama iti puṣpandatvā svadehe śivamūrtiṃ vinyasya phāle 
candanatilakaṃ kṛtvā | svaśirasi puṣpaṃ svāhāntamūlena 
svaśirasyevārghyaṃ ca dadyāt | (mūlamantraṃ daśavāraṃ 
japedityadhikaṃ pustakāntare vartate ||) itthamātmani paśubuddhiṃ 
tyaktvāśivavannirmalajñānakriyāśśuddho'hamiti bhāvannevātmānaṃ 
pūjayet | iti dravyaśuddhiḥ || yadyapyātmaśuddhiḥ prāgabhihitā | tathā'pi 
pūjākartṛkatayā dravyāntaravatpūjopakaraṇatvena praviṣṭasya tasya 
dravyāntaravadeva gandhādibhiḥ pūjayediti tadantadravyaśuddhiḥ ||

|| [mantraśuddhiprakāraḥ] ||

atha mantrāṇāṃ 
dantatālvoṣṭhavyāpārajanyamāyikāśucirūpanirharaṇārthaṃ 
aiśvaryādhikāri malatirohitaphalapradānasāmarthyādināṃ teṣāṃ 
sāmarthyonmīlanārthaṃ ca śuddhiḥ kartavyā | tatprakāra ucyate (-) 
hṛdyañjaliṃ baddhvā bindvantabrahmarandhrāntaśikhāntaṃ 
hrasvadīrghaplutapraṇavādinamontatayā krameṇa trivāraṃ 
śanairmūlamantroccāraṇaṃ kuryāt | tato brahmāṅgādīnāmapi 
tathaivoccāraṇaṃ kuryāt | itthaṃ mantraśuddhiṃvidhāya tadanantaraṃ 
parivāradevatāsadbhāve tadarcanaṃ kuryāt |  kathaṃ 
parivāradevatāsadbhāvaḥ saśaktikakevalapūjane | itthaṃ sūkṣmoktāni 
śuddhakevalamiśrākhyānyaśaktikasaśaktikasaurādicaṇḍāntaśivapūjana
maṃśumaduktena kevalasahajamiśrabhedena pratyekaṃ trividhāni | 
aṃśumati kevalaṃ nāmaparivāradevatārahitaliṅgapūjanam | sahajannāma 
vṛṣabhagaṇeśaskandapārvatīrūpaparivāracatuṣṭayasahitaliṅgapūjanam | 
miśraṃnāma maheśvaranṛttamūrti dakṣiṇāmūrtyādibhirapi sahitasya 
liṅgasya pūjanam | evaṃ kevalaśuddhaṃ sahajaśuddhaṃ miśraśuddhaṃ 
kevalakevalaṃ sahajakevalaṃ miśrakevalaṃ kevalamiśraṃ sahajamiśraṃ 
miśramiśraṃ ceti navavidhāni pūjanāni bhavanti | tatra 
śivapūjārambhātprāk sūryapūjāṃ tadanantaraṃ caṇḍapūjāṃ ca 
vidhāya liṅge śaktiṃ vinā kevalaṃ śivamāvāhya 
parivāradevatārahitasya tasya pūjanaṃ kevalaśuddham | 
parivāracatuṣṭayasāhityena prāguktapūjanaṃ sahajaśuddham 
maheśvarādibhirapi saha prāguktapūjanaṃ misraśuddhaṃ | 
ādyantayossūryādi caṇḍapūjāṃ vihāya liṅge saśaktikaṃ 
śivamāvāhya parivārārcanaṃ vinā tatpūjanaṃ kevalakevalam | 
uktapūjanameva parivāra catuṣṭayārcanasahitaṃ sahajakevalam | 
maheśvarādyarcāsahitaṃ miśrakevalam | ādyantayossūryacaṇḍapūjā 
sahitaṃ saśaktikasyāśaktikasyayā parivāradevatārahitasya liṅge pūjanaṃ 
kevalamiśram | <p. 40> devaparivāracatuṣṭayārcanasahitaṃ sahajamiśram | 
maheśvarādyarcādibhirapi sahitaṃ miśramiśramiti | evañca kevalakevale 
parivārābhāve'pi sahajakevale miśrakevale ca parivārasadbhāvāt 
mantraśuddhyanantaraṃ kevale parivārārcanakathanaṃ yuktameva | tatra 
vṛṣabhaṃ devasya pūrvabhāge paścimābhimukhamarcayet | 
gaṇeśakumārapārvatīḥ pūrvābhimukhatayā 
dakṣiṇapaścimottaradikṣvarcayet | pārvatyā durgārūpatayā'rcane 
dakṣiṇābhimukhatvenārcayet | paurāṇikāstu 
sūryagaṇeśaviṣṇudurgārūpaṃ parivāradevatācatuṣṭayamāhuḥ | 
vṛṣabhādicatuṣṭaye'pyārogyādiphalakāmanāyāṃ 
parivāradevatāmadhye sūryādipūjanamapi kartavyameva | vṛṣabhasya 
vāmabhāge sūryaḥ devasya dakṣiṇabhāge dakṣiṇāmūrtiḥ 
paścimeskandasya vāme viṣṇuḥ uttarabhāge devyāḥ prāgbhāge 
nṛttamūrtiḥ | envamanyeṣāmapi kāmanyā'rcanīyānāmāgamoktāni 
sthānāni draṣṭavyāni ||

|| [liṅgaśuddhiḥ] ||

atha liṅgaśuddhiḥ (-) garbhagṛhe sthitaṃ devasya peṭaka 
mudghāṭyatadagre sthitaṃ caturbhujaṃ triṇetraṃ 
varābhayacchatracāmarakaraṃ bhīmarudramabhyarcya | 
niśācarāntakṛddeva devasya yajanārthakam | śuddhadvārasya savyetu 
gacchatvaṃ hi prasīdame || iti saṃprārthya peṭakamaddhye sthitaṃ devaṃ 
oṃ namodevadeveśasarvalokaikanāyaka | 
uttiṣṭhasnānakarmārthamātmarakṣārthamevaceti saṃprārthya liṅgaṃ 
hastābhyāṃ saṃgṛhya vastraṃ visṛjya prāgeva 
ṣaḍutthāsanenārcitāyāṃ snānavedyāṃ 
suvarṇarajatakāṃsyatrapusīsakṣīravṛkṣānyatamanirmitāyāṃ 
upānapadmajagatīkaṃpakaṇṭakaṃ pajagatīpadmavrājinayuktāyāṃ 
vṛttākārāyāṃ madhyonnatāyāmupariprasāritavastrayāṃ vinyasya liṅge 
pūrvedyurarcitāṃ pūjāṃ hṛdayamantreṇa saṃpūjya 
śirasīśānakrameṇa svāhāntamūlena sāmānyārghyajalenārghyandatvā 
dhūpadīpau pradarśya aṃguṣṭhādikaniṣṭhāntaiḥ īśānādipañcakaṃ 
vinyasya kaniṣṭhikānāmikāmadhye puṣpaṃ saṃgṛhya 
aṃguṣṭhatarjanībhyāṃ <p.41> liṅgamastakātpūjāṃ hṛdayenāvaropya 
tatpuṣpaṃ liṅgamūrdhni vinyasya nirmālyamīśānadiśi 
hṛdayenaśuddhapātrenidhāya astreṇaliṅgaṃ pāśupatāstreṇa pīṭhaṃ 
prakṣālya sāmānyārghyajalena svāhāntaṃ hṛdā'bhiṣiñcet | evaṃ kṛte 
pūrvapūjāsamāptau liṅgapīṭhavinyastamantropasaṃhārānantaraṃ 
liṅgapīṭhayorāsaktāḥ pūjakasya bhuktimuktipratibandhakavighnā nirastā 
bhavanti | liṅgañca hṛdayāmbusnapanena śuddhaṃ punaḥ 
mantravinyāsayogyaṃ bhavati | iti liṅgaśuddhiḥ ||

tataśśivaśaktibhyāṃ nama iti liṅgamudrāṃ pradarśya 
āsanamūrtimūlairaṣṭapuṣpikayā vā saṃpūjya dhūpadīpau pradarśya 
suvarṇarajatatāmramayaśaṃkhaśuktigośṛṅgānyatamapātreṇa 
caturaṃguladīrvayā gośṛṅgāgrapramāṇayā dhārayā'bhiṣicya 
hastayantrodbhavatailena goghṛtenavā'bhyajya 
piṣṭacūrṇādibhirvirukṣyakoṣṇatoyenābhipicya śirasi puṣpamāropya 
pañcagavya pratyeka 
pañcāmṛtaphalarasasaṃyuktapañcāmṛtairantarāntarāśiraśśikhā(-)
netraiḥ puṣpadhūpadīpasamarpaṇapūrvakamastramantreṇa ghaṇṭāṃ 
tāḍayannabhiṣiñcet | evaṃ phalodakādibhissiñcet | tatra phalodakaṃ nāma 
sugandhijalaṃ vitvakpanasanārikelakhaṇḍa 
satvagdāḍimībījapūrapunnāgalikucanāraṅgacūtakadalīphalopetamuda(-)
kam | yavanīvāravrīhimudgasiddhārtha 
saugandhikahemaśālibījasahitamudakaṃ bījodakaṃ | tenābhiṣicya 
mūlabījena gandhapuṣpadhūpadīpairarcayet | 
sphaṭikamuktāphalamāṇikkavidrumagomedakapuṣparāga 
gāruḍendranīlasahitamudakaṃ ratnodakaṃ | tenābhiṣicya varṇamantreṇa 
gandhādibhirarcayet | candanāgarukastūrī 
kuṃkumakarpūramanaśśilailākuṣṭhatakkolalavaṅgośīracampakamukula(-)
cūrṇasahitamudakaṃ gandhodakaṃ | tenābhiṣicya 
gandhapuṣpadhūpadīpanaivedyāni nāmamantreṇa samarpayet | 
campakamallikāketakīpāṭalakundapunnāganandyāvartajātīmandārakaravī
rapadmotpalagiripuṣpayuktaṃ hrīberadamanakādimiśritamudakaṃ 
puṣpodakaṃ | tenābhiṣicya śivamantreṇa gandhapuṣpadhūpadīpaṃ 
dadyāt | tato nāmamantraṃ samuccaranśuddhenānnena 
śanaiśśanairabhiṣicya tadannaṃliṅgamabhitasthitaṃ <p.42> liṅgākṛtiṃ 
kṛtvā gandhapuṣpadhūpadīpapāyasāṃśca tāṃbulādi ca datvā 
tadannaṃ prakṣālyaliṅgamūrdhni mūlabījaṃ nyasya 
ghandhapuṣpadhūpadīpaṃ datvā brahmamantrairālabhya dhenumudrāṃ 
vadhnīyāt | idamannābhiṣecanamapamṛtyunivārakam | 
ayamāyurārogyarājarāṣṭrābhivṛddhidaṃsakalavaśīkaraṇaṃ 
sarvaśāṃtikaraṃ ca | tato jalārcanaṃ ca kuryāt | nirīkṣaṇādisaṃskṛtena 
śuddhajalena hemarajatatāmrayajñavṛkṣajānyatamapātraṃ prapūrya 
tanmadhye liṅgaṃ saṃsthāpya dūrvātilākṣatāndatvā 
gandhapuṣpadhūpadīpairarcayet | idaṃ jalārcanaṃ | tatassamuddhṛtya 
saṃmṛjya pūrvavat snānanaivedyaṃ vinyasya nālikerekṣurasādibhirapi 
yathāsaṃbhavamabhiṣiñcet | śivasya ghṛtābhyaṅgena 
varṣakoṭisahasrārjitaṃ pāpaṃ naśyati | māsaṃ ghṛtābhiṣekeṇa 
trisaptakulopetasya śivapadaprāptirbhavati | 
karayantrodbhavatilatailābhiṣekeṇa śivapadaprāptirbhavati | 
kṣīrābhiṣekeṇāyutasālaṅkāragodānaphalaprāptirbhavati | 
dadhisnapanena sarvapāpakṣayapūrvakaṃ śivalokaprāptirbhavati | 
madhusnapanena sarvapāpakṣayapūrvakaṃ vahnilokaprāptirbhavati | 
ikṣurasasnapanena vidyādharalokaprāptirbhavati | karpūrāgarutoyena 
śivapadaprāptiḥ | gandhacandanatoyena gandharvalokasya puṣpodakena 
sūryalokasya haimodakena kuberalokasya ratnodakena indralokasya kuśodakena 
brahmalokasya prāptirityādi draṣṭavyam | tatra dravyālābhe vastrapūtena 
śuddhena toyenābhiṣiṃcet | tenāpi 
sarvakāmasamṛddhavaruṇalokaprāptiruktā || 
tatodhārābhiṣecanaṃ kuryāt | taccātmārthapūjāyāṃ 
dvādaśāṃgulavistāramekāṃgulotsedhaṃ yavatrayaghanamuttamam | 
saptāṃgulavistāramardhāṃgulotsedhaṃ yavadvayamātraghanaṃ 
madhyamaṃ | pañcāṃgulavistāraṃ pādāṃgulotsedhaṃ 
yavamātraghanamadhamaṃ | tatsuvarṇena rajatena tāmreṇa vā caturaśraṃ 
vṛttaṃ vā karttavyaṃ | caturaśraṃ cennavakoṣṭhānivilikhya 
madhyakoṣṭhasya madhye randhramekaṃ paritoṣṭau maddhyakoṣṭhasyaiva 
rekhāyāṃ mahādikṣu catvāri pūrvādikoṣṭheṣu pratyekaṃ 
dvādaśarandhrāṇi cetyevamuttamapātrasyaikādhikānyaṣṭottaraśataṃ 
randhrāṇi kuryāt | <p.43> maddhyakoṣṭhasyamaddhyarandhramekaṃ parito 
vāṣṭau pūrvādikoṣṭheṣu trīṇitrīṇi randhrāṇītyevaṃ 
maddhyamapātrasya pañcaviṃśatirandhrāṇi kuryāt | vṛttaṃ 
cedaṣṭadalapadmaṃ vilikhya karṇikāyā maddhye paritaśca navarandhrāṇi 
pratidalaṃ dvādaśarandhrāṇi dalebhyo barhirvṛtte mahādikṣu 
catvāricottamapātrasya kuryāt | itarapātrayoraṣṭadalapadme caturaśravat 
dravyāṇi draṣṭavyāni | evaṃbhūtaṃ pātraṃ devasyopari hastadhṛtaṃ 
kṛtvā śaṅkhajalenāpūrya hastābhyāṃ dhārayan mūlena 
dhārābhirabhiṣiṃcet | 
evamabhiṣekārthāniprāksaṃskṛtapañcagavyādivyatiriktāni 
tailādīnyastreṇasaṃprokṣyakavacenāvakuṇṭhyāstreṇa saṃrakṣya 
hṛdayabījenābhiṣecane viniyojayet | evaṃ prapañcenābhiṣekaṃ 
kartumaśaktaśśuddhajalenābhiṣecayet | tato mūlena mantrapuṣpaṃ datvā 
mantrānnaṃ nivedya śuddhamṛduvāsasā śanaissaṃmṛjya padmapīṭhe 
sthāpayet | tata utthāya śivaṃpradakṣiṇīkṛtya
nir(-)ṛtikoṇasthitavāstvadhipati brahmasthānāduttararūpaṃ śivamandirasya 
vāyukoṇaṃ gatvā tatra śyāmavarṇaṃ 
dantākṣasūtrapāśāṃkuśānkaraiḥ puṣkareṇa bījapūrañca 
dhārayantaṃ dakṣiṇābhimukhamupaviṣṭaṃ 
gaṇapatimāvāhanādisarvopacāraissaṃpūjya || (ślo) śivārcanaṃ 
gaṇeśāna nirvighnaṃ kurumesadeti prārthayet | tataḥ prāgbhāge 
śivakheṭakasyottaradiśārūpe śrīphalakamalābhayadhāriṇīṃ triṇetrāṃ 
śivaśaktirūpāṃ dakṣiṇābhimukhīmupaviṣṭāṃ mahālakṣmīṃ tathaiva 
saṃpūjya mātaśśivārcanadravyasamṛddhiṃ kurumesadeti prārthayet | 
tataḥ prāgbhāge śivamandirasyeśānakoṇarūpe 
sadāśivānantaśrīkaṇṭhāṃbikāguhaviṣṇudhātṛrūpān 
prasannavadanānyogapaṭṭadharānvyākhyāmudrākṣasūtravirājitakara(-)
dvayān 
gauravarṇāndakṣiṇāmukhamupaviṣṭānsaptagurunvāśivādisvarūpaguru(-)
paryantānsarvāngurūnvā tathaiva sarvopacāraissaṃpūjya śivādiguravo 
mahyamanujñāṃ dātumarhatha | śivārcanaṃ kariṣyehaṃ 
yuṣmaddarśitamārgataḥ iti prārthayet || gurusthāne 
śrīgurupādukābhyāṃ nama <p.44> iti pādukevā pūjayitvā 
gaṇapatimahālakṣmīgurupādukānāṃ pūjānantaraṃ sarvānpraṇamya 
kṣititalanihitaniścalajānuḥ baddhāṃjaliḥ gaṇanāthāṃvike svāmipāduke 
māṃ jagadguro | yajantamanujānīta yathāsaṃpannakārakamiti 
yugapatprārthayet | atha temyassakāśātputra śivaṃ yajasveti 
anujñālābhaṃ bhāvayitvā devasyāgneyakoṇe dakṣiṇabhāge vā 
rucirādyāsane sthitaḥ pratyekaṃ daśamātraiḥ 
pūrakakuṃbhakarecakaissahitaṃ prāṇāyāmatrayaṃ kṛtvā 
sveṣṭaphalābhisandhipūrvakaṃ yathāśakti śivārcanaṃ kariṣye iti 
saṅkalpya pūjāmārabhet ||
tatra prathamaṃ (śivāsanārcanamiti) śivārcanaṃ | 
taccakandanālagranthidalakesarakarṇikāvibhaktakamalarūpaṃ 
kṣityādiśuddhavidyāntadvātriṃśattatvaparyantocchrāyaṃ 
uparisthitayāmūrtyāsahanivṛtyādiśāṃtikalāparyantocchrāyaṃ | 
tadupariśantyatītakalāpramāṇovidyādehaḥ | tatsvarūpaparijñānārthaṃ 
nivṛtyādikalāpramāṇaṃ tadantargatatatvasvarūpañcavivicyate | 
nivṛtyādikalāśatakoṭiyojanapramāṇabrahmāṇḍarūpā | tatraikaṃ 
pṛthivītatvaṃ | taduparisahasrakoṭiyojanapramāṇā pratiṣṭhākalā | tatra 
jalādibhūtacatuṣṭayagandhāditanmātrapañcakakarmendriyapañcaka(-)
jñānendriyapañcakamanohaṅkārabuddhiprakṛtirūpāṇi 
trayoviṃśatitatvāni | tadupari ayutakoṭiyojanapramāṇāvidyākalā | tatra 
puruṣarāganiyati kalāvidyākālamāyārūpāṇi saptatatvāni | tadupari 
lakṣakoṭiyojanapramāṇāśāntikalā | tatra śuddhavidyāmaheśvaraśceti 
dvetatve | tadupari daśalakṣakoṭiyojanapramāṇāśāntyatītakalā | tatra 
sadāśivaśśaktiśceti dvetatve | tadupari aprameyaṃ śivatatvaṃ 
nivṛttikalātmakaṃ prathivītatvaṃ yāvatkandaṃ 
pratiṣṭhākalāvidyākalāntargatāni jalādikālāntānyekonatriṃśattatvāni 
yāvannālaḥ | jalādikālāntatatveṣu sthitāni pañcasaptatibhuvanāni 
kaṇṭakāḥ | tattadbhuvanāntargataprāṇināṃ buddhidharmāḥ 
pañcāśatbhuvananālāntargatasūtrāṇi | vidyākalāyāmeva <p.45> 
kālasyopari sthitaṃ māyātatvaṃ padmanālagrandhiḥ | śāntikalāyāṃ 
sthitaṃ śuddhavidyātatvadalakesarakarṇikātmakaṃ padmaṃ | 
śuddhavidyāyā upari sthitaṃ maheśvaratatvaṃ yāvat śivasya 
sūkṣmamūrtiḥ śāntyatītakalāyāṃ sthitaṃ sadāśivaśaktitatvadvayaṃ 
yāvadvidyādehaḥ | nāle sthitāni bhuvanāni ca 
jalānalavāyugaganāhaṅkārabuddhiprakṛtiṣu pratyekamaṣṭāvaṣṭau 
bhuvanānīti ṣaṭpañcāśat puruṣe ṣaṭ rāge pañca niyatau dve kalāyāṃ 
dve vidyāyāṃ dve kāle dve iti puruṣādikālānteṣu bhuvanāni 
ekonaviṃśatirityevaṃ pañca saptatibhuvanāni kaṇṭakāḥ | 
tamomohamahāmohatāmasrāndhatāmisrarūpāḥ pañcaviparyayāḥ | 
ūhaśśabdodhyayanaṃ duḥkhatrayavighātasmuhṛtprāptirdānaṃ 
cetyaṣṭausiddhyaḥ | ādhyātmikāḥ prakṛtyupādānakālabhāgākhyāśca | 
tisro viṣayāḥ paramakṛtābāhyāḥ pañceti navacatuṣṭayaḥ 
andhatvamūkatvādaya ekādaśendriyavidhāḥ 
anūhādayassaptadaśaprāguktasiddhibuddhividhāścetyaṣṭāviṃśatiśakta(-)
yaḥ iti pañcāśadbhāvāḥ nālasūtrāṇi | atra 
kandanālādiyojanapramāṇasamaye matāntaraṃ pradarśyate | 
nivṛttikalātmakaṃ pṛthivītatvaṃ pūrvavacchatakoṭiyojanameva | 
pṛthivītatvāddaśaguṇaṃ jalaṃ(,) jalatatvāddaśaguṇovahniḥ(,) 
vahnitatvāddaśaguṇo vāyuḥ(,) vāyordaśaguṇaṃ vyoma(,) 
tatodaśaguṇo'haṅkāraḥ(,) ahaṅkārāddaśaguṇā buddhiḥ(,) 
buddherdaśaguṇaṃ guṇatatvam | evaṃ guṇatatvaparyantaṃ 
daśaṃsakhyayāvṛddhiḥ | ataḥ paraṃ māyātatvaparyantaṃ 
śatasaṅkhyayā vṛddhiḥ | guṇatatvācchataguṇā prakṛtiḥ | 
prakṛteśśataguṇorāgaḥ | rāgācchataguṇā niyatiḥ | niyateśśataguṇā 
vidyā | tataśśataguṇā kalā | tataśśataguṇaḥ kālaḥ | tataśśataguṇā 
māyā | śuddhavidyeśvara sadāśivānāṃ sahasrasaṅkhyayāvṛddhiḥ | 
māyāyāssahasraguṇā śuddhavidyā | śuddhavidyāyāssahasraguṇa 
īśvaraḥ | īśvarāt sahasraguṇassadāśiva iti | tatau 
lakṣasaṅkhyayāvṛddhiḥ | sadāśivatatvāllakṣaguṇā śaktiriti | 
tataśśivatatvamaprameyam | idaṃ ca mataṃ prakṛteḥ pūrvaṃ 
guṇatatvamaṅgīkṛtya prakṛteranantaraṃ puruṣatatvamanaṅgīkṛtya ca 
pravṛttam | <p.46> tathācāhuḥ (-) (ślo) kṣmātatvaṃ śatakoṭiyojanamapaḥ 
prārabhyaṃ gauṇāntakaṃ paṅktyā tadgaṇanāttathā prakṛtito 
māyāvasānaṃ śatāt | sāhasrācca sadāśivāvadhi tataśśaktyantakaṃ 
lakṣatastasyorddhvaṃ saśivo'pyameyavibhavo bindoradhiṣṭhāyakaḥ iti || 
evaṃ sati nālaḥ kiyadyojanasaṃkhyo jāta iti cet asaṃkhyayojana eva | 
tathā'pi kiñcitprakāramāropya yojanasaṅkhyā pradarśyate (-) 
ekatvamārabhya uttarottaraṃ daśaguṇavṛddhau kriyamāṇāyāṃ 
viṃśatitamaṃ sthānaṃ parārdhasaṅkhyā | sa sarvāntimasaṅkhyā | 
viṃśateśca sthānānāmetāni nāmāni | ekaṃ daśa śataṃ 
sahasramayutaṃ lakṣaṃ prayutaṃ koṭirarbudaṃ padmaṃ kharvaṃ 
nikharvaṃ bṛndaṃ mahāpadmaṃ śaṅkho mahāśaṅkhassamudro 
mahāsamudro madhyaṃ parārddha iti || tathācāhuḥ (-) ekaṃ paṅktiśate 
sahasramayutaṃ lakṣaṃ prapūrvāyutaṃ koṭiścārbudakaṃ ca padmaka 
matho kharvaṃ nikharvaṃ tathā | bṛndaṃ caiva 
mahāsarojamaparaśśaṃkhassamudro'ntimo madhyaṃ caiva 
parārdhasaṃjñakamimāṃ saṅkhyāṃ viduḥ paṇḍitāḥ iti || evañca 
śatakoṭisaṅkhyāmekatvasthāne niveśya jalatatvādīnāṃ saṅkhyākriyate | 
śatakoṭirnāma padmasaṅkhyā | tataśca padmayojanaṃ pṛthivītatvam | 
ekayojanaṃ jalatatvaṃ(,) daśayojanaṃ tejastatvaṃ(,) śatayojanaṃ vāyutatvaṃ(,) 
sahasrayojanaṃ gaganatatvaṃ(,) ayutayojanamahaṅkāratatvaṃ(,) lakṣayojanā 
buddhiḥ(,) prayutayojanaṃ guṇatatvaṃ(,) koṭiyojanaṃ tataḥ paraṃ 
śatasaṃkhyayā varddhanīyatvāt ekāntaritasaṃkhyāgrāhyā | yathā 
prakṛtiḥ padmayojanā(,) rāgo nikharvayojanaḥ(,) niyatirmahāpadmayojanā(,) 
vidyā mahāśaṅkhayojanā(,) kalāsamudrayojanā(,) kālaḥ parārdhayojana iti | 
evañca jalādikālāntatatvasamudāyarūpo nālo daśaśata sahasrāyuta 
lakṣaprayuta koṭipadma nikharvamahāpadma 
mahāśaṅkhamahāsamudraparārdhākhyatrayodaśasaṅkhyāsamudāya(-)
saṅkhyeyayojanāparimitobhavati | padmasaṅkhyāyāmekatatvarūpatā 
manāropya parārdhādhike saṅkhyāsadbhāvamāropya gaṇanetu nālaḥ 
kharva nikharva bṛnda mahāpadma śaṅkha mahāśaṅkha 
samudramadhyadaśaguṇitaparārdha <p.47> sahasraguṇitaparārdha 
lakṣaguṇitaparārdha 
koṭiguṇiparārdharūpatrayodaśasaṅkhyāsamudāyasaṅkhyeyayojanocchrā
yo bhavati | nālāntargatānāmapi bhuvanānāmādhāraṇaṃ 
gandhādipañcaka karmendriyapañcaka jñānendriyapañcakamanasāṃ 
pṛthagyojanasaṅkhyā nāstīti matāśrayāṇāṃ teṣu yojanasaṅkhyā 
nagaṇitā | atha teṣāmapi (bhuvanādhāratayā) 
pṛthagyojanasaṅkhyāmāśritya matāntaraṃ pradarśyate ||
padmayojanaparimāṇāt bhūtatvājjalādimanontānāṃ 
viṃśatestatvānāmuttarottaraṃ daśaguṇā vṛddhiḥ | 
ahaṅkārabuddhyośśataguṇā | prakṛtessahasraguṇā | puruṣasyāyutaguṇā 
| niyatikālayorlakṣaguṇā | rāgavidyākalānāṃ daśalakṣaguṇā | 
māyāyāḥ koṭiguṇā | śuddhavidyāyāḥ daśakoṭiguṇā | īśvarasya 
śatakoṭiguṇā | sadāśivasya sahasrakoṭiguṇā | śakterayutakoṭiguṇā | 
śivatatvasya nāsti yojanasaṅkhyā iti | puruṣamāyāmadhyavartitatvānāṃ 
pañcānāmūrdhvādharabhāve kramabhedamāśrityedaṃ matāntaraṃ 
pravṛttam | asminmate kṣityādimanoṃtāni ekaviṃśatitatvānyuttarottaraṃ 
daśaguṇavṛddhyā kramādekadaśaśata sahasrāyuta lakṣa 
prayutakoṭyarbuda padmakharva nikharva 
bṛndamahāpadmaśaṃkhamahāśaṅkha samudra mahāsamudra maddhya 
parārdha daśaparārdha yojanāni | ahaṅkārabuddhī śataguṇavṛdhyā 
kramāt sahasraguṇita lakṣaguṇita parārdhayojane | 
prakṛtissahasraguṇavṛddhyā'rbudaguṇitaparārdhayojanā | 
puruṣastato'yutaguṇavṛddhyābṛndaguṇitaparārdhayojanaḥ | niyatikālau 
lakṣaguṇavṛddhyā kramāt mahāsamudraguṇitasahasra 
parārdhaguṇitaparārdhayojanau | rāgavidyākalāratu 
daśalakṣaguṇavṛddhyā kramāt padmaparārdhaguṇitamahāśaṃkha 
parārdhaguṇitaśata parārdhahataparārdhaguṇita parārdhayojanāḥ | 
evaṃcāsminpakṣe jalādi kalāṃta tatvasamudāyarūpo nālo 
daśādiśataparārdhāhata 
parārdhaguṇitaparārdhaparyantaikonatriṃśatsaṃkhyāsamudāya <p.48> 
saṃkhyeya yojanāparimito bhavati | asmintatvavṛddhyāśrayaṇenapravṛtte 
pakṣadvaye'pi nālāt grantheḥ padmasya cātidairghyaṃ syāt | tathāhi (-) atra 
prathamapakṣe tāvat nālāntargateṣu tatveṣu kāla(-)ekaḥ parārdhayojanaḥ | 
kalātacchatāṃśaparimitaiva | vidyāniyatipūrvakapūrvatatvāni 
tacchatāṃśaparimitānīti nālaḥ kiñcidadhikaikaparārdhayojanaḥ | 
māyārūpogranthistu śataguṇitaparārdhayojanaḥ | 
kālācchataguṇatvānmāyāyāḥ padmaṃ lakṣaguṇitaparārdhayojanam | 
padmarūpāyāśśuddhavidyāyā māyāpekṣayā sahasraguṇitatvā 
ditthaṃ pakṣāntare'pi granthipadmayojanadairghyaṃ syāt | evaṃ 
kandaprabhṛti nālāpekṣayāgrantheḥ padmasya ca dairghyaṃ na 
laukikapadmacchāyānukāri 
navanābhikandādihṛtpradeśāṃtarhṛtpadmacchāyānukāri | athaḥ 
kalāvṛddhipakṣāśrayaṇameva śivāsanapadmabhāvanāyāmanukūlam | 
idañca kamalaṃ anantāsana siṃhāsana yogāsana padmāsana 
vimalāsanarūpa pañcāsanagarbham | tatrapṛthivītatvaparimitakanda 
evādhāraśaktiḥ | jalādikālānta tatvaparimito nāla eva 
taduparisthitapadmamukulasahitassan ādhāraśaktirūpa 
kṣīrodasamutthitaphaṇāmaṇimaṇḍalasahita bhujaṅgamākṛtiśāli 
vidyeśvarāṣṭakāntargatānantarudraitadubhaya manantāsanamucyate | 
nālādyavadhi jalatatvaprabhṛti guṇatatvaparyantaṃ nālaṃ paritaḥsthitaṃ 
sihmāsanam | tata upari granthiparyantaṃ yogāsanam | tadupari 
dalakesararūpaṃ padmāsanam | karṇikaiva vimalāsanam | 
karṇikoparisthitaguṇatraya maṇḍalatrayatatvatrayātmakaṃ vā | 
yadyapyanantaḥ sahasraphaṇāmaṇḍitaḥ sarpatvenokta iti tasya bhogadaṇḍa 
evorddhvākārasthito nālaḥ(,) saṅkucitaṃ tatphaṇāmaṇḍalamevātra 
mukulaṃ(,) natu tadvyatirekeṇa padmamasti(,) tathā'pi tadeva 
vikāsadhyānadaśāyāmaṣṭadalapadmarūpeṇa bhāvanīyamiti 
padmāsanamucyate | yadvā vṛttākāraṃ koṭisūryābhaṃ 
siṃhāsanādadhasthita manantabhogirūpamanantapaṅkajarūpaṃ 
nālādanyadevānantāsanaṃ vṛttākāramuparyuparisthitānanta vāsuki 
takṣaka kārkoṭaka padma mahāpadma 
śaṅkhagulikākhyāṣṭamahānāgarūpaṃ vā | <p.49> athavā 
evamanantāsanaṃ bhāvanīyam (-) 
sihmāsanasyādhastādvṛṣāsihmabhūtakuñjarākāra 
dharmādipādacatuṣṭayasya adharmādiphalakacatuṣṭayasya mañcasyopari 
phaṇapañcakena pucchena ca sahitaḥ phaṇāmaddhye puruṣākāraḥ 
kṣaumavastraparīdhānassarvābharaṇabhūṣitaḥ varābhayadharakaradvayo 
nāgarājaḥ | taṃparitaḥ pūrvādidikṣu anantādyāḥ gulikāntā 
ekaphaṇāḥ kṛtāñjalipuṭā nāgarājā īkṣamāṇā mahānāgāḥ 
nāgarājasyaśirasipraphullāṣṭadalayuktaṃ anantapaṅkajamiti | 
atrādimapakṣamevāvalaṃvya śivāsanasyārcanākramaḥ pradarśyate | 
hāmādhāraśaktaye namaḥ | 
śatakoṭiyojanapramāṇabrahmāṇḍākārapṛthivītatva parimāṇa 
śivāsanapadmakandarūpāṃ dhavalavarṇāṃ 
pāśāṃkuśābhayavaradhāriṇīmādhāraśakti pūjayāmi | anantāsanāya 
namaḥ | jalādikalāntatatvaparimāṇanālarūpaṃ 
māyāgranthisahitamekādaśasahasrakoṭiyojanocchrāyaṃ vā 
daśaśatasahasrāyuta lakṣaprayuta koṭyarbuda padmakharva nikharva 
bṛndamahāpadma śaṅkhamahāśaṅkhasamudra mahāsamudra 
madhyaparārdha 
daśaśataguṇitaparārdhasahasraguṇitaparārdhalakṣaguṇitaparārdhārbudagu
ṇita bṛndaguṇitaparārdha mahāsamudraguṇitaparārdha sahasraparārdha 
guṇitaparārdha padmaparārdha guṇita parārdha guṇitaparārdha 
mahāśaṅkhaparārdhaguṇitaparārdha 
śataparārdhāhataparārdhaguṇitaparārdha 
padmaparārdhāhataparārdhaguṇitaparārdharūpatriṃśatsaṅkhyāguṇita 
padmasaṅkhyāsamudāya saṅkhyeyayojanocchrāyaṃ vātadupari 
sahasraphaṇāmaṇḍalarūpābjamukulālaṃkṛtamekavaktraṃ caturbhujaṃ 
hṛdaye namaskāramudrāsahitamanantarudrarūpamanantāsanaṃ pūjayāmi | 
hāṃ śivāsanapadmanālakaṇṭakebhyo namaḥ | 
pṛthivīkandodgataśivāsanapadmanālāvayavebhyo 
jalādikalāntatatvāśritāmareśa 
prabhāsanaimiśapuṣkarāṣāḍiḍiṃḍimuṇḍi bhārabhūtala śuddhīśvara 
hariścandra śrīśaila japyeśvara āmrātakeśvara maddhyameśvara 
mahākāla kedāra bharava gayā kurukṣetra nākhala kanakakhala 
vimaleśvara aṭṭahāsa mahendra bhīmeśvara avimukta vastrāpadarudrakoṭi 
<p. 50> mahālaya gokarṇa bhadrakarṇa svarṇākṣa sthāṇucchagalaṇḍa 
dviraṇḍa mahākoṭa maṇḍaleśvara kālāñjana śaṃkukarṇa sthūleśvara 
sthaleśvara paiśāca rākṣasa yakṣagandharva aindra saumya prājāpatya 
brāhmākṛtakṛta bhairava brahmavaiṣṇavakaumāra nāla śrīkaṇṭha 
vāmadeva bhīmogra bhava īśāna ekavīra pracaṇḍa umāpati aja ananta 
ekaśiva kodhacaṇḍa dyuti saṃvarta śūra pañcāntaka eka vīra śikheda 
nāmadheya saptatibhuvanarūpān kaṇṭakānpūjayāmi | hāṃ sūtrebhyo 
namaḥ | pañcaviparyayāṣṭasiddhi navatuṣṭyaṣṭāviṃśati śaktirūpa 
pañcāśadbhāvanātmakāni śivāsanapadmanālasūtrāṇi pūjayāmi ||

	evamanantāsanātmakanālapūjānantaraṃ nālaṃ paritaḥ sthitaṃ 
sihmāsanaṃ yogāsanaṃ ca pūjayet | hāṃ dharmāya namaḥ | 
śivāsanasyāgneyakoṇe pādarūpaṃ siṃhākāraṃ 
jalādiguṇatatvaparyantonnataṃ āgneyābhimukhaṃ vivṛtāsyaṃ 
parivṛttakandharaṃ vāyavyakoṇasiṃhāvalokinaṃ koṭisiṃhaparivāritaṃ 
karpūravarṇaṃ dharmaṃ pūjayāmi | hāṃ jñānāya namaḥ | 
śivasiṃhāsanasya nai(-)ṛtakoṇapādarūpaṃ siṃhākāraṃ 
jalādiguṇaparyantonnataṃ nai(-)ṛtābhimukhaṃ vivṛtāsyaṃ 
parivṛttakandharaṃ īśānakoṇasiṃhāvalokinaṃ koṭisiṃhaparivāritaṃ 
kuṃkumavarṇaṃ jñānaṃ pūjayāmi | hāṃ vairāgyāya namaḥ | 
śivasiṃhāsanasya vāyavyakoṇapādarūpaṃ siṃhākāraṃ 
jalādiguṇatatvaparyantonnataṃ vāyavyābhimukhaṃ vivṛtāsyaṃ 
parivṛttakandharamāgneya koṇasiṃhāvalokinaṃ koṭisiṃhaparivāritaṃ 
suvarṇavarṇaṃ vairāgyaṃ pūjayāmi | hāmaiśvaryāya namaḥ | 
śivasiṃhāsanasyeśānakoṇapādarūpaṃ 
siṃhākāramaiśānābhimukhaṃ jalādiguṇatatvaparyantonnataṃ 
vivṛtāsyaṃ pūrvavṛttakandharaṃ nai(-)ṛtakoṇasiṃhāvalokinaṃ 
koṭisihmaparivāritaṃ meghavarṇamaiśvaryaṃ pūjayāmi | hāmadharmāya 
namaḥ | śivasiṃhāsanasya pūrvaphalakarūpaṃ śvetakṛṣṇavarṇaṃ 
puruṣākāraṃ dakṣiṇaśirasaguttarapāda madhomukhamadharmaṃ 
pūjayāmi | hāmajñānāya namaḥ | <p. 51> śivasiṃhāsanasya 
dakṣiṇaphalakarūpaṃ śvetaraktavarṇaṃ puruṣākāraṃ 
pūrvaśiraḥpaścimapādaṃ adhomukhamajñānaṃ pūjayāmi | hāṃ 
avairāgyāyai namaḥ | śivasiṃhāsanasya paścimaphalakarūpaṃ 
raktapītavarṇaṃ puruṣākāraṃ uttaraśirasaṃ 
dakṣiṇapādamadhomukhamavairāgyaṃ pūjayāmi | hāmanaiśvaryāya 
namaḥ | śivasiṃhāsanasya uttaraphalakarūpaṃ pītakṛṣṇavarṇaṃ 
puruṣākāraṃ paścimaśirasaṃ pūrvapādamadhomukhamanaiśvaryaṃ 
pūjayāmi | tadanantaraṃ hāṃ śivasiṃhāsanāya namaḥ iti samastaṃ 
siṃhāsanaṃ saṃpūjya yogāsanaṃ pūjayet ||
	tasya śvetaraktapītakṛṣṇavarṇāni bhūtarūpāṇi 
kṛtatretādvāparakaliyugānyāgneyādipādatvena avyaktaniyatikalākālān 
sphaṭikakālamevadāḍimīpuṣpabhinnāñjanavarṇānpūrvādiphalakatvena 
cābhyarcya hāṃ śivayogāsa(?)camadhyaphalakarūpāya śrīmahāviṣṇave 
namaḥ iti madhye nīlavarṇaṃ triṇetraṃ śaṅkhacakravarābhayakaraṃ 
viṣṇuṃ pūjayet | tato rajoguṇāruṇāya 
tamoguṇatūlabharitāyamāyārūpāya adhaśchadāya namaḥ | iti 
yogāsanasya ūrdhvamekhalāyā adhobhāgaprasāritaṃ 
śayanīyarūpamadhaśchadanaṃ nai(-)ṛtakoṇe saṃpūjya | hāṃ 
satvagavraṇadhavalitāya śuddhamāyārūpordhvacchadanāya namaḥ | iti 
mekhalāyā upari śayanīyottaracchadanarūpamūrdhvacchadanaṃ nai(-)
ṛtakoṇe ca saṃpūjya hāṃ śivayogāsanāyanama iti samastaṃ yogāsanaṃ 
pūjayet | yogāsanavimalāsane vinā tryāsanātmakameva śivāsanamiti 
pakṣe śivāsanameva māyāgranthiparyantonnataṃ bhāvayitvā 
tatpādaphalakārcanānantaramāgneyādikoṇeṣu sthita tadīyaphalakadvaya 
sandhānakīlatvena kṛtayugādicatuṣṭayamabhyarcya tanmadhye 
phalakatvenaiva śrīmahāviṣṇuṃ 
pūjayitvā'dhaśchadanamūrdhvacchadanaṃ ca pūjayet | 
tato'nantaphaṇāmaṇḍalarūpaṃ padmamukulaṃ vikasitaṃ bhāvayitvā 
tasya dalakesarā narcayet | hāṃ śivāsanapadmadalebhyonamaḥ | 
aṣṭavidyeśvararūpāṇi dhavalavarṇāni śivāsanapadmasya dalāni 
pūjayāmi | <p. 52> hāṃ kesarebhyonamaḥ | mūle suvarṇavarṇāni madhye 
vidrumavarṇāni muktāphalākṛtiśirolaṅkṛtāni catuṣṣaṭikalārūpāṇi 
vāmādiśaktisahitāṣṭarudrarūpāṇivā kesarāṇi pūjayāmi | 
kesarāṇāmaṣṭarudrarūpatvapakṣe aṣṭāvaṣṭau kesarāṇyekaikarudratvena 
bhāvanīyāni | athavā phaṇārūpadalasahasrayuktasya anantapaṅkajasya 
kesarāṇyapi sahasraṃ santi | tāni sarvāṇi 
pañcaviṃśatyuttaraśatasaṅkhyayā'ṣṭadhā vibhajya 
vāmādyaṣṭarudrarūpeṇa pūjanīyāni | karṇikāsahitānyaṣṭāvevavā 
kesarāṇi tathā pūjanīyāni | ayaṃ nyāyo'ṣṭavidyeśvararūpatayā 
pūjanīyeṣu daleṣvapi yojanīyaḥ | hāṃ karṇikāyai namaḥ | vimalāṃ 
śaktirūpāṃ kanakavarṇāṃ śivāsanapadmakarṇikāṃ pūjayāmi | hāṃ 
bijebhyonamaḥ | vāmādinavaśaktirūpāṇi vā pañcāśadvarṇarūpāṇi 
vā śivāsanapadmakarṇikābījāni pūjayāmi | tatassarvāvayavayuktaṃ 
padmaṃ vibhāvya hāṃ padmāsanāya namaḥ iti saṃpūjya hāṃ 
padmamudrāyai namaḥ iti padmamudrāṃ pradarśayet | tataḥ 
pūrvādiprādakṣiṇyenāṣṭasvaṣṭasu kesareṣu vāmādīraṣṭau 
śaktīrekaikaśaḥ pūjayet | vāmāyai namaḥ | jyeṣṭhāyainamaḥ | raudryai 
namaḥ | kālyai namaḥ | kalavikariṇyainamaḥ | valavikariṇyai namaḥ 
balapramathinyai namaḥ | sarvabhūtadamanyai namaḥ | 
aruṇavaktrāścāmaradhāriṇīśśivāsananyastaikahastāśśivābhi(-)
mukhyena kesareṣu sthitā vāmādiśaktiḥ pūjayāmi | manonmanyainamaḥ | 
sphaṭikavarṇāṃ pāśāṅkuśābhayavaradhāriṇīṃ 
śivāsanapadvakarṇikāyāmīśānadiśi madhye(-)īśānadiśi vā sthitāṃ 
manonmanīṃ pūjayāmi | tatassādhipatikāni 
sūryasomāgniśaktimaṇḍalānyuparyupari pūjayet | hāṃ 
sūryamaṇḍalāya namaḥ | koṭisūryapratīkāśaṃ 
śivapadmāsanadalāgravyāpakaṃ sūryamaṇḍalaṃ pūjayāmi | hāṃ 
sūryamaṇḍalādhipataye brahmaṇe namaḥ | pañcamatkraṃ caturbāhuṃ 
prativaktraṃ trilocanam | <p. 53> taptacāmīkarābhāsaṃ 
namomudrāsamanvitam || sṛṣṭikāraṇa (sṛṣṭikāraṇamātmatatveti) 
kāraṇamātmatatvarūpiṇaṃ sūryamaṇḍalādhipatiṃ brahmāṇaṃ 
pūjayāmi | hāṃ somamaṇḍalāyanamaḥ | 
śivāsanapadmakesarāgravyāpakaṃ koṭiśītāṃśuśītalaṃ 
somamaṇḍalaṃ pūjayāmi | hāṃ somamaṇḍalādhipataye viṣṇave namaḥ | 
meghaśyāmaṃ śaṅkhacakranamaskāramudrānvitakaracatuṣṭayaṃ 
sthitikāraṇa (sthitikāraṇaṃ soma) kāraṇaṃ somamaṇḍalādhipatiṃ 
viṣṇuṃ pūjayāmi | hāṃ agnimaṇḍalāyanamaḥ | 
śivāsanapadmakarṇikāgravyāpakaṃ vahnimaṇḍalaṃ pūjayāmi | hāṃ 
vahnimaṇḍalādhipataye rudrāyanamaḥ | māṇikkavarṇaṃ 
śūlānalanamomudrānvitakaracatuṣṭayaṃ layakāraṇa (layakāraṇa śiva) 
kāraṇaṃ śivatatvarūpiṇaṃ vahnimaṇḍalādhipatiṃ rudraṃ pūjayāmi | 
vimalāsanaṃ karṇikāvyatiriktamiti pakṣe āgneyādyaiśānāntaṃ 
guṇatrayaṃ dakṣiṇādyuttarāntaṃ maṇḍalatrayaṃ nair(-)
ṛtyādivāyavyāntaṃ tatvatrayaṃ ca pūjayitvā hāṃ vimalāsanāyanamaḥ 
iti samastamidaṃ vimalāsanaṃ pūjayet ||

	tadanantaraṃ madhye hāṃ śaktimaṇḍalāya namaḥ | dhavalavarṇaṃ 
maṇḍalatrayavyapakamicchāśaktirūpaśaktimaṇḍalaṃ pūjayāmi | hāṃ 
śaktimaṇḍalādhipataye maheśvarāyanamaḥ | sphaṭikavarṇamaṣṭahastaṃ 
khaḍgatriśūlabāṇākṣamālākamaṇḍalvabhayakarāravindadhāriṇaṃ 
śaktimaṇḍalādhipatiṃ maheśvaraṃ pūjayāmi | tatassamastaṃ 
śivāsanaṃ vibhāvya tadupari hāṃ śivāsanāyanama iti 
jñānaśaktyātmakaṃ śivāsanaṃ pūjayet | 
asyāmāsanaparaṃparāyāmādhāraśaktimātmārthapūjāyāṃ 
brahmaśilāsthānīye padmapīṭhe pūjayitvā'nantaprabhṛti 
śaktimaṇḍalāntaṃ liṅgavedikāyāmuparyupari liṅganābhiparyantaṃ 
pūjayet | evaṃ pratyekaṃ śivāsanāvayavapūjanāśaktau <p. 54> 
sāṅgopāṅgaṃ śivāsanaṃ vibhāvya hāṃ śivāsanāyanama ityevaṃ 
pūjayet | ayamanekāsanagarbhaśivāsanārcanaprakāraḥ | yadvā (-) āvāhane 
padmamanantaṃ snāne vimalamarcane yogāsanaṃ naivedye 
vastrādiṣvanyeṣūpacāreṣu siṃhāsanaṃ ca kalpayet | athavā sihmāsanaṃ 
snāne anantaṃ vastre padmamābharaṇagandhapuṣpeṣu vimalaṃ naivedye 
yogamanyopacāreṣu ca kalpayet | evaṃ śivāsanaṃ saṃpūjya hāṃ haṃ 
hāṃ śivamūrtayenama iti liṅganābhermaheśvaratatvātmikāṃ śivasya 
mūrti sthiravidyunnibhāṃ daṇḍākārāmavibhaktāvayavāṃ saṃpūjya 
liṅgadairghye homīśānamūrdhne nama ityādimantrairdaṇḍabhaṅgyā 
mūrddhādipādāntamīśānādi vinyasya saśaktikamaśaktikaṃ vā 
tattatsthāneṣvaṣṭatriṃśatkalā nyaset | śūdraśśaśinyādiśaktīreva nyaset 
| tataśśrīkaṇṭhādinyāsañca vidadhyāt | evaṃ 
sadāśivadehasiddhyarthaṃ nyāsānkṛtvā hāṃ hauṃ vidyādehāyanama 
iti vibhaktāvayavaṃ sadāśivaṃ vidyādehaṃ pūjayitvā tatsvarūpaṃ 
prapañcena dhyāyet ||

	kṣityādiśuddhavidyānte kandanāladalairyute | karṇikākesarairyukte 
sūryabiṃbādibhūṣite || īśvarāntikayā mūrtyā sthiravidyutprakāśayā | 
avibhaktāvayavayā bhrājamānoparisthale || kṣityādīśvaratatvānte 
mūrtyākathitayā saha | nānāpaṭṭakuṭīkoṭiyojanonnataśālini || 
padmesthitaṃ mahāpadmakoṭiyojanasaṃmitam | baddhapadmāsanāsīnaṃ 
samupāsetsadāśivam ||

yadvā kūṭāṅgakoṭī kaṭakanaṭanaṭī nāṭya navyānnapāna
dhyānā (dvidyātmakaṅkanakamiteti) 
vidyānakānīnakamitaśatakoṭyunnatairyojanaughaiḥ |
tejormūrtyantakandaprabhṛtiṣu daśadhā saptadhā ca prabhinnaiḥ
saṅkhyātavyapramāṇaissarasiruhavare yogavīṭhe niṣaṇṇam ||

<p. 55> daśottaraprayutaparārdhayojanāṃ 
vivṛddhakāviṣayaparārdhayojanām |
samunnatiṃ samupagataṃ samāśraye sadāśivaṃ sarasiruhāsane sthitam ||

padmaṃ kande'tha nāle kramikadaśaguṇā viṃśatau tasya vṛddhi
ryekaikadvitriṣusyācchatamukhadaśalakṣāntabhaṃgyā'tha vṛddhiḥ |
graṃthau koṭyātha padmaprabhṛtiṣu daśakoṭyeti saṃkhyābhirāhiḥ
saṃkhyātairyojanaughairmahimajuṣi mahāyogapīṭhe sthitaṃ vā ||

tadupari śatakoṭiyojanaugha prathita maheśvaratatvamānamūrtaiḥ |
lasitamupari tatsahasrakoṭyā tadayutakoṭidiśā ca vṛddhibhājam ||

pañcavaktraṃ daśabhujaṃ prativaktraṃ trilocanam |
dakṣiṇe śūlavajrāsiparaśvabhayamudrikāḥ ||

vāme ca dadhataṃ nāgapāśaghaṇṭānalāṃkuśān |
athavā varakhaṭvāṅgaśūlabhīśaktipañcakam ||

rucakaṃ ḍararuṃ sarvaṃ nīlāṃbhojākṣamālikām |
asyordhvavaktraṃ devasya bālabhāvamanoharam ||

prasannamūrdhvābhimukhaṃ nirmalaṃ sphaṭikaprabham |
pūrvavaktraṃ maheśasya ni(nikṣipteti)ṣṭaptāṣṭāpadaprabham ||

sarveṇa stimitaṃ saumyaṃ saṃprāptanavayauvanam |
dakṣiṇaṃ vadanaṃ śaṃbhornīlāñjanacayaprabham ||

bhrūkuṭīkuṭilaṃ ghoraṃ raktavṛttekṣaṇatrayam |
daṃṣṭrākarālaṃ durdharṣaṃ sphuritādharapallavam ||

candrāpīḍajvalatkeśaṃ vilasatprauḍhayauvanam |
uttaraṃ vaktramīśasya navavidrumasuprabham ||

<p. 56> lalāṭatilakopetaṃ nīlālakavibhūṣitam |
pralobhanaṃ trinayanaṃ candrābharaṇabhāsvaram ||

pārvatīvadanākārasalīlabhrūlatānvitam |
paścimaṃ caṇḍasaṅkāśaṃ nṛpalakṣaṇalakṣitam ||

candrāvataṃ saruciraṃ dhyānastimitalocanam |
iti dhyātvā punarapi dhyāyeddevaṃ sadāśivam ||

icchājñānakriyārūpavilasallocanatrayam |
jñānacandrakalācūḍaṃ daśadigbāhumaṇḍalam ||

pañcabrahmātmavadanaṃ pañcasādākhyavaktrakam |
śrīmatpañcākṣarākāravadanāṃsoruśobhitam ||

samastatantrarūpaṃ ca varṇabrahmakalāmayam |
nivṛtyā jānuparyantamānābheśca pratiṣṭhayā ||

ākaṇṭhaṃ vidyayā siddha mālalāṭaṃ tu śāntayā |
tadūrddhvaṃ śāntyatītākhyakalayā parikalpitam ||
evaṃ pañcakalārūpamidaṃ sādāśivaṃ vapuḥ ||

caturmukhī taṭidvarṇā nivṛttirvajradhāruṇī |
ekavaktrā śaśāṅkābhā pratiṣṭhā padmadhāriṇī ||

agnivarṇā trivadanā vidyā śaktilasatkarā |
kṛṣṇavarṇā caturvaktrā śāntirdhvajavidhāriṇī ||

pāśabhṛtpañcavadanā śānyatītā śaśiprabhā |
sarvāḥ padmākṣamālābhyāmabhayena virājitāḥ ||

caturbhujāstriṇetrāśca pinonnatapayodharāḥ |
āsāṃ paścādhvagarbhatvāt ṣaḍadhvātmā sadāśivaḥ ||

mantrādhvā ca padādhvā ca varṇādhvā bhuvanādhvakaḥ |
<p. 57> tatvādhvā ca kalādhvā ca ṣaḍadhvāna ime matāḥ ||

caturviṃśatyuttaraṃ yadbhuvanānāṃ śatadvayam |
bhuvanādhvā sa sañcintyo romabṛndātmanā vibhoḥ ||

pañcāśadrudrarūpaistu varṇairvarṇādhvakalpanā |
asau tvagātmanā cintyo devadevasya śūlinaḥ ||

rudhirātmā tu mantrāddhvā vicintyaḥ pārvatīpateḥ |
padādhvā cintanīyassyāt sirāmāṃsatayā prabhoḥ ||

pṛthivyādīniṣaṭtriṃśat tatvānyāgamavedibhiḥ |
uktānyamībhistatvādhvā śuklamajjāsthirūpabhṛt ||

nāsya dehe'sthi rudhiraṃ na māṃsaṃ nāsti kiñcana |
pratibiṃbamivādarśe śakracāpamivāṃbare ||

jyotirmayatayā siddhamidaṃ sādāśivaṃ vapuḥ |
tathā'pi kalpanāmātraṃ kalāvā'pyadhvanāmidam ||

brahmasvīśe mūdhānaṃ puruṣeṇa caturmukhīm |
hṛdayādīmyaghoreṇa guhyādīni tu vāmataḥ ||

sadyojātena tu dhyāyet pādādīni jagatpateḥ |
pañcavaktrāḥ smṛtāssarve daśadordaṇḍabhūṣitāḥ ||

khaḍgakheḍadhanurbāṇakamaṇḍalvakṣasūtriṇaḥ |
varābhayopetakarāśśūlapaṅkajapāṇayaḥ ||

aghoro ghora eteṣu tadanye saumyavigrahāḥ |
evaṃ dhyātvā sadeśasya pañcabrahmātmatāṃ vibhoḥ ||

tvattadbrahmakalābhedairvicintyāṅgāni kalpayet |
īśānasya kalāḥ pañcamūrddhātmakatāṃ gatāḥ ||

<p. 58> caturmukhatayā dhyeyāścatasraḥ puruṣasya tāḥ |
aṣṭāvaghorasya kalāssamastā jagatīpate ||

hṛtkaṇṭho'msau nābhikukṣī pṛṣṭhaṃ vakṣa itīritāḥ |
vāmadevasya tu kalāstrayodaśa śivoditāḥ ||

guhyorujānujaṃghāsphikkaṭiḥ pārśve tathā matāḥ |
sadyojātasyatu kalā vasusaṃkhyāḥ prakīrtitāḥ ||

pādau karau nāsike ca śirobāhū ca tā matāḥ |
aṣṭatriṃśatkalā devāḥ tiṇetrāśca caturmukhāḥ ||

varābhayaparaśveṇavilasatkarapaṅkajāḥ |
tattadbrāhya samākāravarṇāyudhabhṛto'thavā ||

eteṣāṃ vāmabhāgeṣu śaśinyādyāśca śaktayaḥ |
pāśāṃkuśābhayavarairdhyātavyāssusmitānanāḥ ||

śrīkaṇṭhapramukhān rudrān varṇarūpān saśaktikān |
prabhoravayavāndhyāyet nyāsavinyāsavartmanā ||

smaretsaśaktikān rudrānardhanārīśvarākṛtīn |
sindurakāṃcanaprakhya vāmadakṣiṇapārśvakān ||

pāśāṅkuśākṣavalaya varamudrāvirājitān |
prasannavaktrakamalān viśvavāṃchitadāyakān ||

kāmikaṃ pādakamalaṃ yogajaṃ gulphayoryugam |
cintyaṃ pādāṃgulīrūpaṃ kāraṇaṃ prasṛtidvayam ||

ajitaṃ jānunoryugmaṃ dīptamūrudvayaṃ vibhoḥ |
guhyabījātmakaṃ sūkṣmaṃ sahasraṃ bhrukuṭītaṭam ||

pṛṣṭhabhārgo'śumānasya nābhiśrīsuprabhedakam |
<p. 59> vijayaṃ jaṭharaṃ prāhurniśvāsaṃ hṛdayātmakam ||

svāyambhuvaṃ stanadvaṃdvamanalaṃ locanatrayam |
vīrāgamaḥ kaṇṭhadeśo rauravaṃ śravaṇadvayam ||

makuṭaṃ makuṭaṃ tantraṃ bāhavo vimalāgamaḥ |
candrajñānamuraśśaṃbhorbiṃbaṃ vadanapaṅkajam ||

jihvā prodgītamīśasya lalitaṃ gaṇḍayordvayam |
siddhaṃ lalāṭaphalakaṃ santānaṃ kuṇḍaladvayam ||

yajñopavītaṃ śarvoktaṃ hārasrakpārameśvaram |
kiraṇaṃ ratnabhūṣāsya vātulaṃ vasanātmakam ||

evaṃ tantrātmakaṃ rūpamīśvarasya vicintayet |
śivajñānapradaṃ puṃsāṃ śivadharmapravartakam ||

viśuddha śivasādākhyaṃ vidyudbṛndamivāṃbare |
viśvatasphurita jyotirvidyādūrdhvaṃ mukhaṃ vibhoḥ ||

amūrtimatha sādākhyaṃ mūlastambha iti śrutam |
jyotistambhamayaṃ liṅgaṃ smaredasyottaraṃ mukham ||

jyotirliṅgaikabhāgotthamekavaktraṃ trilocanam |
mūrtisnādākhyamityuktaṃ dhyāyetpaścimamānakam ||

śūlañca paraśuṃ vajramabhītiṃ dakṣiṇaiḥ karaiḥ |
pāśaṃ vahniṃ ca ghaṇṭāṃ ca varaṃ vāmaiḥ karairapi ||

dadhānaṃ kartṛsādākhyaṃ caturvaktrāṃbujojvalam |
liṅgamadhye samudbhūtaṃ saṃsmareddakṣiṇānanam ||

pañcavaktraṃ daśabhujaṃ pīṭhaṃ liṅge samudgatam |
prasiddhaṃ kartṛsādākhyaṃ purāreḥ pūrvamānanam ||

<p. 60> pañcabrahmāṇyūrdhvapūrvadakṣiṇottarapaścimān |
vaktrapadmānvibhordhyāyedīśāna prabhṛti kramāt ||

hṛdayaṃ hṛdaye śubhraṃ śiraśśirasi piṅgalam |
śikhāṃ śikhāpade raktāṃ kavacaṃ pārśvayoḥ sthitam ||

netre tu śyāmalaṃ netraṃ kare'stra masitaṃ smaret |
caturbhujāstriṇetrāśca jaṭāmakuṭamaṇḍitāḥ ||
varābhaye kapālañca śūlaśca dadhataṃ karaiḥ ||

aṅgadevāḥ smṛtāssaumyanetrāgretūgravigrahe |
triśūlastriguṇaḥ prāhuḥ paraśussatyaniṣṭhitāḥ ||

khaḍgapratāpovajraśca śaṃbhośśaktirabhedyatā |
vahnessaṃhāriṇī śaktiḥ śaktirnāge pradhṛṣyatā ||

malamāyā karmapāśo ghaṇṭānādasvarūpiṇī |
abhayaṃ pālinī śaktirniyamaṃtvaṃkuśaṃ viduḥ ||

icchājñānakriyārūpā striśūlaṃ śaktayomatāḥ |
uktāstā eva khaṭvāṅgaṃ śuddhatattvapravartikā ||

bījapūramiti proktā jagadbījapravartikā |
ḍamarukṣobhasaṃpannamāyātatvapravartikā ||

kākodaraḥ kalā mukhyā kāryajātapravartikā |
manaḥpravartikāśaktirindīvaratayā matā ||

akṣamālā tu sā jñeyā indriyāṇāṃ pravartikā |
śaktyāyudhātmikā śaktirduṣṭasaṃhārakāriṇī ||

varo bhogapradā śaktirabhayaṃ mokṣadāyikā |
itthaṃ daśāyudhadharaṃ koṭiśītāṃśuśītalam ||

<p. 61> dvātriṃśallakṣaṇopetaṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitam |
ṣaḍtyaṃgulaparicchinnajaṭāmakuṭamaṇḍitam ||

tatsavyakoṭivinyastatryaṃgulārdhenduśekharam |
tadvāmakoṭiviśrāntabidvākṛtyamarāpagam ||

tripuṇḍrārdhendubhūyantradīpacandrākṛtiṃ kramāt |
īśānādyairmukhaṃ puṇḍrāndhārayantamajāṃtimaiḥ ||

dhyāyettadvāmabhāge tu divyarūpāṃ mavonmanīm |
japākusumasaṅkāśāṃ śubhravastravibhūṣitām ||

sarvābharaṇasaṃpūrṇāṃ pīnorujaghanastanīm |
sahasrapadmanīlābjavaradābhayadhāriṇīm ||

evaṃ manonmanīyuktaṃ sākṣāddevaṃ sadāśivam |
liṅge'pi bhāvayannagre liṅgabuddhiṃ parityajet ||

netratrayeṣu vinyasya hauṃ netrebhya iti kramāt |
āvāhayetparaśivaṃ sadaivaṃ hṛdayāṃbuje ||

	athāvāhanakramaḥ (-) aprameya manirdeśya manūpama manāmayam | 
sūkṣmaṃ sarvagataṃ nityaṃ dhruvamavyayamīśvaram || bhavantaṃ 
bhavatā'diṣṭo mantreṇābhinamāmyaham || iti vijñāpya ṛjūrdhvakāyo 
manaścakṣurnirodhanapūrvakamiḍayā vāyumāpūrya kuṃbhakaṃ kṛtvā 
hṛdi puṣpasaṃpūrṇamañjaliṃ nidhāya dṛḍhamāvāhanamudrāṃ 
baddhvā svaśarīre mūlādhārasthitaṃ mantramayaṃ paramaśivaṃ 
jyotissamākṛṣya mūlādhāraprabhṛti sthitaṃ hakāramatilaṃghya 
hṛdayaparyantaṃ nītvā hṛtkaṇṭhatāsvādisthānasthita 
pṛthivyādipāśajālabrahmādikāraṇeśvarasahitākārādidvādaśaka(-)
lāśca krameṇa tattadanusandhānapūrvakamatilaṃghya 
dvādaśāntaparyantamuccārayanneva puṣpāñjalimapi 
dvādaśāntaparyantaṃ nītvā mantramayaṃ 
jyotirdvādaśāntasthitaparamaśivena saṃyojya aviśrāntaṃ <p. 62> 
paramāmṛtasyandibindurūpaṃ tata ānīya 
bhrūmadhyagataśivamaṇḍapaviśrāntaṃ saṃbhāvya 
śaradindusahasravadbhāvya hṛddeśe'ñjaliṃ dhārayan vāyumapi 
piṅgalayā virevya vāyunā saha paramaśivaṃ jyotiḥ 
puṣpāñjalimadhyaprāpitaṃ vibhāvya hāṃ hauṃ śivāyanama iti 
sadāśivasya brahmaraṃdhre yojayet | uktārthaviśadīkaraṇāya mūlamantra 
tadīyahakāra tatkalādvādaśasthānāni pradarśyante || 
yaddehamadhyasthānaṃ mūlādhāraṃ tataḥ prabhṛti 
brahmarandhraparyantaṃ tālacatuṣṭayapramāṇaṃ dehāntargatam | tata(-)
ūrddhvaṃ tālapramāṇaṃ śikhāsthānam | tatra 
mūlādhārasthitacaturdalakamalakarṇikāyāṃ prāsādamantrasyotthānam | 
tataḥ prabhṛti nābhiparyantaṃ mṛṇālasūkṣmo vidyutprabho hakāraḥ | 
nābherūrdhvaṃ dvādaśāṃgulaparyantaṃ vidyuddyutirakārayukto 
hakāraḥ | tataḥ pañcacaturaṃgulapramāṇaṃ hṛtpadmam | tata ārabhya 
śikhāgraparyantaṃ dvādaśakalāsthānāni | tatracaturaṃgula 
vyāptimānaukāra strimātrassamūḍhāṃgārapuñjadyutiḥ | sa ca 
nivṛttikalayā pṛthivyādiprakṛtyantaiḥ caturviṃśatitatvaiśca sahitena 
brahmaṇā'dhiṣṭhitaḥ | tadūrdhvaṃ 
kaṇṭhasthānasthitāṣṭāṃgulapramāṇa ṣoḍaśadalapadmavyāptimā 
nūkāraḥ dvimātrassamasamayasamuditacandrasūryadyutiḥ | sa 
pratiṣṭhākalayā puruṣādikālāntaiṣṣaḍbhistatvaiśca sahitena 
viṣṇunā'dhiṣṭhitaḥ | tadūrdhvaṃ 
tālumūlasthitacaturaṃgulapramāṇacaturdalapadmavyāptimānmakāraḥ 
ekamātro vidyudvarṇaḥ | sa vidyākalayā māyātatvena ca sahitena 
rudreṇādhiṣṭhitaḥ | tadūrdhvaṃ 
bhrumadhyasthitadvyaṃgulapramāṇadvidalapadmavyāptimān 
binduvṛttākāro'rddhamātro vidyudvarṇaḥ śāntikalayā 
śuddhavidyeśvaratatvābhyāṃ ca sahitena maheśvareṇādhiṣṭhitaḥ | 
tadūrdhvaṃ lalāṭamadhye ardhamātrā ūrddhvāgrā ardhacandrākṛtiḥ 
pādamātrā(?) candravarṇā | tadūrdhvaṃ lalāṭe nirodhī 
sacordhvāgratrikoṇākṛti raṣṭāṃśamāttro dhūmravarṇaḥ | tadūrdhvaṃ 
śirasi nādaḥ | sa daṇḍākṛtirubhayatobindudvayayuktaḥ 
ṣoḍaśāṃśamātro māṇikkavarṇaḥ | tatobrahmarandhre nādāntaḥ <p. 63> 
sa dakṣiṇāmukhahalākṛtiḥ dakṣiṇapārśvasthabinduyuktaḥ 
dvātriṃśātmamātro vidyudvarṇaḥ | evaṃ bindusthānāt bhrūmadhyā 
daikādaśāṃgulasthitabrahmarandhraparyante sthāne 
sthitānāmardhacadranirodhi nādanādāntānāṃ caturṇāmapi 
śāntyatītakalā sadāśivatatvābhyāṃ ca sahitassadāśiva evādhiṣṭhātā 
| brahmarandhrādūrdhvamekāṃgulasthānasthitā 
śaktissarvamukhahalākṛtirvāmapārśvasthavindusahitā 
catuṣṣaṣṭyaṃśamātrā | tataḥ tryaṅgalasthāne sthitā vyāpinī 
triśūlākṛtirdakṣiṇapārśvasthabindusahitā'ṣṭāviṃśatyadhikaśatāṃ(-)
śamātrā | tadūrdhvaṃ 
caturaṅgulasamānabindudvayāntargatakubjarekhāyugalāntarālassamaṃjure
khāmadhiṣaṭpañcāśadadhika dviśatatamāṃśamātrā | tadūrddhvaṃ 
caturaṃgulasthitonmanībindvadhiṣṭhānakatadūrdhvaprasṛta 
daṇḍākārarekhātmikā manomātrā | atra 
brahmarandhrādūrdhvamekatricaturaṃgulakrameṇa 
dvādaśāgulaparyantaśikhāsthāne uparyupari 
sthitāśśaktivyāpinīssamanonmanīśśatakoṭisūryaprabhāḥ 
anāhataśivenādhiṣṭhitāḥ | tāśca catasro'pi militāḥ paramākāśā 
ucyante | evamakāraścaturaṃgulaḥ | ukāro'ṣṭāṃgulaḥ | 
makāraścaturaṃgulaḥ | bindurdvyaṃgulamardhacandranirodhi 
nādanādāntā ekādaśāṃgulaṃ śakti vyāpinī samanonmanā 
dvādaśāṃgulavyāpnuvatyekacatvāriṃśadaṃgulaṃ dvādaśānāmapi 
kalānāṃ vyāptisthānam | tataśca mūlādhārāt dvādaśāntaparyanta 
muktamāneṣu tattatsthāne hakāramakārayuktahakāra maukāramūkāraṃ 
vṛttākāraṃ bindumūrddhāgrārdhavṛttākāramardhacandra 
mūrdhvatrikoṇākāraṃ nirodhinaṃ bindudvayamadhyagatadaṇḍākāraṃ 
nādadakṣiṇapārśvasthita bindusahitordhvāgra dakṣiṇāmukhahalākāraṃ 
nādāntaṃ 
vāmapārśvasthitabindusahitordhvāgravāmamukhahalākārāṃ śaktiṃ 
dakṣiṇapārśvasthitāṃ bindusahitordhvāgratriśūlākārāṃ vyāpinīṃ 
bindudvayāntarālagatakubjarekhādvayamadhyasthita ṛjurekhākṛtiṃ 
samānāṃ bindvadhiṣṭhānakordhvāgra ṛjurekhākṛtimunmanāṃ ca 
hṛdayādisthānasthitakalātatvakāraṇeśvaraissaha <p. 64> krameṇa 
pūrvapūrvatyāgena jhaṭiti manasā vicintya tadupari 
paramākāśasaritsamudbhūtakoṭisūryasamaprabha 
koṭiśītāṃśuśītalāṣṭatriṃśatkalātmaka kesarojvala 
praṇavakarṇikāpañcākṣarabījāḍhya paramānandamadhubharita 
muktabhṛṅganiṣevita cicchaktirūpa sahasradalakamalamadhyagataṃ 
sadyassamudyadanekakoṭi śāradaśaśāṅkasaṅkāśaprakāśaṃ 
paramānandajaladhiṃ niṣkalaṃ paramaśivaṃ manasā'vagāheta | evaṃ 
bhāvanāpurassaraṃ paramaśivaṃ mūlenānīya 
hṛdayamantreṇāvāhanamudrayā 
sadāśivahṛdayāṃbujaṃprāpapyāsthāpanamudrayātasmiṃ saṃsthāpya 
sannidhānamudrayā svāmimukhīkṛtya svāgataṃte mahādeveti vijñāpya 
vatsa susvāgatamitidevenoktaṃ manasā vibhāvya svāgatārghyaṃ datvā 
sannirodhanamudrayā sannirudhya svāminsarvajagannātha 
yāvatpūjāvasānakam | tāvatvaṃ prītibhāvena liṅge'sminsannidhī bhava 
iti hṛdyaṃjalibandhapūrvakaṃ saṃprārthya śivasyānumatiṃ bhāvayitvā 
nirodhārghyaṃ pradāya kālakaṇṭhyā huṃphaḍantāstreṇa 
vighnānutsārya śivaṃ kavacenāvakuṇṭhya hṛdayaśiraśśikhākavacāni 
tattanmantrairdevasya hṛdayādisthāneṣu vinyasya 
hṛdayādikarāṅgavinyāsarūpasakalīkaraṇānantaraṃ puṣpamāropya 
mūlena paramīkṛtya dhenumudrayā'mṛtīkuryāt | atrāvāhanaṃ śivasya 
sadāśivadehaprāpaṇam | sthāpanaṃ sadāśivasya hṛdaṃbuje sthāpanam | 
sannidhāpanaṃ svābhimukhīkaraṇaṃ | sannirodhanaṃ yāvatpūjāsamāpti 
sannidhānaprārthanam | avakuṇṭhanaṃ bhakteṣu prakāśārthaṃ 
vighnānāmaprāptyarthaṃ ca kavacenācchādanam | sakalīkaraṇaṃ 
hṛdayādipañcāṅganyasanam | paramīkaraṇaṃ 
śuklapītaraktāsitaraktavarṇānāṃ hṛdayādīnāṃ 
śivaikatvavarṇānusaṃdhānam | amṛtīkaraṇaṃ vigrahasya 
śivasyacābhedena pratipattiḥ | nanu viśvavyāpakasya śivasya 
kathamabhimatadeśaprāpaṇarūpamāvāhanamucyate | 
acintyādbhutānantaśaktivātma(?)śivasyavyāpakatvamavyāpakatva 
mapyastīti tacchivasya deśāntaraprāpaṇarūpamupapadyate | yadvā(-)
vyāpakasyāpi 
<p. 65> jīvasya śarīrāvacchedopādhikatvamivaśivasyāpi 
mantrataijovacchedopādhivadabhimatadeśāntaraprāptirnavirudhyate | athavā 
dāruṇivyāptasyāgnermathanakriyayā 
kvacidabhivyaṃjanavadabhimatadeśaprāpaṇabhāvanārūpayā kriyāyā 
śivaliṅgābhimatadeśe śivasyābhivyañjanamevāvāhanam | nanu sarvatra 
nityoditacidānandaprakāśarūpasya paramaśivasya 
kimidamabhivyañjanamucyate | yathā svayaṃ 
prakāśamānasyāpyaṃgāravahnipuñjasya bhasmacchannasya 
bhasmanirāsakaphutkārakriyayā'bhivyañjanaṃ evaṃ 
svayaṃprakāśamānasyāpi paramaśivasya pūjakamanasoviṣayāntareṣu 
manovyāpāreṇa taṃ prati 
cchannasyānanyamanaskavihitāvāhanakriyāpūrvakamabhimatadeśe 
liṅgādau yāvadvisarjanaṃ kartavyasya tattadupacārasamarpaṇārtha 
manusandhānasantānasyokramaṇamevābhivyañjanam | athavā 
śivapurāṇoktaprakāreṇa sadāśivahṛdayāṃbuje 
paraśivasyomāsahāyacidānandamayadivyavigrahāvirbhāvabhāvanaivāvā
hanam || tatprakāraḥ pradarśyate ||

liṅge sadāśivaṃ dhyātvā niścalenāntarātmanā |
aṣṭatriṃśatkalānyāsaṃ kṛtvā svasyāṃ tanau yathā ||

abhyarcya gandhapuṣpādyaistyaktvā liṅgātmatāmatim |
tasyāṃ mūrtī mūrtimantaṃ śivaṃ paramakāraṇam |
prāṇasthānaṃ sadeśasya cintaye daṃyayā saha ||

brahmāviṣṇuśca rudraśca tathā'nye ca surāsurāḥ |
tapobhirugrairadyāpi yasya darśanakāṃkṣiṇaḥ ||

yasmātsarvamidaṃ brahmaviṣṇurudrendrapūrvakam |
saha bhūtendriyaissarvaḥ prathamaṃ saṃprasūyate ||

kāraṇānāṃ ca yodhātā dhyātā paramakāraṇam |
na saṃprasūyate'nyasmātkutaścana kadācana ||

<p. 66> sarvaiśvaryeṇa saṃpūrṇo nāmnā sarveśvarassvayam |
sarvairmumukṣubhirdhyeyaśśaṃbhurākāśamadhyagāḥ ||

sarvopari kṛtāvāsassarvavāsaśca śāśvataḥ |
ṣaḍvidhāṃdhvamayasyāsya sarvasya jagataḥ patiḥ ||

uttarottarabhūtānāmuttaraśca niruttaraḥ |
anantamahimāṃbhodhi raparicchinnavaibhavaḥ ||

aśeṣaviṣayāmoghaśuddhabuddhivijṛṃbhaṇaḥ |
ātmaśaktyamṛtāsvādapramodabharalālasaḥ ||

anantānandasandohamakarandamadhuvrataḥ |
akhaṇḍajagadaṇḍānāṃ piṇḍīkaraṇapaṇḍitaḥ ||

audāryavīryagāṃbhīryamādhuryamakarālayaḥ |
atulassarvabhūtānāṃ rājarājo maheśvaraḥ ||

aprākṛtaśarīraṃ ta matimanmatharūpiṇam |
ghṛtarītighanībhūtasaccidānandavigraham ||

sarvalakṣaṇasaṃpannaṃ sarvāvayavaśobhanam |
raktāsyapāṇicaraṇaṃ kundamandasmitānanam ||

śuddhasphaṭikasaṅkāśaṃ phullapadmatrilocanam |
caturbhujamudārāṅgaṃ cārucandrakalādharam ||

varadābhayahastaṃ ca mṛgaṭaṃkadharaṃ haram |
sarvopamānavargasya davīyāṃsaṃ vibhāvayet ||

tatassaṃcintayettasya vāmabhāge maheśvarīm |
utphullotpalapatrābhavistīrṇāyatalocanām ||

<p. 67> pūrṇacandrābhavadanāṃ nīlakuñcitamūrddhajām |
nīlotpaladalaprakhyāṃ candrārdhakṛtaśekharām ||

ativṛttaghanottuṅgasnigdhapīnapayodharām |
tanumadhyāṃ pṛthuśroṇiṃ vītasūkṣmatarāṃbarām ||

sarvābharaṇa saṃpannāṃ māṇikyatilakojvalām |
vicitrapuṣpasaṃkīrṇakeśapāśamanoharām ||

sarvatonuguṇākārāṃ kiṃcillajjānatānanām |
hemāravindaṃ vikasaddadhānāṃ dakṣiṇe kare ||

daṇḍavaccāparaṃ hastaṃ nyasvāsīnāṃ sahāsane |
bhuktimuktipradāṃ devīṃ saccidānandarūpiṇīm ||

sadāśiveśvaraharaśrīśadruhiṇamātaram |
samastagaurīlakṣyādiśakticakrasya nāyikām ||

evaṃ devaṃ ca devīṃ ca vicintya dvyaṣṭahāyanau |
bhaktyopacāravargeṇa krameṇa paripūjayet ||

	evaṃ sadāśivasya hṛdayāṃbuje 
sāṃbaśivavigrahāvirbhāvanāpakṣe tasya sadāśivahṛdayāṃbuje 
avasthāpanaṃ svābhimukhīkaraṇam | ityādi sarvamupapadyatetarām | 
śarīraśarīriṇorabhedapratipattirūpamamṛtīkaraṇaṃ tu 
sāṃbaśivavigrahāvirbhāvapakṣa evopapadyate | svābhimate 
liṅgādāvāyāhite sadāśivavigrahe pūjārthamabhivyaktiṃ 
prārthayamānasya pūjakasyānugrahārthaṃ śivābhinnasaccidānanda 
evācintyādbhutatadīpaśaktimahimnā karakamauktikādyākāreṇa 
jalabinduriva 
sakalāvayavasaṃpūrṇasāṃbaśivavigrahākāreṇābhivyajyata iti 
śivapurāṇādimaryādā | evaṃ 
cidānandākāraparamaśivavigrahaprabhādhavalitarūpādeva 
nānāvarṇāṣṭatriṃśatkalāmayasyāpi sadāśivavigrahasya 
sphaṭikavarṇatvabhāvanopapadyate | <p. 68> sadāśivasya 
tatpuruṣādivaktraṇāṃ pītanīlasitāruṇavarṇatvaṃ tu 
pūrvādidikpatīnāmindrayamavaruṇakuberāṇāṃ 
tattatkāryopayogipītanīlasitāruṇavarṇasthirīkaraṇārthaṃ 
tattadvarṇānukaraṇaprayuktam | evaṃrūpe paramaśivasyāvāhane 
kriyamāṇe ūrdhvābhimukhasya sadāśiveśānavaktrasya 
tatpuruṣavaktravadāvisarjanaṃ prāṅmukhatvaṃ bhāvanīyam | 
āvāhanādyamṛtīkaraṇāntasaṃskāraṃ 
sāṃbasadāśivavigrahābhivyaktipakṣe sadāśivamūrtimadhya eva 
kartavyam | tatraiva paramaśivasyāṃvikāyāśca pratyekaṃ 
padārthānusamayakrameṇa pādyādyupacārāśca kartavyāḥ | 
sadāśivamūrtau paramaśivacaitanyamātrāvāhanapakṣe 
tadāvāhanāntaraṃ pādyādi | manonmanīmūrtau aṃbikāṃ 
cāvāhanādibhissaṃskṛtya pādyādyupacāraiḥ pūjayet ||

[pādyādiprakāraḥ] ||

	vāmahastena satripadīkaṃ pādyācamanārghyapātramutkṣipya 
pādyamīśvaratatvāntamācamanaṃ sadāśivatatvāntamarghyaṃ 
śivatatvāntañca vibhāvya pādyādikaṃ 
pūjakasyeśvarasadāśivatatvaprāpakaṃ ca dhyātvā mūlādhārā 
dutthitaṃ prāsādādimantraṃ pādyādikrameṇa 
bhrūmadhyabrahmarandhradvādaśāntaparyantamuccarantaṃ vibhāvayan 
hāṃ hauṃ śivāyeti mantrakrameṇa namassvāhāsvadhāntamuccārayan 
sadyojātādikrameṇa sapuṣpeṇottānena 
dakṣiṇakarāṃguṣṭhamadhyamānāmikāgreṇa 
śrīpādayossavyavāmakrameṇa pādyaṃ mukheṣu 
tatpuruṣādikrameṇācamanaṃ mūrdhasvīśānādikrameṇārghyaṃ ca 
dadyāt | sugandhi puṣpaṃ jñānamayaṃ śivasāyujyahetuṃ ca dhyātvā 
mantraṃ dvādaśāntoparisthitaśivaparyantamuccarantaṃ vibhāvya 
vauṣaḍantamantreṇa mūrddhasvīśānādikrameṇa nivedayet | aṃbikāyā 
api pādyādikaṃ taṃtratatraiva samaye padārthānusamayena dadyāt | evaṃ 
gandhādiṣvapi draṣṭavyam | tatra śivayai namaśśivāyai svadhetyādayo 
mantrā iti viśeṣaḥ | tataḥ svāhāntamūlena <p. 69> dhūpadīpau 
pūrvoktaprakāreṇācamanārghye ca śivābhyāṃ datvā astramantreṇāpi 
vastreṇa piṇḍikādhobhāgaṃ vāmahastena spṛśanneva dakṣiṇahastena 
puṣpaṃ gṛhītvā tena puṣpeṇa pūrvārcitamapohya tatpuruṣaṃ ca visṛjya 
pūrvoktaprakāreṇābhyaṅgādikaṃ sarvaṃ manasā vibhāvya hāṃ 
śivatatvāyanama iti arghyodakabindunā saṃsnāpya 
pūrvavatpādyācamanārghyāṇi datvā svāhāntamūlena 
vastradvayamupavītadvayaṃ ca sā camanaṃ datvā hāmātmatatvādhipataye 
śivāyanamaḥ | hāṃ vidyātatvādhipataye śivāya namaḥ | hāṃ 
śivatatvādhipataye śivāyanamaḥ iti puṣpāñjalitrayaṃ śivāyai nama iti 
devyai puṣpāñjaliñca kṛtvā saṃbhāvitairmanasā vibhāvitaiśca 
hemāṃbarakaṭakamakuṭakarṇikāṅgadakeyurādibhirābharaṇairnamonta(-)
mūlamantrābhyāmalaṅkṛtya gandhapuṣpāṇi samarpayet | tatra gandhaṃ 
himajalaghṛṣṭasamabhāgagorocanākuṅkumacandanailākarpūrakṛṣṇāgaru
dārukuṣṭhakastūrikākṣodovā | 
