kevalakṛtamālagandho'pi dīrghamāyuḥ pradāya paratra 
gāṇāpatyaprāptikaraḥ | evaṃbhūtāścandanagandhāḥ phalatodviguṇāḥ | 
śuklāgaruścandanāt ṣaṭguṇaḥ | tataḥ kṛṣṇāgururdviguṇaḥ | 
