paṭṭikāraktāgastya vakula lakṣmī dvikaṇṭhī vejikāpāṭala palāśāśoka 
kadalī śaṃkhinī puṣpāṇi prātaḥkālapūjāyāṃ praśastatamāni | <p. 72> 
droṇakaravīra kṛtamāla dhuttūra vyāghrī bṛhatī pāṭalakamalotpala 
caṃpakakuraṇḍapuṣpāṇi madhyāhnapūjāyāṃ | 
campakadhuttūramālatīmallikāvejikabalakarṇisahabhadrā 
bhadrāmasalyatasīśamīśaṃkhapuṣpāṇi gandhapatrañca 
sāyaṅkālapūjāyāṃ | jātī nīlotpalakanakakadamba sthalakamala 
ketakapūga punnāga danti hrīberaṃ bilvapatraṃ cārdharātrapūjāyām | 
kadambakanaka jātīpuṣpāṇi rātrāvevasamarpaṇīyāni | 
mādhavyānandayūdhikā madayaṃtikā śirīṣasarja bandhūka 
vihitakumuda ḍāḍima lāṅgalī śrīparṇī kārpāsa nimba kūśmāṇḍa 
śalmalī śinditavoṭa girivaṭa matsyākṣi kapitthatiṃtṛṇī puṣpādīni 
varjanīyāni | ketakīniṣe dho'rdharātravyatiriktaviṣayaḥ | kadambaniṣedho 
divāviṣayaḥ | girikarṇikāniṣedhonīlagirikarṇikāviṣayaḥ | 
kiṃśukaniṣedhaḥ kaṇṭakakiṃśukaviṣayaḥ | evaṃ japāvakulādīnāmapi 
kvacidvihitānāmāgamāntare niṣedhasya phalabhedānu sāriṇā 
pūjābhedena vā tattatpūryācāraprāptatattadāgamānusāripūjābhedena 
vā pūjanīyamūrtibhedena vā vyavasthā draṣṭavyā | niṣiddhānyapi 
puṣpāṇi maṇṭapālaṃkārādiṣu grāhyāṇi | patreṣu bilvatulasī 
kṛṣṇatulasī darbha dūrvāpāmārga karavīra nandyāvarta śamīsahā 
dhātakī viṣṇukrānti bhadrā mahābhadrā jātījambukabadaroduṃbara 
cūta palāśamunidvaya ṭaṅkolakoraṃḍa girikarṇīdvaya rudravarṇī 
bhūpatma hrībera madanamaruvakadroṇadvaya sinduvāra śaṃkhinī gokṣura 
vakula kṛtamālādipatrāṇi praśastāni | puṣpeṣu nīlotpalavatpatreṣu 
bilvapatraṃ praśastatamam | tulasīdvayaṃ praśastataram | yeṣāṃ puṣpāṇi 
praśastāni teṣāṃ patrāṇyapi praśastānyeva | padma nīlotpala kuṭaja 
caṃpaka jāti karavīra nandyāvarta śriyāvartabilva bṛhatīdvaya 
pāṭalīpuṣpa bilvapañcaka tulasīdvaya dūrvāgastya gandhapatrākāraṃ 
śivapuṣpapatreṣu svābhimataṃ yatkiṃcitpatrapuṣpākāraṃ vā 
sauvarṇapuṣpaṃ patrañcātipraśastam | 
añjalipūrakaissuvarṇapuṣpairvidyādehaśivāvāhanaṃ aṣṭottaraśatena
<p. 73> ekāśītyā pañcāśatā pañcaviṃśatyā vā suvarṇapuṣpaiḥ 
pratidinamarcanaṃ cāsaṅkhyeyaphaladam | 
suvarṇapuṣpasaṃpādanāśaktau suvarṇaśakalairvā 
rajatapuṣpairvā'rcanīyam | suvarṇapuṣpasya nāsti nirmālyadoṣaḥ | 
vatsarādūrdhvaṃ tannirmālyam | vatsarādūrdhvamapi pañcagavyena 
saṃśodhya punararcanīyam | evaṃ nīlotpala palāśa vakra karavīra 
giripuṣpa bilvapatra tulasīnāmapi nāsti nirmālyatvam | puṣpāṇi patrāṇi ca 
svārāmasambhavānyuttamāni | vanyāni kṛtāni parārāmodbhavāni 
pūjākāle yācitāni puṣpāṇi uttarottaramapakṛṣṭāni | 
devārāmodbhavāni tu varjanīyānyeva | puṣpālābhe yāni puṣpāṇi 
śivārhāṇi teṣāṃpatrairevārcanīyam | patrāṇāmapyalābhe teṣāṃ 
phalairarcanīyam | phaleṣu ca bījapūra jaṃbīra kadalī 
ḍāḍimādīnyarcanāyāmatipraśastāni | phalānāmapyalābhe tilataṇḍula 
siddhārthairarcanīyam | kṛṣṇatilaiśśivārcanaṃ sakalapātakaharam | evaṃ 
mūlamantreṇa puṣpādibhirabhyarcya hāṃ śivāsanāya namaḥ | hāṃ 
haṃ hāṃ śivamūrtaye namaḥ | hāṃ hauṃ śivāya namaḥ | hoṃ 
īśānamūrdhne namaḥ | heṃ tatpuruṣavaktrāyanamaḥ | huṃ 
aghorahṛdayāyanamaḥ | hiṃ vāmadevaguhyāya namaḥ | haṃ 
sadyojātamūrtaye namaḥ | ityāsanamūrtiṃ mūlaiḥ 
pañcabrahmabhiścāṣṭapuṣpikayā'bhyarcya hāṃ hṛdayāyanamaḥ | 
ityādibhiraṃgairabhyarcayet | tato nāmnā sahasreṇa śatenavā'rcayet | 
tadavasarābhāve śarvāya kṣitimūrtayenamaḥ | bhavāya jalamūrtaye 
namaḥ | rudrāya tejomūrtayenamaḥ | ugrāya vāyumūrtaye namaḥ | 
bhīmāya akāśamūrtaye namaḥ | paśupataye yajamānamūrtaye namaḥ | 
īśānāyasūryamūrtayenamaḥ | mahādevāya somamūrtaye namaḥ | 
śivāya namaḥ | maheśvarāya namaḥ | rudrāya namaḥ | viṣṇave namaḥ | 
pitāmahāya namaḥ | saṃsāravaidyāya namaḥ | sarvajñāya namaḥ | 
paramātmane namaḥ | iti nāmāṣṭakena vā'rcayet | prabhavenamaḥ | 
śaṃbhavenamaḥ | umāpataye namaḥ iti nāmatrayeṇa vā'rcayet | 
namonīlakaṇṭhāyanama iti nāmnaikenābhyarcya <p. 74> yathāsaṃbhavaṃ 
puṣpamālikābhiralaṃkuryāt | mālikāśca śatādisuvarṇapuṣparacitāḥ 
sahasrādinīlotpalaracitāḥ karavīrasitāṃbhoja vijayāsitapāṭala punnāga 
śvetamandāra nāgakesara caṃpakaracitāśca praśastāḥ | tāśca 
vicitrapuṣpāṃtararacitamālikāśca umādhārapārśvayossamṛddhā 
baddhavyāḥ | liṅgamaulau hastemaṇisuvarṇānirmitaṃ puṣpanirmitaṃ vā 
ekadvitricaturabhūmika miṃḍākhyaṃ pravṛttadāma samarpaṇīyam | evaṃ 
puṣpopacārānantaraṃ dhūpadīpopacāraḥ ||

	tatprakāraḥ (-) suvarṇarajatatāmrārakūṭānyatamanirmitaṃ 
caturaṃgulāyataṃ tadardhamānotsedhamaṣṭāṃguloṣṭhaṃ paścādbhāge 
padmadalāṅkita dvyaṃgulakaṇṭha dvyaṃgulonnata 
suvṛttakhurākārapādaṃ dvyaṃgulānāhena pūrvoktalakṣaṇapādayuktena 
vaktranālena samanvitaṃ anekasuṣireṇaikasuṣireṇa vā 
kamalamukulākṛtinā pidhānenānvitaṃ dhūpapātraṃ 
nirmalenāṃgāravahninā'pūrya tasmindhūpadravyaṃ nikṣipya 
dhūpapātraṃpidhāya nirīkṣaṇādibhissaṃskṛtya gandhapuṣpairabhyarcya 
dhūpamudrāṃ pradarśya dhūpapātraṃ dakṣiṇahastenādāya vāmahaste 
śuddhakāṃsyanirmitāṃ catuḥpañcaṣaḍaṃgulānyatamotsedhāṃ 
tāvadāyāmāṃ tāvanmānajihvāṃ tattriguṇānāhā 
mardhāṃguloṣṭhābhupapaṭṭikāyuktāmekāṃguladvyaṃgula 
sārdhadvyaṃgulaśikharāmardhāṃgulakaṇṭhāṃ tryaṃgulānāhāṃ 
tricatuḥpañcaṣaḍaṃguladairghyanālāmupariśūlapadmavṛṣabhaśaṅkha(-)
cakrānyatamacihnayuktāṃ ghaṇṭāṃ ghoṣayanneva devasya ghrāṇasamīpe 
oṃ hāṃ hauṃ śivāya dhūpaṃ svāheti dhūpaṃ pradarśya tadupari 
dhūpapātramuddhṛtya tadbhrāmayanneva kirīṭe 
bindudvayānvitapārśvadaṇḍākāraṃ nādaṃ mukhavṛtte bindudehe 
hakāraṃ bāhno raukāraṃ pādayorūkāraṃ ca dhūpapātrabhramaṇena 
bhāvayet ||

	dhūpadravyam (-) karpūrāgaru candanatakkolajātiphala lavaṅgasilhaka 
māṃsīmustāpatracūrṇaṃ yakṣakardamākhyam | candanāgarukarpūrailā 
lavaṅgatvakpatrapuṣpa silhaka jaṭāmāṃsīcūrṇaṃ prājāpatyanāmakam | 
candanāgaru karpūra <p. 75> kastūrī lavaṅgatvaksilhaka sitā 
mustācūrṇaṃ vijayākhyam | karpūra kṛṣṇāgaruhrībera 
kuṃkumakundurūtturuṣkavisacandanacūrṇaṃ 
kramādekadvitricatuḥpañcaṣaṭsaptabhāgamadhumiśraṃ 
śītāṃśunāmakam | candanāgaru karpūrasilhaka 
sarjarasakuṣṭhamustācūrṇaṃ kalyāṇanāmakam | candanāgarukastūrī 
mustāsilhaka cūrṇamamṛtākhyam | takkolapūgakarpūrajātīphala 
lavaṅgacūrṇaṃ sugandhākhyam | evamādīni pṛthakpṛthaṅnāmnā 
prasiddhāni dhūpadravyāṇi | itthaṃ candanāgarukarpūra kuṣṭha 
guggulucūrṇaṃ ghṛtamadhuyuktaṃ candanāgarukarpūrakuṣṭacūrṇaṃ 
śarkarāghṛtamadhuyuktaṃ karpūrāgarucandananiryāsacūrṇaṃ 
kuṃkumā dekacatuṣṣaṭsaptabhāgamagaruniryāsacandanacūrṇaṃ 
kramādekadvitricaturguṇamīṣatkarpūramiśritaṃ 
madhuyuktamagarucandanośīracūrṇaṃ madhuyuktaṃ 
kuṣṭhacandanacūrṇaṃ ghṛtayuktaṃ gulabilvapatracūrṇaṃ 
guggulucūrṇaṃghṛtayuktaṃ kevalameva vā 
gugguluniryāsacandanāgarusaugandhikānyatamacūrṇaṃ ca 
dhūpadravyamiti || tatra kevalagugguludhūpaḥ saptajanmakṛtapāpaharaḥ | 
candanadhūpassarvapāpaharaḥ | 
saugandhikadhūpassarvakāryārthasādhakaḥ | 
kṛṣṇāgarudhūpassarvapāpaharaḥ | śvetāgarudhūpo muktipradaḥ | 
lākṣākastūrīdhūpaḥ caturvedādhyāyisadbrāhmaṇajanmapradaḥ | 
ghṛtamiśragugguludhūpomāsārdhasamarpitaḥ kalpakoṭisahasraparyantaṃ 
śivapurabhogasya sārvabhaumajanmatvaprāpakaḥ | 
dvisahasraphalaṃmahiṣākṣa gugguludhūpaḥ tālavṛkṣacūrṇena sahitaḥ 
śivasāyujyapradāyakaḥ | īśānādimukhapañcake kramāt śītāri 
kṛṣṇāgaru śuklāgaru saugandhika gugguludhūpāḥ praśastāḥ ||
	evaṃ dhūpopacārānantaraṃ dīpopacāraḥ (-) tasya pātraṃ 
dhūpapātroktapādanālasahitaṃ tryaṃgulapramāṇaṃ gajoṣṭhākārañca 
| vartikā karpūramayīvastrakhaṇḍamayī taṃtukhaṇḍamayī 
kārpāsamayīvā caturaṃguladīrghā 
catustridvyekāṃgulajvālānuguṇapariṇāhā kāryā | vastrakhaṇḍādimayī 
cet uttamādikrameṇa sati <p. 75> saṃbhave 
karpūrāgarucandanacūrṇādigarbhā kāryā | tatra ca kapilāghṛtamuttamam 
| gavāṃtaraghṛtaṃ madhyamam | ajāghṛtaṃ tilatailamadhamam | 
uṣṭramahiṣyādighṛtaṃ vṛkṣabījādibhavaṃ ca varjanīyam | yadvā (-)
goghṛtamātramuttamam | ajāghṛtaṃ mahiṣīghṛtaṃ ca madhyamam | 
pūtigandhaniṃvakarajeraṃḍāditailaṃ varjanīyam | tailamātramadhamam | 
evamuktalakṣaṇapātravihitavartyāropitaṃ dīpaṃ 
nirīkṣaṇādibhissaṃskṛtya puṣpairabhyarcya dīpamudrāṃ pradarśya 
dīpamuddhṛtya ghaṇṭāṃ ghoṣayanneva hāṃ hauṃ śivāya dīpaṃ 
svāheti netreṣu pradarśya dhūpapātravat kirīṭādipādāntaṃ 
tadvarṇavinyāsabhāvanayā dīpamātraṃ bhramayet | 
tataśśivāyācamanīyamarghyaṃ ca datvā devaṃ santuṣṭaṃ dhyātvā 
bhagavannājñāṃ dehi bhogāṃgāni pūjayāmiti vijñāpya 
āvaraṇapūjāṃ kuryāt || atha āvaraṇārcanam ||

	pañcabrahmaṣaḍaṅgaiśca prathamāvaraṇam | vidyeśvarairdvitīyam | 
gaṇeśvaraistṛtīyam | lokapālaiścaturtham | tadāyudhaiḥ pañcamam | etāni 
pañcāvaraṇāni śivāsanapadmasya karṇikāyāṃ śivamabhyarcya 
tasyadalamūleṣu dalamadhyeṣu dalamadhyāgrayormadhyeṣu dalāgreṣu 
tadadhobhāgeṣu ca pūjayet | yadvā (-) śivāsanapadmadalamūlarūpeṣu 
liṅgamūlabhāgeṣu taddalāgrarūpeṣu pīṭhoparideśāgrabhāgeṣu 
pīṭhakaṇṭhe pīṭhapāde brahmaśilāsthānīye padmapīṭhe cārcayet | 
homīśānamūrdhne namaḥ | sphaṭikavarṇaṃ triśūlābhayapāṇi 
mumāsahitamīśānaṃ pūjayāmi | heṃ tatpuruṣavaktrāya namaḥ | 
kanakavarṇaṃ pītāṃbaropavītaṃ mātulaṅgākṣasūtradhāriṇaṃ 
gaurīsahitaṃ tatpuruṣaṃ pūjayāmi | huṃ aghorahṛdāyāya namaḥ | 
meghavarṇaṃ vabhruśmaśruśiroruhaṃ daṃṣṭrākarālavadanaṃ 
sarpavṛścikakapālamālābharaṇaṃ khaṭvāṅga kapālakheṭaka 
pāśānvitavāmakaracatuṣṭayaṃ 
triśūlaparaśukhaḍgadaṇḍānvitadakṣiṇakaracatuṣṭayaṃ 
gaṅgāsahitamaghoraṃ pūjayāmi | hiṃ vāmadevaguhyāya namaḥ | 
aruṇamaruṇavastramālyopavītaṃ khaḍgakheṭadharaṃ 
gaṇāṃbikāsahitaṃ vāmadevaṃ pūjayāmi | <p. 77> haṃ 
sadyojātamūrtaye namaḥ | dhavalavarṇaṃ 
dhavalasraggandhabhūṣaṇoṣṇīpāṃbaradharaṃ varābhayakara 
maṃbikāsahitaṃ sadyojātaṃ pūjayāmi iti 
kramādīśāneṃdrayamakuberavaruṇādi 
dikṣvīśānāditattatpūjāvelāyāṃ ūrdhvavaktrahṛdayaguhyapādarūpa 
tattatsthāna maṃkuśamudrayākṛṣya 
dīpātpravartitapradīparītyā'bhinnānbhāvayitvā'rcayet | īśānādyāḥ 
pañcāpi śūlaṭaṅkābhayamanoharakaracatuṣṭayā vā dhyātavyāḥ | 
evamāgamāntaraprasiddhānyapi teṣāṃ dhyānāni draṣṭavyāni | hāṃ 
hṛdayāyanamaḥ | hiṃ śrirase namaḥ | huṃ śikhāyai namaḥ | haiṃ 
kavacāyanamaḥ | hauṃ netratrayāyanamaḥ | haḥ astrāya namaḥ | iti candra 
cāmīkara sindūra bhṛṅgavidyudagnivarṇān padmāsanasthā 
nardhendujaṭāmakuṭadhāriṇaścaturvaktrān prativaktraṃ trilocanān 
kapālaśūlavaradābhayahastān vāminī nīlinī cakriṇī śaṅkhinī 
khaḍginī gaṅginī śaktisahitān hṛdayaśiraśśikhākavacadevān 
pūjayāmīti 
hṛdayaśiraśśikhāditattatsthānerbhyo'kuśamudrayāsamākṛṣyāgneyanair
(-)ṛtavāyavyeśāna koṇasthadaleṣu pūrvādicaturdalā nyagreṣvastraṃ ca 
pūjayet | īśānadale brahmasvīśānaṃ aṅgeṣu netre śirasi ca 
krameṇottarottaradiksthatayā pūjayet | athavā karṇikāyāṃ devasya 
purastādīśānaṃ netrañca pūjayet | netramastravaddikṣu vā pūjayet ||

	athadvitīyāvaraṇam (-) anantāya bhūmisahitāyanamaḥ | sūkṣmāya 
svāhāsahitāya namaḥ | śivottamāya svadhāsahitāyanamaḥ | ekanetrāya 
kṣāṃtisahitāya namaḥ | ekarudrāya puṣṭisahitāya namaḥ | trimūrtāya 
śrīsahitāyanamaḥ | śrīkaṇṭhāya kīrtisahitāya namaḥ | śikhaṇḍine 
medhāsahitāya namaḥ | itiṃ hemāgnimegha bhṛṅgeṣu hima vidruma 
sphaṭikavarṇān varadābhayajñānarudrākṣamālādhāriṇa striṇetrān 
śivajñānāvatārakān svasvaśaktisahitān vidyeśvarān pūjayāmīti 
pūrvādyaiśānādikramāddigidikṣu pūrvādīśānakoṇānteṣu vā 
pūjayet | <p. 78> kuṇḍalīsahitāya nandikeśvarāya namaḥ | aruṇavarṇaṃ 
triśūlākṣasūtravarābhayakaraṃ kuṇḍalīsahitaṃ nandinaṃ pūjayāmi | 
padminīsahitāya mahākālāya namaḥ | pītakṛṣṇavarṇaṃ 
vabhruśmaśruśiroruhaṃ śūlakapālakhaḍgakheṭadhāriṇaṃ 
padminīsahitaṃ mahākālaṃ pūjayāmi | hrādinīsahitāya bhṛṅgiṇe 
namaḥ | śvetavarṇaṃ nirmāṃsavigrahaṃ daṇḍākṣasūtradharaśikhaṃ 
śivāvalokanatatparaṃ hrādinīsahitaṃ bhṛṅgigaṃ pūjayāmi | bhṛṅgiṇī 
sahitāya gaṇapataye namaḥ | ratnāṅga pāśāṃkuśa 
dantapakvāmraphaladhāriṇaṃ bhṛṅgiṇīsahitaṃgaṇapatiṃ pūjayāmi | 
bhadrāsahitāya vṛṣabhāya namaḥ | sphaṭikavarṇaṃ dharmasvarūpaṃ 
śivadhyānaparaṃ bhadrāsahitaṃ vṛṣabhaṃ pūjayāmi | 
devayānīsahitāya skandāyanamaḥ | kanakavarṇaṃ vālaveṣaṃ 
śaktikukkuṭavarābhayahastaṃ devayānīsahitaṃ skandaṃ pūjayāmi | 
ambikāyai namaḥ | śyāmavarṇāṃ sihmavāhanāṃ 
śūlādarśakaradvayā mumāṃ pūjayāmi | rūpiṇīsahitāya 
caṇḍeśvarāya namaḥ | bhevavarṇaṃ caturvaktraṃ 
kamaṇḍalvakṣasūtraśūlaparaśudhāriṇaṃ sarpakaṅkaṇopavītaṃ 
rupiṇīsahitaṃ caṇḍeśvaraṃ pūjayāmi | iti 
pūrvādīśānakoṇaparyantamarcayet | yadvā (-) vṛṣa nandi gaṇeśa 
mahākala skanda bhṛṅgigaurīcaṇḍān nandigaṇapati mahākāla 
bhṛṅgivṛṣa skandagaurī caṇḍānvā pūrvādikrameṇe pūjayet | athavā 
gaurī caṇḍeśvara nandi mahākāla gaṇeśa vṛṣa bhṛṅgi skandāvā 
gaurīcaṇḍeśvara mahākāla vṛṣabha gaṇeśa skandanandi bhṛṅgiṇovā 
uttarādikrameṇa pūjanīyāḥ || umāvṛṣabhagaṇapati nandīśa 
mahākālabhṛṅgi caṇḍaskandāḥ kuberaśakra yamavaruṇa nir(-)
ṛtivāyvīśānādidikṣu vā pūjanīyāḥ | eteṣāṃ dhyānabhedāśca 
tattadāgamaprasiddhā draṣṭavyāḥ ||

	evaṃ gaṇeśvaraistṛtīyāvaraṇaṃ saṃpūjya 
lokapālaiścaturthāvaraṇamarcayet | indrāya śacīsahitāya namaḥ | 
suvarṇavarṇamairāvatārūḍhaṃ vajrāṃkuśavarābhayapāṇiṃ 
śacīsahitamindraṃ pūjayāmi | agnaye svāhāsahitāya namaḥ | 
raktavarṇaṃ <p. 79> kamaṇḍalvakṣasūtraśaktivaramudrānvitaṃ 
meṣārūḍhaṃ svāhāsahitamagniṃ pūjayāmi | yamāya 
kālakaṃṭhīsahitāya namaḥ | kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ 
daṇḍapāśavarābhayavāriṇaṃ mahiṣārūḍhaṃ kālakaṇṭhīsahitaṃ 
yamaṃ pūjayāmi | dāhinīsahitāyanair(-)ṛtāyanamaḥ | raktavarṇaṃ 
khaḍgakheṭakavarābhayadhāriṇaṃ bhūtārūḍhaṃ dāhinīsahitaṃ nair(-)
ṛtaṃ pūjayāmi | varuṇāya bhoginīsahitāya namaḥ | candravarṇaṃ 
pāśakamalavarābhayakaraṃ makarārūḍhaṃ bhoginīsahitaṃ varuṇaṃ 
pūjayāmi | vāyave ghorāsahitāya namaḥ dhūmravarṇaṃ 
dhvajakamalavarābhayadhāriṇaṃ mṛgārūḍhaṃ ghorāsahitaṃ vāyuṃ 
pūjayāmi | kuberāya gaṃbhīriṇīsahitāya namaḥ | svarṇavarṇaṃ 
gadānidhivarābhayakaraṃ kharvavigrahaṃ manuṣyārūḍhaṃ 
gaṃbhīrīṇīsahitaṃ kuberaṃ pūjayāmi | īśānāya harṣiṇīsahitāya 
namaḥ | candravarṇaṃ śūlapāśavarābhayakaraṃ triṇetraṃ 
vṛṣabhārūḍhaṃ harṣiṇīsahitamīśānaṃ pūjayāmīti prāgādikrameṇa 
pūjayet | brahmaṇe sāvitrīsahitāyanamaḥ | suvarṇavarṇaṃ caturvaktraṃ 
kamaṇḍalvakṣasūtrasrugdaṇḍadhāriṇaṃ haṃsārūḍhaṃ sāvitrīsahitaṃ 
brahmāṇaṃ pūjayāmi | viṣṇave lakṣmīsahitāyanamaḥ | vidyudvarṇaṃ 
sahasraphaṇālaṃkṛtamanantarūpaṃ śaṅkhacakragadākamaladhāriṇaṃ 
kūrmārūḍhaṃ lakṣmīsahitaṃ viṣṇuṃ pūjayāmīti ||

	indreśānamadhye nir(-)ṛtivaruṇamadhye ca vidhātṛvaikuṇṭhau pūjayet 
| yadvā yamasya uttarabhāge kuberasya dakṣiṇabhāge ca tau pūjayet ||

	athalokapālāyudhaiḥ pañcamāvaraṇam (-) prasannātmaśaktisahitāya 
vajrāyanamaḥ | nānāvarṇadharaṃ dṛḍhakarkaśavigrahaṃ 
vajramūrdhānaṃ dīptaṃ prasannātmaśaktisahitaṃ vajraṃ pūjayāmi | 
śaktaye namaḥ | aruṇavarṇāṃ varābhayakarāṃ śirasā śakti 
vibhrāṇāṃ yoṣidākārāṃ śaktiṃ pūjayāmi | kopātmaśaktisahitāya 
daṇḍāya namaḥ | kṛṣṇavarṇaṃ varābhayakaraṃ lohitalocanaṃ 
daṇḍamūrdhānaṃ kopātmaśaktisahitaṃ daṇḍaṃ pūjayāmi | 
guṇātmaśaktisahitāya khaḍgāya namaḥ | śyāmavarṇaṃ <p. 80> 
varābhayakaramardhalocanaṃ khaḍgālaṃkṛtamūrdhānaṃ 
guṇātmaśaktisahitaṃ khaḍgaṃ pūjayāmi | komalātmaśaktisahitāya 
pāśāya namaḥ | kiṃśukapuṣpavarṇaṃ nābheradho bhujaṅgākāraṃ 
tadūrddhvaṃ puruṣākṛtiṃ saptaphaṇopetamūrdhānaṃ 
komalātmaśaktisahitaṃ pāśaṃ pūjayāmi | viṣātmaśaktisahitāya 
dhvajāyanamaḥ | pītavarṇaṃ varābhayakaraṃ vivṛtāsyaṃ 
mūrdhnidhvajānvitaṃ viṣātmaśaktisahitaṃ dhvajaṃ pūjayāmi | 
gadāyainamaḥ | pītavarṇāṃ yoṣidākārāṃ gadopetaśirasaṃ gadāṃ 
pūjayāmi | vikṛtātmaśaktisahitāya śūlāya namaḥ | śyāmavarṇaṃ 
triṣūlāṃkitamastakamañjaliyutaṃ vikṛtātmaśaktisahitaṃ triśūlaṃ 
pūjayāmi | mahātmaśaktisahitāya padmāya namaḥ | śaṅkhavarṇaṃ 
padmakośāṃkitamūrdhānaṃ mahātmaśaktisahitaṃ padmaṃ pūjayāmi | 
maṅgalātmaśaktisahitāya cakrāya namaḥ | śyāmavarṇaṃ 
śatāracakrāṃkitamastakaṃ maṅgalātmaśaktisahitaṃ cakraṃ pūjayāmi | 
ime cāvaraṇadevāśśivābhimukhāśśivamaṃbikāṃ ca 
bhaktyāvīkṣamāṇāḥ svāsaneṣūpaviṣṭā dhyeāḥ | 
dvibhujāścaturbhujāścaite hastāñjalipuṭāvādhyeyāḥ | evaṃ 
pañcāvaraṇapūjāśaktau 
pañcabrahmaṣaḍaṅgarūpamekamāvaraṇamarcayet | teṣāṃ ca 
brahmaṣaḍaṅgadevānāmāvāhanasthāpanasannidhāna sannirodhana 
pādyācamanārghyapuṣpadānākhyaṃ saṃskārāṣṭakaṃ kāryam | 
yadvā (-) āvāhanādi saṃskārāṣṭakaṃ samuditameva smṛtvā 
pratyekamarghyamātraṃ datvā pūraṇatayā brahmāntaṃ 
tattadarghyāvasāne krameṇa surabhipahmatriśūlamakarasragākhyamudrāḥ 
pradarśyāṅgānāṃ namaskāramudrāṃ pradarśayet | 
pañcabrahmaṣaḍaṅgapūjanāśaktau kevalaṃ 
brahmāvaraṇamātramaṅgāvaraṇamātraṃ vā'rcayet | athavā (-)
tattatsthāne vāmādiśakiṃ pūrvādidikṣvabhyarcya sadāśivasyāṃke 
vāmabhāge sthitāṃ manonmanīmabhyarcayet | 
itthamāvaraṇārcanānantaraṃ 
śivamaṣṭapuṣpikayā'bhyarcyācamanārghyāṇi datvā mūlamantreṇa 
puṣpaṃ samarpayet | śivasyāvaraṇabhāvakṛtaśobhāsiddhaye 
pañcabrahmaṣaḍaṅgādīnāṃ śivapṛthagbhāvenārcanāyāṃ 
<p. 81> prasaktasya pūjātāmasatvadoṣasya parihārāya 
śāradaśaśāṅkakoṭisaṅkāśa paramāmṛtasyandi 
paramaśivamayūkhajālamagnatayā sarvānapyāvaraṇadevān 
paramaśivenaikavarṇān paramaśivāpṛthagbhūtān bhāvayet | tataśśive 
dhenumudrāṃ mahāmudrāṃ ca pradarśya gandhapuṣpaiḥ 
ghaṇṭāmastramantreṇābhyarcya sāvaraṇāya devāya dhūpadīpau 
pradarśayet | evamāvaraṇārcanaṃ kartavyaṃ na kartavyaṃ veti vikalpitaṃ 
keṣuci dāgameṣvātmārthapūjāyāṃ bhogāṅgapūjanasya niṣiddhatvāt ||

atha [naivedyavidhiḥ] ||

	tatra vrīhiśāli priyaṃgu nīvāra godhūma vaiṇava yavāḥ 
praśastāḥ | tatra vrīhayaḥ kaniṣṭhāśśālayo madhyamāḥ itare 
śreṣṭhāḥ | tatrāpi priyaṃgunīvāra godhūma vaiṇavāni 
śatasahasralakṣānantaphalānyuttarottaraṃ praśastāni | yadvā 
śālayaḥśreṣṭhāḥ yavavaiṇavādayo madhyamāḥ vrīhayaḥ kaniṣṭhāḥ | 
sitataṇḍulāśśālayaḥ itarevrīhaya iti bhedaḥ | ātmārthapūjāyāṃ 
kuḍavādi caturdroṇaparyantamuttarottaraṃ praśastam | 
pañcaviṃśatyuttaradviśatasaṅkhyaiḥ vrīhibhirekā śuktirucyate | 
śuktidvayaṃ talaṃ taladvayaṃ prakuñcam | prakuñcadvayaṃ prasṛtiḥ 
prasṛtidvayaṃ kuḍavam | kuḍavadvayamañjaliḥ | añjalidvayaṃ prastham | 
prasthadvayaṃ pātram | pātradvayamāḍhakam | āḍhakadvayaṃ śivam | 
śivadvayaṃ droṇam | athavā guñjādvayaṃ māṣaḥ | 
māṣaviṃśatirniṣkam | niṣkāṣṭakam palam | palacatuṣṭayaṃ pādaḥ | 
pādacatuṣṭayaṃ prastham | prasthacatuṣṭayamāḍhakam | taccatuṣṭayaṃ 
droṇam | droṇacatuṣṭayāvadhikān naivedyārthaṃ kalpitān keśakīṭādi 
virahitān nirmukta tu ṣa kambukaṇā nakhaṇḍā natidhāvalyaśāli 
taṇḍulān 
praśastavarṇagandharasairvastrapūtairjalairmuhurmuhurniṣpīḍanapūrvakaṃ 
ṣaṭkṛtvaṣṣaḍaṅgamantraissaṃkṣālya samyagvālukādīn saṃśodhya 
pākabhāṇḍe nihiteṣuteṣvadhikardhāvadhikaṃ <p. 82> jalaṃ prakṣipya 
gomayopalipte prokṣite pakṣidarśanādirahite pariśrite bahiṣkṛtādyagocare 
mahānase hṛdayamantrārcitāyāṃ cullyāṃ vāmadevamantreṇa uddhṛtaṃ 
pākabhāṇḍaṃ hṛdayamantreṇāropya aghoreṇāgniṃ vinyasya mukhena 
pradīpya yathā'nna mapakvaṃ matipakvaṃ ca na bhavati tathā 
sāvadhānaṃ pacet | evaṃ śudhānnapākaḥ | taṇḍuladviguṇakṣīreṇa 
taṇḍulārdhamudgasahitena vā taṇḍulatriguṇakṣīreṇa 
taṇḍulacaturthāṃśamudgasahitena taducitagulakadalīphalayutena vā 
pāyasānnapākaḥ | taṇḍulacaturthāṃśamānatilapūrṇena 
tilārdhamānena tilacaturthāṃśamānena vā ghṛtena ca kṛsarānnapākaḥ | 
athavā taṇḍulārdhamudgacūrṇamiśraiḥ kiñcillavaṇacūrṇayutaiśca 
kṛsarānnapākaḥ | pratyekaṃ taṇḍulārdhapramāṇābhyāṃ 
kṣīraguḍābhyāṃ tadardhapramāṇena ghṛtena ca gulānnapākaḥ | athavā 
taṇḍuladviguṇakṣīreṇa taṇḍulārdhagulasahitena gulārdhaghṛtasahitena 
gulānnapākaḥ | sthavā taṇḍulatriguṇa kṣīreṇa 
taṇḍulatritayāṃśamudgasahitena 
taṇḍulacaturthāṃśagulamiśreṇakadalīphalayutena ca gulānnapākaḥ | 
taṇḍulacaturthāṃśaistattṛtīyāṃśaistatsamairvā 
mudgairnālikerakhaṇḍayutaistadrahitairvā mudgānnapākaḥ | 
śuddhānnapāyasānna kṛsarānna gulānna mudgānnānyuttarottaraṃ 
sahasraguṇaphalāni | evaṃ dadhimiśritaṃ madhumiśritaṃ cānnaṃ 
praśastam | eteṣvanekaṃ ekaṃ vā yathā vibhavaṃ kāryam | 
naivedyasyāṣṭamāṃśena ṣoḍaśāṃśena vā mudgāḍhakī māpa 
rājamāpa viṣpāva kulatthādyanyatamena kartavyaṃ | evaṃ mudgādyāśca 
sati saṃbhave nistvagvidalarūpā grāhyāḥ | śākāni 
prasthānnanaivedyasya paladvayapramāṇena ekapalapramāṇena vā kadalī 
panasa kuśmāṇḍorvāruka kāravalli vyāghrī bṛhatīdvaya kośātakīdvaya 
cūta nālikera phalādīni śiśukanda vallīkanda sūraṇakandādyanyāni ca 
praśastarasagandhā nyārdrāṇi śuṣkāṇi vā yathārhaṃ lavaṇa marīci 
jīraka elā cūrṇa śarkarādi sakalasaṃskāropetāni ghṛtabharjitāni 
kāryāṇi | <p. 83>  āmlena ghanatakreṇa lavaṇamarīci jīrakakuluttha 
siddhārthacūrṇa śarkarāsahitaṃ coṣyaṃ kāryam | māṣa mudgagodhūma 
śālipiṣṭādi vikārāssamṛddhaśarkaropetāḥ karpūrailādicūrṇairvāsitā 
bahavo'pūṣāḥ pānakādayaśca kāryā | naivedyasya ṣoḍaśāṃśaṃ 
dvātriśāṃśaṃ catuṣṣaṣṭyaṃśaṃ vā ghṛtam | ghanadathi(?) 
aṣṭamāṃśam | sarvatra kṣīradadhighṛtāni gavyānyeva grāhyāṇi | 
sthālikāssuvarṇena rajatena tāmreṇa śuddhakāṃsyena vā kartavyāḥ | 
aṣṭacatvāriṃśadaṃgulāyāmāḥ ekāṃgulotsedhāḥ 
aṃgulaghanoṣṭhavatyaśceduttamāḥ | uttamottamādikrameṇa tu 
ṣaṭtriṃśadaṃgulaprabhṛti dvādaśāṃgulaparyantāyāmā 
navayavaprabhṛtyekapavaparyantamānoṣṭhavatya 
oṣṭhapramāṇāyāmevatravatya stadrahitāvā navāṃgulāyāmā 
stadardhamānāścātijaghanyāḥ | sarvāśca pādarahitāssuvṛttākārāḥ 
kartavyāḥ | sthālikādhāratripādyaḥ 
pūjanīyaliṅgapīṭhikotsedhaparyantamunnatāḥ prakartavyāḥ | naivedyaṃ 
ca sarvaṃśivadīkṣāsaṃskṛtaiḥ śuddhavastrairbhasmarudrākṣabhūṣitaiḥ 
pavitradhāribhiḥ paricārakaiḥ kārayet | tathā bhūṣitābhiḥ strībhirvā 
kārayitvā dravyaśuddhikāle pūjakastaṇḍulakṣālanādimantrānjapet | yadi 
kṛtaṃ naivedya mapakva matipakvaṃ kālātipātā datiśītalaṃ 
narairlaṃghitaṃ vā syāt tadā'nyatpakvaṃ nivedanīyam ||

	athanaivedyasamarpaṇam (-) devasya pādyamācamanīyamarghyaṃ ca 
datvā devasya purato gomayena caturaśraṃ maṇḍalaṃ parikalpya 
piṣṭādicūrṇairalaṃkṛtyaśuddhānnapāyasānnādipūritāḥ 
kadalīnālikera cūta panasadrākṣā 
kharjūrādiphalirlaḍḍukakastūrikāpiṣṭaka modakādibhirapūpaiḥ 
kadalīpanasādiśākairārdrakorvārukādihāritaiścūtanāraṃgādyupadaṃ
śairmudgavidalādisūpaiścavalayākārasopānakrameṇa 
nibaddhairbhūṣitāḥ maddhye kṣīradadhighanairalaṃkṛtāḥ 
sadyoghṛtābhiṣiktāḥ śarkarādadhikṣīra
<p. 84> phalarasādivikārairnānāvidhapeyacoṣyalehyaiḥ
kṣīradadhinavanītaghṛtairelācaṃpakamukula karpūra mṛgamada lāmajja 
pāṭalīpuṣpādivāsita suśītala snapanakalaśāhṛtāḍhakatadardha 
tadardhapramāṇena pānīyena paripūritaiścaṣakaiḥ paritaḥ pariṣkṛtāḥ 
śivasya śivāyāśca naivedyasthālikāḥ sadāśivasya manonmanyāśca 
parivāradevatānāmāvaraṇadevatānāṃ ca naivedyasthālikāśca nidhāya 
sthālikānāmupari patraṃ vinyasya hṛdayena prokṣya tālatraya 
digbandhanāvakuṇṭhana dhenumudrā viracaṣya annamudrāṃ 
parvatamudrāṃ pradarśya pūrvavinyastaṃ patramuddhṛtyāstreṇapariṣicya 
hṛdayena pratyekamāpośanaṃ datvāsapuṣpayā mṛgamudrayā pūrvaṃ 
gaṇapataye naivedya tatpuṣpaṃ visṛjya hastaprakṣālanaṃ kṛtvā hāṃ 
hauṃ śivāya svadheti śivāya naivedyaṃ pañcavāraṃ trivāra 
mekavāraṃ vā naivedyadānābhinapavatyā sapuṣpavā mṛgamudrayā 
naivedyaṃ datvā sadāśivādikrameṇa sarvebhyo'pi pṛthakpṛthak 
naivedyaṃ dadyāt | pṛthak pātrāsaṃbhave sarvāsāṃ 
parivārāvaraṇadevatānāmekasminneva pātre naivedyamānīya pratyekaṃ 
nivedayet | tataśśivāya sugandhipānīyaṃ pradāya namontamūlena 
puṣpaṃ samarpya dravyajātaṃ saṃpūrṇaṃ vibhāvya 
svadhāntamūlenācamanaṃ datvā devasya 
savyavāmahastayorudvartanārthaṃ karpūrādisahitaṃ candanaṃ datvā 
hastaprakṣālanagaṇḍūṣa pādakṣālanādi bhāvayet | sarvāṇi ca 
nirmālyānyuddhṛtya sadāśivanirmālyaṃ prāgīśadiśi 
vinyastagandhapuṣpanirmālyābhyāṃ saha aiśānyāṃ diśi caṇḍeśāya 
nivedayet ||

	atha sadāśivaḥ kena vaktreṇa bhuṅkte ūrdhvavaktreṇa | 
bhakṣyabhojyānnapānādi lehyaṃ coṣyamanekadhā | ūrdhvavaktre 
pradātavyaṃ yatkiṃcidiha coditamiti sarvajñānottaravacanāt | 
bhakṣyaṃbhojyaṃ ca peyaṃ ca lehyaṃ coṣyaṃ ca pañcadhā | 
ūrdhvavaktre pradātavyaṃ hṛdayena ṣadānaneti dviśativacanācca | athavā 
pañcabhirapi vaktrairbhuṅkte | pañcavaktreṣu 
naivedyamūrdhvavaktre'thavā punaḥ <p. 85> riti pañcasu vaktreṣu 
pratyekanaivedyavidhānasyāpi darśanāt | ūrdhvavaktre naivedyadānaṃ ca 
tadūrdhvavaktraṃ pūjākāle dakṣiṇāmukhībhūtaṃ vibhāvya kartavyam | 
devasya diśyuttarābhimukhatayā pūjakasya sthitatvāt | sthaṇḍile caraliṅge 
ca sādhakābhimukhaśśivaḥ | pratyavagktrassakuṃbhādau sthire 
dvārābhisammukha(-)iti caraliṅgārcane devasya 
pūjakābhimukhatvaśravaṇāt | evaṃcātmārthapūjāyāṃ śivasya 
sādhakābhimukhatvasiddhyarthaṃ hṛdayaguhyapādāvayavā api 
dakṣiṇadiksthā eva | yāni tu pūjakasya 
śivābhimukhāvasthānaparihāravacanāni na 
prācyāmagrataśśaṃbhornottare yoṣidāśraye | na pratīcyāṃ yataḥ 
pṛṣṭhaṃ tasmāddakṣaṃ samāśrayedityādīni(,) tāni 
pūrvābhimukhasthiraliṅgaviṣayāṇi | caraliṅgapūjāyāṃ sthaṇḍile 
caraliṅga ca sādhakābhimukhaśśiva iti viśeṣavacanadarśanāt | agnau vā 
nirṛtau vā'pi sthitvā devaṃ prapūjayediti vacanānusāreṇa 
pūjakasyāgneyadigavasthāne śivasya pūjakābhimukhatvaṃ na labhyata iti 
cet satyaṃ | tadapi vacanaṃ sthiraliṅgaviṣayameva | sthiraliṅgaṃ 
sarvasādhāraṇyena lokānugrāhakatvācca catasṛṣu dikṣu sveṣṭamukhamiti 
yasyāṃ diśidvāraṃ taddigabhimukhaṃ bhavati | tatra hṛccaraṇaissārdha 
mūrddhvamukhaṃ tadvārābhimukhaṃ | dvārasyābhimukhaṃ 
corddhvavaktraṃ tatra prakalpayediti vacanāt | yasyāṃ diśi bhavedvāraṃ 
tāṃ prācīṃ parikalpayediti vacanācca | athavā ūrdhvavaktramekameva 
hṛdguhyacaraṇaissaha dvārābhimukhaṃ bhavati | tatpuruṣādivaktrāṇi tu 
pūrvādidikṣveva vyavasthitāni na tu dvārabhedena bhidyante | prāsādasya 
dvārambhavatu yathā kāṣṭhayā kāmaṃ | tatpuruṣādimukhāni na jahati 
pūrvādidiksaṃsthāmiti vacanāt | idaṃ tatpuruṣādivaktraviṣaye 
pakṣadvayamapi kāmikasaṃmatam | ata eva tatra paścimadvārārcane 
dvārasyābhimukhaṃ cordhvavaktraṃ dehaṃ 
prakalpayedityupakramyapuruṣaṃ pūrvadeśe vā paścime vā'tha cintayet | 
dakṣiṇe vottarevā'pi bahurūpaṃ vicintaye || uttare <p. 86> dakṣiṇe vā'pi 
vāmadevaṃ smaret guruḥ | paścime pūrvadeśe vā sadyavaktraṃ 
smannyaset ityuktaṃ || tatraiva dakṣiṇadvārārcane'pyuktam (-) aghoraṃ 
puruṣaṃ vā'pi dakṣiṇe samyagarcayet | aghoraṃvā'tha sadyaṃ vā 
paścime tu samarcayet | sadyavaktraṃ tu vāmaṃ vā saumyadeśe samarcayet | 
puruṣaṃ vā'tha vāmaṃ vā pūrva deśesamarcayet iti || sarvamapi sthira 
muttarābhimukhaṃ pūjanīyam | liṅgaṃ vā pratimā vā kriyate'nyadvā 
yayā kakubhā | tasyāṃ tasyāṃ yajvā yajeta śivamuttarābhimukha iti 
vacanāt | tatra mukhyapūrvābhimukhaliṅgapūjāyāṃ mukhyāgneyadiśi 
sthitasya pūjakasya mukhyamuttarābhimukhatvameva ghaṭate | naca devasya 
vāmabhāge nair(-)ṛtadeśe devyā niviṣṭatvāttatra pūjakasyopasthitau nottare 
yoṣidāśraya iti niṣedhaprasaṅgaḥ | kāmike paścimadvārārcanapaṭale 
vāme vā dakṣiṇevā'pi sthāpanīyā manonmanī | 
devasaṃmukhasaṃyuktā dvihastaikamukhānviteti 
paścimābhimukhaliṅgapūjāyāṃ dakṣiṇabhāge'pi 
devīniveśanasyāṃgī kṛtatvena nair(-)ṛtadiksthitasya pūjakasya 
devadakṣiṇabhāganiviṣṭadevībhāvanopapatteḥ | evaṃ dakṣiṇadigrūpa 
gauṇapūrvābhimukhaliṅgapūjāyāṃ nair(-)
ṛtadigrūpagauṇāgneyadiśisthitasya prācīrūpagauṇottarābhimukhatvaṃ 
uttaradigrūpagauṇapūrvābhimukhaliṅgapūjāyāmīśānadigrūpagauṇā
gneyadiśi sthitasya pratīcīrūpagauṇottaravaktratvaṃ ca ghaṭate | evaṃ 
pūjakābhimukhatvaniyamo na vihanyate | sarvatrātmārthapūjāprakaraṇe 
uttarābhimukho bhūtvā rucirāsanasaṃsthita ityādividhānāt | tatrāyaṃ 
viśeṣaḥ (-) pāpakṣayārthibhirmuktyarthibhiśca mukhānāṃ 
diśyavasthāmāśrityāghoravaktramabhimukhatvena bhāvanīyam | na vibhoḥ 
puratastiṣṭhet na paścāt stryantike'pi ca | aghaughadhvaṃsa mokṣārthaṃ 
dakṣe dakṣasthito'rcayet || himaṃ marucca śītañca padmaṃ nirdahate 
yathā | tathā'ghoraḥ praśānto'pi pāpanirdāhakārakaḥ || mahānapi 
yathā dantī yantāramanuvartate | tasmādāptena vacasā uttarābhimukho 
yajet || ityaghoramukhasya <p. 87> sakalapāpaharatvena praśaṃsādarśanāt | 
ajātamimamevaikaṃ matvājanmani bhīravaḥ | rudrasyāsya prapadyante 
rakṣārthaṃ dakṣiṇāmukham | iti vāyusaṃhitāyāṃ dakṣiṇamukhasya 
muktipradatvena praśaṃsādarśanāt | bhogapūrvakamokṣārthibhistu 
tatpuruṣamukhasya dvārābhimukhyanyāyena sādhakābhimukhyanyāyena 
vā sādhakābhimukhyapakṣamāśritya tatpuruṣamukhamabhimukhatvena 
bhāvanīyam prasannatvaṃ yadīśasya stemitvaṃ puruṣasya ca | caṇḍatvaṃ 
bahurūpasya muktisthityantahetukam iti tatpuruṣamukhasya 
sthitihetutvaśravaṇāt | sarvathā'pyūrdhvavaktrasya dakṣiṇābhimukhatvaṃ 
sthitameva | evañcāvāhanādikṛtaṃ 
devasyābhimukhyamapyātmārthapūjāyāmāñjasyaṃ labhate | anyathā 
parārthapūjāyāmiva tadūrddhvamukhasya 
ūrdhvābhimukhatvatyāgamātraparatayā kathaṃcinnirvāhyaṃ syāt | 
parārthapūjāyāṃ lokānugrahaprayojanāyāṃ viśiṣya 
pūjakābhimukhyaṃ nāpekṣitamiti yuktaṃ tatra dvārābhimukhasyaiva 
kathañcit gauṇābhimukhyasamarthanam | iha tu 
sādhakānugrahārthāyāmātmārtha pūjāyāṃsthaṇḍile caraliṅge 
cetivacanabalādāñjasyena saṃbhavatsādhakābhimukhyaṃ 
kimityupekṣitamiti keṣāṃcinmatam | anyetvāhuḥ 
ātmārthapūjāyāmūrdhvavaktraṃ hṛt guhyacaraṇaissaha 
tatpuruṣavaktraṃ ca pūrvābhimukhameva | 
aṃśumadāditantreṣvātmārthapūjāprakaraṇa eva na vibhoḥ 
puratastiṣṭhennapaścāt stryaṃtike'pi ca | na yoṣitsannidhau nāgre 
napṛṣṭhesvāminobhavedityādivacanānāṃ paṭhitatvena teṣāṃ 
parārthapūjāviṣayatayā netu maśakyatvāt | sādhakābhimukhyavacanasya 
dīkṣāprakaraṇe paṭhitatvena tato nityapūjāyāṃ 
sādhakābhimukhyālābhāt | naca dīkṣāyāṃ 
caraliṅgapūjāprasaktyabhāvāt caraliṅge sādhakābhimukhyavacanasya 
nityapūjāviṣayatvameveti vācyam | dīkṣāyāmapi caraliṅgārcane 
doṣābhāvāt | tasmānnirapavādāt naprāpyāmagrata iti vacanāt 
nityanaimittikakāmye sarvādhikāraṇaḥ sadāśivaḥ pūrvānano 
lakṣmīpratyakpraṣṭakalātanuriti lakṣmīkeśavasaṃvāde dīkṣādiṣu 
ghaṭeśasya <p. 88> pratīcyāṃ cintayedgurum | īśaṃ tatpuruṣaṃ śāntaṃ 
nitye nitye purānanamiti mukhabiṃbe dhyāyet sadāśivaṃ nityaṃ 
prāṅmukheśāsyavakṣasām | dīkṣādau kalaśādhāraṃ tameva 
pratyagānanamiti bṛhadbhārgavādiṣu ca sadānityaśabdābhyāṃ 
viśeṣavihitadīkṣādivyatirikteṣu sarveṣvapi nityanaimittika kāmyeṣvīśāna 
puruṣamukhayoḥ prāṅmukhatvaśravaṇā deteṣāṃ vacanānāṃ 
dvārāṣimukhatva niyatasthira liṅgaprahāṇena caraliṅgādiviṣayāvaśyaṃ 
bhāvāccātmārthapūjāyāṃ nityanaimittikakāmyarūpāyāṃ śivasya 
pūrvābhimukhatva mautsargikam | dīkṣādinaimittikeṣu 
viśeṣavacanairdakṣiṇamukhatvādirūpa stadapavāda iti | idaṃ 
cānyadāhuḥ | īśānatatpuruṣamukhayormadhye'pi 
sadāśivastatpuruṣamukhenaiva bhuṅkte | dvāraṃ paścimamevaṃ tu 
naivedyaṃ pūrvavaktrakamiti sūkṣmavacanādīśānavaktrasya 
śirorūpatayā tatra naivedyadānasya lokaviruddhatvācceti || astu 
tatpuruṣamukhena bhuṅkte ityapi kaścna pakṣaḥ | natu tenaiveti niyamaḥ | 
bhakṣyabhojyānnapānādītyādiprāgudāhṛta viṣamavacanairūrdhvavaktre 
mahāsena āhutiṃ saṃpradāpayedityādivacanaiścorddhvamukhenāpi 
bhojanāvagamāt(,) pañcavaktreṣu naivedyamiti vacanena tato havipradānaṃ 
syāt pañcavaktreṣu caiva hi īśānasya tu śuddhānnaṃ gauḍaṃ tatpuruṣe 
tataḥ | kṛṣaraṃ dakṣiṇe vaktre mudgānnaṃ ca tathottare | paścime 
pāyasaṃ caiva svasva nāmnā samāhitaḥ || dāpayetsvasvadigbhāge 
īśānasyāgrato bhavet | alābhe pañcahaviṣāmagre śuddhānnamiṣyate iti 
prativaktrannaivedyabhedapratipādakavacanajātena ca 
pañcabhirvaktrairbhojanācca | nahyāgamānāmaviśiṣṭe prāmāṇye 
kasyacidartho'nuṣṭheyo nānyasyeti yuktam | 
tasmāttattadāgamavacanaprāptapakṣatrayasyāpi vikalpa ityeva yuktam | nanu 
naivedyadānamudrayā śive naivedyaṃ samarpayatā pūjakena kiṃ śivasya 
haste tatsamarpaṇīyaṃ uta tattadvaktra eva | atrāpi vikalpa eva | uttaratra 
amṛtīkṛtya gostanyā nivedya kṛsumaṃ nyaset | nivedyadakṣiṇe haste 
dadyātpānīyamuttamamiti <p. 89> dakṣiṇahaste 
naivedyasamarpaṇaśravaṇāt(,) ūrddhvavaktre tu dātavyaṃ yatkiñcidiha 
coditam | ūrddhvavaktre mahāsena āhutiṃ saṃpradāpayediti vaktre 
samarpaṇaśravaṇācca | evaṃcātra yogyatānusāreṇa vyavasthitovikalpaḥ | 
yaddhṛdayādisaṃmite puruṣavaktre niveditavyaṃ dravadravyavarjaṃ 
bhakṣyabhojyādi tatsarvaṃ parityaktābhayamudre vāmahaste samarpaṇīyam 
| yadvaktrāntare nivedanīyaṃ yacca pānīyādidravadravyajātaṃ 
tatsarvamagnihotrāhutivat sūkṣmarasarūpeṇa sthālikābhyo nirgatya 
tattadvaktraparyantaṃ naivedyamudrayā sahāgataṃ sambhāvayatā 
sākṣāttadvaktra eva samarpaṇīyamiti | evañca haste 
samarpaṇasaṃbhavāddhastodvartanasya na vaiphalyam | pūjakahastena 
tadvaktre naivedyaprakṣepābhāvāt pūjakahastasya na 
nirmālyasaṅkaraprasaṅgaḥ || iti naivedyavidhiḥ ||

tāṃbūladānam ||

	atha mukhavāsaṃ tāmbūlaṃ ca nivedayet | bhojanāntaraṃ mukhe 
vāsārthaṃ yaddīyate tanmukhaṃ vāsayatīti vyutpatyā mukhavāsam | tacca 
elālavaṅga takkola jātīphala karpūracūrṇaṃ 
himajalapiṣṭaṃgulakokṛtamityuktam | elālavaṅgāṃkita takkola jātīphala 
karpūracūrṇamīṣanmadhusitāyuktaṃ kevalaṃ vā 
pañcasaugandhikākhyamuttamam | kevalaṃ 
karpūrajātīlavaṅgatakkolacūrṇaṃ vā madhyamam | prasthanaivedyasya 
dvidhākṛtamṛdukramukakhaṇḍāni ṣaṭcatvāriṃśadvevāpatrāṇiṃ 
kramukaphalāpekṣayā caturguṇāni triguṇāni dviguṇāni vā śubhrāṇi 
khaṇḍitamūlāgrāṇi śilācūrṇaṃ cetisarvamidaṃ saṃgṛhya 
karpūrādisahitaṃ supakvasaṃskṛtanālikeramātuliṅgaphalayuktaṃ 
tāṃbūlaṃ nivedayet | tatomūlamantreṇa viśeṣārghyaṃ datvā 
ekatripañcasaptanavāvṛttiyuktadīpaṃ pradarśyatritāla pañcatāla 
nāgacakrapadma puruṣamṛga gajārūḍhadevendrādyākṛtipātra nihitān 
dīpānapi yathā vibhavaṃ pradarśyārātrikaṃ kuryāt ||

<p. 90> [ārātrika vidhiḥ] ||

	tatprakāraḥ (-) suvarṇarajatatāmrakāṃsyānyatamanirmite 
caturviṃśatyaṃgulimāne tadardha tattṛtīyāṃśamānayā 
svamānapañcamotsedhā yavadvayā yāmotsedhapaṭṭikayā karṇikayā 
śobhite tato bahiraṣṭadalayukte paritaḥ karṇikāmānoṣṭhasahite 
suvṛttākāre pātre karṇikāyāṃ madhye paritaśca kṛteṣu sahajeṣu 
śālipiṣṭamayeṣu vā dīpāsaneṣu karpūrādimayīṃ varti nidhāya 
navapañca vā dīpān madhya eva ekaṃ vā dīpamāropya tripādyāṃ 
vinyasya nirīkṣaṇādibhissaṃskṛtya(,) nava cenmadhye sūryaṃ dikṣu 
guruśukrabudhacandrān vidikṣu bhaumaśanirāhuketūn(,) pañcacenmadhye 
vahniṃ dikṣu gaganavāyujalapṛthivīḥ(,) ekaścet vahniṃ cābhyarcayet | 
yadvā (-) navapañcaikadīpeṣu vāmādiśaktīḥ pañcabrahmāṇi śivaṃ 
cārcayet | evaṃ gandhapuṣpadhūpadīpairabhyarcya digbandhanamastreṇa 
kṛtvā surabhimudrāṃ pradarśya pāṇibhyāmuddhṛtya devasya śirasi 
hṛdaye pādayośca trirbhrāmayitvā 
suvarṇādinirmitairvṛttākāraiścaturaśrākārairvā 
mukulāgraśālinālayuktaissahajaśālipiṣṭakṛtānyataradīpāsanayuktairdī(-)
pāsananihitakarpūrādivartiṣvāropitadīpairnīrājanapātrairnīrājanānyapi 
nirīkṣaṇādibhissaṃskṛtānyārātrikavat bhrāmayitvā bhūmau 
vinyasyāstreṇa nirvāpayet | nirājanapātrāṇi trividhāni | 
prādeśamātravistāraṃ yavadvayaghanamaṣṭāṃgulanālaṃ 
tadanusārimukulamuttamam | tasya madhye ekaṃ dīpāsanaṃ 
pañcasvāvṛttiṣu kramānnavapañcadaśa ekaviṃśatiḥ saptaviṃśatiḥ 
trayastriṃśaditi ṣaḍuttaraśataṃ dīpāḥ | yadvā kramādāvṛtiṣvaṣṭau 
caturdaśa viṃśatiḥ ṣaḍviṃśatiḥ dvātriṃśaddīpāsanānīti 
ekottaraśataṃdīpāḥ | uttamapātrārdhamānaṃ pātraṃ madhyamam | asya 
madhye ekaṃ caturṣvāvaraṇeṣu aṣṭau trayodaśāṣṭādaśa 
trayoviṃśatirdīpāsanānītitriṣaṣṭirdīpāḥ | madhyamādardhamānaṃ 
kaniṣṭham | asya madhye ekaṃ triṣvāraṇeṣu ṣaṭdaśa 
caturdaśadīpāsanānīti ekatriṃśaddīpāḥ | <p. 91> atha 
darpaṇacchatracāmara vyajanatālavṛntāni 
kramādīśānādimantraissamarpya taddivasārjitavāṅmanaḥ 
kāyadoṣaparihārāya śivasāyujyaprāptaye ca 
dūrvākuśākṣatabilvapatrasahitapuṣpāñjaliṃ hāṃ hauṃ 
śivatatvādhipataye śivāyanamaḥ | hāṃ hauṃ vidyātatvādhipataye 
śivāya namaḥ | hāṃ hauṃ ātmatatvādhipataye śivāya namaḥ | iti 
trivāraṃ samarpayet | mumukṣuścedātmatatvādikrameṇa athavā 
sarvatatvādhipataye śivāyanama iti sakṛdevavā samarpayet | tataḥ pūjayā 
santuṣṭaṃ svābhimukhīkṛtāñjalipuṭasakalabhogāṅgasevyamānaṃ 
yāgamandiradvārabāhyasyabrahmopendramahendracandrasūryādistūyamā
na mapārakaruṇāmṛtasamudraṃ bhaktajanasakalābhīṣṭapradañca śivaṃ 
dhyātvā pūjāsādguṇyārthaṃ yathāśakti śrīmatpañcākṣarajapaṃ 
kuryāt ||

[pañcākṣarajapavidhiḥ] ||

śrīmatpañcākṣarasyātha prakāraḥ pratipādyate |
gurūpadiṣṭamārgeṇa gopanīyaḥ prayatnataḥ ||

śivāsanapadmasya dakṣiṇadale aghoramūrterdakṣiṇabhāge |
taptacāmīkaraprakhyāṃ pīnonnatapayodharām |
caturbhujāṃ triṇayanāṃ bālendukṛtaśekharām ||

padmotpaladharāṃ saumyāṃ varadābhayapāṇikām |
sarvalakṣaṇasaṃpannāṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitām ||

sitapadmāsanāsīnāṃ nīlakuñcitamūrdhajām |
śrīmatpañcākṣarīṃvidyāṃ manasāvāhanādibhiḥ ||

gandhapuṣpairdhūpadīpairnaivedyena ca pūjayet |
sukhāsane samāviṣṭo rakṣitākṣa udaṅmukhaḥ |
nāsāgranthastaddṛṅmaunī vidadhyādātmarakṣaṇam ||

<p. 92> sravatpīyūṣasaṅghātaplāvitāśeṣadiktaṭam |
smaredūrddhvamadhastācca candramaṇḍalasaṃyutam ||

biṃbasaṃpuṭamadhyasthaṃ sudhādhārāpariplutam |
svadehaṃ cintayecchāktaissudhāvarṣaissudhātmakam ||

ātmarakṣā bhavedeṣā surairapi na bhidyate |
ātmarakṣāṃ vidhāyetthaṃ mantrarakṣāmathācaret ||

recayedudarādvāyuṃ dakṣanāḍyā'stramantrataḥ |
iḍayā pūrayedbāhyāt śaṃbhunā vāyunodaram ||

apānamūrddhvamutkṛṣya prāṇāpānau niruddhya ca |
kuṃbhena manasā vāyuṃ suṣumnāyāṃ niyojayet ||

suṣumnāmadhyasaṃsthāyāṃ hṛddeśeśivasaṃyuji |
mantranniyojayenmantrī cicchaktau mantramātari ||

mantrākṣarāṇi maṇivat prabhāvanmantradevatām |
gamāgamaṃprayogena smaranmantraṃ japetsudhīḥ ||

vācyavācakasaṃbandhaṃ japettadgatamānasaḥ |
mantrarakṣā bhavedeṣā saṃhitā surarakṣitā ||

itthaṃ viditvā yatnena japakarma samācaret |
japakarmakramasso'tha suspaṣṭaṃ pratipādyate ||

nābhyādidvādaśāntāntaṃ somasūryāgnirūpiṇīm |
ānandarūpiṇīṃ śaktiṃ suṣumnāntargatāṃ parām ||

ādhāracakramārabhya bodhayitvā'nilena tām |
brahmāṇaṃ keśavaṃ rudramīśvaraṃ ca sadāśivam ||

<p. 93> hṛtkaṇṭhatālubhrūbrahmarandhrasthāneṣu tānkramāt |
tyaktvā tyaktvā'stramantrāṃśaṃ vidyullekhānibhaṃ budhaḥ ||

mantraṃ nādāntamuccārya mūlādhāragataṃ punaḥ |
gamāgamaprayogeṇa japetsāṣṭaśataṃ tathā ||

aṣṭāviṃśatimaṣṭau vā guruṇā ca yathoditam |
itthaṃ kṛtvā japaṃ mantrī śivasāyujyamāpnuyāt ||

	japaścābhyantaryā'kārādikṣakārāntavarṇamālārūpayā 
bāhyayā rudrākṣādinirmitayā vā kartavyā | tantrāntaryā japaprakāraḥ 
kathyate | brahmarandhre dhavalāṣṭadalacaturaśrayaṃtramupari śritaṃ 
padmaṃ bhāvanīyam | tasya karṇikāyāṃ vyoma tatpūrvavarṇaṃ 
caturdaśasvaravisarjanīyasamudāyarūpaṃ bījaṃ kesareṣvaṣṭa 
svaradvaṃdvāni daleṣu kādayaḥ pañcapañca varṇāḥ caturaśrayantrasya 
dikṣu sudhābījaṃ vidikṣu ca saptamo varṇaḥ | evaṃ rūpaṃmātṛkaṃ 
padmaṃ bhāvanāmātreṇa viśeṣaparogamṛtyuharam | tato 
dvārakramaṃcānudgatavāyusaṃdhukṣitamūlādhārāgniśikhayā 
kuṇḍalinīśaktyā saha suṣumnārandhraṃ praviśya 
brahmarandhraparyantamudgateḍāspṛṣṭāttasmānmātṛkāpadmātsyaṃdi(-)
tāṃ kṣakārādyakārāntavarṇapaṅktirūpāmamṛtabindusantatiṃ 
brahmarandhraprabhṛti mūlādhāraparyantaṃ vyāpyāvatiṣṭhamānāṃ 
bhāvayet | yā kuṇḍalinī śaktiḥ mūlādhārāgniśikhāsāmarasyena 
prakāśamānasuṣumnāmārgeṇa brahmarandhraparyantamudgatā saiva 
mātṛkāpadmavidrutāmṛtabindusyaṃdi 
santatisāṃmarasyenāmṛtāyamāṇā paramānandarūpiṇī 
mātṛkāśaktiritibhāvayet | tadāhuḥ (-) prakāśamānāṃ prathamaprayāṇe 
pratiprayāṇe tvamṛtāyamāṇām | antaḥpadavyā 
manusañcarantīmāṇandamudrāmavalokayāmaḥ iti || 
brahmarandhrasthitamātṛkāpadmaprabhṛtyakārādikrameṇa 
mūlādhāraparyantaṃ vyāpya sthitāyāṃ mātṛkārūpāyāṃ 
śaktāvakārādibhiraṣṭabhirvarṇairekovargaḥ ḷkārādibhiraṣṭābhiranyaḥ 
kakārādibhiḥ pañcabhiḥ pañcabhirvarṇaissaptavargāḥ |
<p. 94> navavargāḥ 
kramādādityasomabudhaguruśukrāṃgārakaśanirāhuketuratnarūpāḥ | 
māṇikkavaiḍūryakapuṣyarāgavajrapravālagulikāvalavairiratnaiḥ | 
gometakairmarakataiśca kṛtā'kṣamālā ślāghyā 
navagrahamayākhilavarṇapūrṇā || enāmakṣamālāṃ 
hṛtpuṇḍarīkamadhyāgatadīpākāraparameśvaraprabhārūpaśabdaiḥ 
prākhyaśaktinissṛtāṃ vibhāvayet || tadagre mūlamantre 
navaratnamayakalpalatāgre puṣpāt vinissṛtaṃ vibhāvya kṣakāraṃ meruṃ 
kṛtvā lakārādikrameṇākṣamālāyāṃ mūlamantrasya gamāgamau 
vibhāvayet | tasyāṃmantrasyārohaṇabhāvanayāṃ mantrasya śirasi 
lakārādisahitavarṇān visarjanīyasahitān vinyasya avarohaṇabhāvanāyāṃ 
mantrasya akārādivarṇān biṃdvantāvinyasya japaṃ kuryāt | evaṃ kṛte 
śataṃ mantrasyāvṛttayo bhavanti | tadanantaraṃ 
ṣoḍaśasvaravargasparśavargapañcakāntasthavarga ūṣmavargāṣṭake 
krameṇa mantraṃ vinyasyāṣṭadhā mantramāvartayet | 
evamaṣṭottaraśataśaṅkhyajapaḥ kṛto bhavati | japāraṃbhakāle ca 
mūlamantreṇa tasya paradevatāṃ maṇinā prabhāmiva samarasībhūtāṃ 
mūlamantreṇasaha tadīyānnakārādivarṇān 
pītakṛṣṇadhūmrapītaraktavarṇān taddevatārūpatayā tatsamarasībhūtān 
brahmaviṣṇurudreśvarasadāśivāṃśca vibhāvayet | 
hṛtkaṇṭhatālubhrūmadhyabrahmarandhreṣu krameṇa nakārādivarṇaissaha 
brahmādīnparityajet | ayamarthassarvo'pi prāk likhitaślokeṣu 
saṃkṣepeṇasūcitaḥ | evamābhyantarākṣamālayā japtumaśaktaḥ 
prāguktakrameṇa japārambhakāle mantraṃ mātṛkāśaktyārūḍhaṃ 
vibhāvya mantramātṛkākṣarāṇi vibhāvya kevalameva mantraṃ 
rudrākṣādikṛtabāhyākṣamālayā gaṇayan japet ||

	tatprakāraḥ (-) uttamādikrameṇāmalaka badara 
caṇakapramāṇairavaktraistrivaktraiścatuḥpañcaṣaṭsaptāṣṭanavadaśaikā(-)
daśavaktrairvā 
ekasaṅkhyavaktrairbhinnasaṅkhyavaktrāmiśritairaṣṭottarasaṅkhyaiścatuḥ(-)
pañcāśatsaṅkhyaissaptaviṃśatisaṅkhyairvā suvarṇarajatādimaye <p. 95> 
kṣaumapaṭṭādimayevāsūtre parasparamukhasaṃyojanena 
parasparapucchasaṃyojanena ca syūtairmerusahitaiḥ 
varṇānuguṇarudrākṣairnirmitāṃ sadyojātādimantraiḥ pratmekaṃ 
śatavārāvṛttaiḥ krameṇābhimantritamerukāṃ 
śivapūjākrameṇāvāhanādibhiḥ pūjitāṃ japārambhakāle 
huṃphaḍaṃtāstramantreṇa prokṣitāṃ hṛdayena 
gandhapuṣpādibhirmālāmudrāparadarśanena ca pūjitāṃ 
dakṣiṇahastagṛhītāṃ vastrasaṃgopitāmakṣamālāṃ vācikajape 
madhyamāyāṃ nidhāya tarjanyaguṣṭhābhyāṃ(,) upāṃśujape 
anāmikāyāṃ nidhāyamadhyamāṃguṣṭhābhyāṃ(,) mānasajape 
kaniṣṭhikāyāṃ nidhāyānāmikāṃguṣṭhābhyāṃ ca gaṇayet | bubhukṣu 
rakṣamālā madhonayet | mumukṣurūrddhaṃ nayet | merulaṅghanadoṣe 
prāyaścittamaghorasahasrajapaḥ | 
taddoṣāsparśanāyamerurahīnākṣamālā kartavyā | evamakṣamālāyāḥ 
pādayoḥ patane'pyaghorasahasrajapaḥ | bhūmau tasyāḥ patane 
tatriṃśajjapaḥ | vāsasi patane tacchatajapaḥ | japāraṃbhakāle ekaṃ 
puṣpaṃ dakṣiṇahastasya kaniṣṭhikāmadhye kṛtvā japtavyam | 
rudrākṣamālikayā japetu tadgrahaṇe saukarpāya  dakṣiṇahastena gṛhītaṃ 
puṣpaṃ vāmahaste nidhāya japtavyam | adrutavilaṃbitasāvadhānajapaṃ 
samarpya vāmakaratale astrakavacahṛdayānyuparyupari vinyasya tadupari 
japakāle dhṛtaṃ puṣpaṃnidhāya hṛdayakavacāstraissaṃpuṭīkṛtya 
astreṇasaṃrakṣya kavacenāvakuṇṭhya dakṣiṇahaste punargṛhītvā 
hṛtpradeśe nidhāya pūrṇacandropamaṃ japaṃ tadgataṃ dhyāyan 
bhūniveśitadakṣiṇajānurbhūtvā hāṃ guhyātiguhyagoptātvaṃ 
gṛhāṇāsmatkṛtaṃ japam | siddhirbhavati me yenatvatprasādāt tvayisthite || 
hāṃ hauṃ śivāyasvāhā | śrīparamaśiva japaṃ tvayinikṣipāmīti 
japamarghyāṃbuculakena sākṣatakuśapuṣpeṇa śivasya varadahaste 
nivedayet | ayaṃ bhuktimuktisādhakasya svakṛtajapasya vismayaṃ 
saṅkīrtanakarmanāśajalasaṃsparśādibhirvināśaśaṅkayā 
tatsaṃrakṣaṇāya śivahastenikṣepaḥ | mantraślokasyāyamarthaḥ | guhyāti 
guhyādīnāṃ mantratatvādīnāṃ goptā tvameva | 
atassarvagoptṛtvādasmākaṃ japamapi gṛhāṇa | yasminjape tvayisthite 
tvatprasādādasmāka <p. 96> bhuktimuktirbhavatyeva | tasmānmayi kṛpayā 
tatgṛhāṇeti | tataḥ hāṃ yatkiṃcitkarma he deva sukṛtaṃ caiva duṣkṛtam | 
tanmeśivapadasthasya bhukṣva kṣapaya śaṅkara || hāṃ hoṃ śivāya 
svāhā | paramaśivāyame sukṛtaṃduṣkṛtaṃ ca nivedayāmīti 
sukṛtaduṣkṛtātmakaṃ sarvaṃ karma prāguktakremeṇa culakodakena 
nivedayet | tatra sukṛtajātasya bhogārthasya mokṣāntarāyaparihārārthasya 
saṃrakṣaṇārthaṃ nivedanīm | duṣkṛtajātasyakṣapaṇārtham | atassukṛtaṃ 
bhuṃkṣva pālaya | duṣkṛtaṃ kṣapaya nāśayeti yojanā | bhoganiṣpṛhasya 
kevalamumukṣostu mokṣāntarāyaparihārārthaṃ skṛtamātrameva 
bhukṣveti pālanaprārthanā | bhogārthasukṛtasya 
śivapūjāyāmaṅgaphalatvenānuṣaṃgikasya 
mānuṣādihiraṇyagarbhānandāntabhogaprāpakasya viṣayebhyo 
jugupsamānaṃ kevalaṃ mumukṣuṃprati ete vai nirayāstāta 
sthānasyaparamātmanaḥ iti purāṇoktarītyā narakaprāpakasya 
duṣkṛtarūpatayā kṣapraṇapārthanaiva | yadyapi pālanārthe bhujidhātoḥ 
parasmaipaditayābhunakṣītiparasmaipadinābhāvyam | tathā'pi 
mantrarūpeśloke vaidikamantreṣu rakṣasvetiprayoga iva chāndaso'yaṃ 
vyatyayo bahulamityātmanepadaprayogaḥ | yadvā bhuṃkṣveti bhoga(-)
evocyate(,) natu pālanam | sakṛtaśabdena ca kevalamuktyarthinaḥ pūjakasya 
yadaniṣṭaṃ bhogārthasukṛtaṃ tadevācyate(,) natubhuktyarthamapekṣitam | 
tadbhogaśśivasyarājño rājabhogavat svādhīna vyavahāraḥ | natu 
svayameva bhojanam | svādhīnavyavahāraśca pūjakasya priyeṣu jñātiṣu 
tasya yathākathaṃcit suhṛtsuvāniveśanam | mumukṣoranapekṣitaṃ 
sukṛtaṃ śivastasya jñātisuhṛdbhyaḥ prayacchatītiśrutiprasiddhiḥ | yadyapi 
tasya duṣkṛtaṃ tadviṣadbhyaḥ prayacchatītyapi śrutiprasiddhirasti | tathā'pi 
śivapūjakaḥ sarvamaṣṭamūrteśśivasya rūpaṃ manyamāna 
stānnadveṣṭīti tena svaduṣkṛtasya svasminphalājanakatvarūpaṃ 
kṣapaṇameva prārthayitumucitamiti tatprārthanā mantre nibaddhā | tataḥ 
śivodātā śivo bhoktā śivassarvamidaṃ jagat | śivo yajati sarvatra 
yaśśivasso'hameva tu || hāṃ hauṃ śivāyasvāhā <p. 97> 
paramaśivamātmānaṃ tubhyaṃ nivedayāmīti prāguktarītyā 
culakodakena nivedayet | atra mantraśloke sohamiti bhāgena svasya śivasya ca 
śarīraśarīribhāvaḥ pratipādyate | śivasya niyāmakatvena śarīritvāt 
svasya niyamyatvena śarīratvācca śarīraśarīribhāve so'hamiti 
sāmānādhikaraṇyam | dharmajñassundaro rājetivat | eveti 
tadayogavyavacchedaḥ | yaśśiva iti | yaḥ paramamaṃgalavācī śivaśabdaḥ 
rūḍhyā trivedhenāpyāṇavamāyikakarmarūpeṇa malenāspṛṣṭa iti 
anādimalasaṃśleṣaprāgabhāvāt svabhāvataḥ | śiva ityucyate 
sadbhiśśivatatvārtha vedibhirityādiṣu prasiddha ityarthaḥ | athavā 
śīṅsvapna iti dhāto rauṇādikena vanpratyayāntatvahrasvatvanipātena śete 
sāmarasyena vartate'smin kalyāṇaguṇajātamiti vyutpattyā 
parasparaviruddhaudāryamādhuryaviśeṣajñatvaniratiśayatvasahiṣṇutvādi(-)
samāśrayaṇīyetvāpayogisakalakalyāṇaguṇaratnākara iti | 
nāstiyadyadakalyāṇaṃ tattadasya kadācana | kalyāṇaṃ sakalaṃ cāsti 
paramātmā śivoyataḥ ityādiṣu prasiddha ityarthaḥ | athavā hiṃ 
sidhātossiṃhaśabdo vaśakāṃtau śivaḥsmṛtaḥ | varṇavyatyayatassiddhaḥ 
kaśyapaḥ paśyakopathetinipātena vaṣṭiśivamicchatīti 
vyutpattyāsarvabhūtahitāśāsiteti | samedhayati yannityaṃ 
sarvārthānāmupakrame | śivamicchanmanuṣyāṇāṃ 
tasmāddevaśśivaḥsmṛtaḥ ityādiṣu prasiddha ityarthaḥ | athavā 
śivaśabdācchubhavācinaḥ tatkarotītiṇici pacādyaci ṇeraniṭīti ṇilepe ca 
sati śivaṃ karoti sarveṣāmiti vyutpattyā sakalabhūtahitakarteti | 
samābhavaṃti me sarve dānavāścāmarāśca ye | śivo'smi 
sarvabhūtānāṃ śivatvaṃ tena me surā ityādiṣu prasiddha ityarthaḥ | 
athavā śyaiñgatāvitidhātorauṇādikenavanpratyayasyākārayakāralopasya 
ca nipātābhyāmayate prāpyate iti vyutpratyā bhogamokṣārthibhiḥ 
bhajanīya iti | yadvāre mattamātaṅgā vāyuvegāsturaṅgamāḥ | 
pūrṇenduvadanā nārgraśśivapūjāvidheḥ phalam || sarvamanyatparityajya 
śiva eva śivaṃkaraḥ | <p. 98> paro dhyeyo'tha deveśassamāptā'tharvaṇo 
śrutirityāṣu prasiddha(-)ityarthaḥ | athavā yadvyakṣaraṃ nāma gireritaṃ 
nṛṇāṃ sakṛtprasaṅgā daghamāśuhaṃti tat | pavitrakīrti 
tamalaṅghyaśāsanaṃ bhavānahodveṣṭi śivaṃ śivetara(-)ityādiṣu 
sakaladuritaharatvenānuśiṣṭasya śivaśabdasya vācyoyaḥ prasiddha 
ityarthaḥ | śivoyajati sarvatreti | sarveṣvapi lokeṣu śiva eva yajati 
dharmādhikāritvenāvatiṣṭhate | karmavaśyasakalajīvātmakaḥ sa eva 
niyantetyarthaḥ | śivassarvamidaṃ jagat | 
bhūtabhautikasakalajaḍaprapañcātmakaḥ tanniyāmaka ityarthaḥ | bhoktā 
prapannānāṃ pālayitā | dātā prapannānāṃ 
prāmādikepātakādyantarāye satitasya śodhayitā | etāni viśeṣaṇāni śive 
svātmanivedanatadaṅgopayuktāni | tathāhi (-) niyamyasya pūjakasya 
niyāmakasya śivasya ca 
niyataniyamyaniyāmakabhāvarūpaśarīraśarīribhāvena 
śivaṃpratipūjakasya tavāhamasmītyanusaṃdhānamevātmanivedanam | 
tadiha sohamevetyatra tatpadokteśive ahaṃpadena svaśarīrakatvaṃ 
evakāreṇa tadayogavyavacchedakārtha kena tasyaniyatatvaṃ 
cānusaṃdhānaviṣayarūpaṃ tadupapādakamabhihitam | asya 
cātmanivedanasya sāṅgapañcakatvamāhuḥ (-) ānukūlyasya saṅkalpaḥ 
prātikūlyavivarjanam | rakṣiṣyatīti viśvāso goptṛtvavaraṇaṃ tathā ||
<p. 98> kārpaṇyamiti | tatra 
sarvabhūtānukūlyācaraṇatatprātikūlyavarjanarūpāṅgadvayopapāda(-)
kaṃ sarvo'pi jīvavargaḥ pūjakaṃ prati śaraṇyasya śivasya 
śarīramityetadabhihitam | tena prāṇimātre śivapūjakena rājaśarīre 
bhṛtya(-)ivānukūlyena vartitavyaṃ tatprātikūlyaṃ ca varjanīyamiti labhyate | 
ata evoktaṃ vāyusaṃhitāyāṃ śivasya mūrtyaṣṭakanirūpaṇaprakaraṇe(-)
ātmā tasyāṣṭamī mūrtiśśivasya paramātmanaḥ | 
vyāpiketaramūrtīnāṃ viśva tasmāt śivātmakam || sarvopakārakaraṇaṃ 
sarvānugrahaṇaṃ tathā | sarvābhayapradānaṃ ca śivasyārādhanaṃ 
viduḥ || dehino yasya kasyāpi kriyate yadi nigrahaḥ | aṣṭamūrte reniṣṭaṃ 
tatkṛtameva na saṃśayaḥ iti || rakṣiṣyatīti viśvāse tu sarvairapi viśeṣaṇaiḥ 
<p. 99> upapādakamabhihitam | ahamevetyuktaṃ svaśarīrakatvaṃ tāvat 
svarakṣaṇaviśvāsopapādakam | kohi svaśarīraṃ na rakṣet | 
śivaśabdoktamukta viśvāsavirodhirāgadveṣādihetumalarāhityaṃ 
samāśrayaṇīyatvopayogi sakalakalyāṇaguṇaśālitvaṃ 
sakalabhūtahitāśaṃsitṛtvaṃ sakalabhūtahitakartṛtvaṃ 
hitavirodhisakaladuritanivartakaśivaśabdavācyatvamityetatsarvamapi 
tadupapādakaṃśivoyajati sarvatra śivassarvamidaṃjagat iti 
viśeṣaṇadvayoktaṃ cetanācetanātmakasakalaprapañcaniyantṛtvarūpaṃ 
sarveśvaratvamapi tadupapādakam | sarveśvarohi 
tadbhaktābhilaṣitadānasamartha iti viśvasituṃ śakyaḥ | pālanārthāt 
bhujidhātoḥ daipśodhana iti ghātośca tācchīlyārthakatvena bhoktā dāteti 
viśeṣaṇadvayenābhihitaṃ bhaktarakṣakasvabhāvakatvaṃ 
tadīyaprāmādikamahāpātakādisakala duritanivartakasvabhāvakatvañca 
tadupapādakamiti spaṣṭameva | goptṛtvavaraṇe'pi bhoktṛtvamevopapādakam 
| svayameva rakṣakasvabhāvaḥ kathaṃ rakṣakobhaveti prārthito narakṣet | tu 
śabdena devatāntaranirapekṣatvarūpakārpaṇyopapādakaṃ svasya 
devatāntarāṇāṃ ca niyamyaniyāmakabhāvarāhityarūpantu 
śabdenoktamiti vivekaḥ ||

	evaṃ tribhiśculakodakairjapakriyātmasamarpaṇānantaraṃ 
pañcabrahmaṣaḍaṅgamantrānapi mūlamantradaśāṃśasaṃyogena 
japtvā śivamaṣṭapuṣpikayā puṣpāñjalitrayeṇa cābhyarcya purataḥ 
kṛtāñjalibandhaḥ sthitvā stotramapi vijñāpayet | 
pañcāvaraṇastotrairanyairapi śrutismṛtipurāṇāgamādidṛṣṭaiḥ 
pūrvācāryakṛtaiḥstotrairvā yathā saṃbhavaṃ stuvīta | svakṛtastotraṃ 
śrutitulyamiti paurāṇikāḥ ||

pradakṣiṇavidhiḥ ||

evaṃ stutvā puṣpāñjalisamarpaṇapūrvakaṃ sāṣṭāṅgaṃ praṇamya 
pradakṣiṇatrayaṃ kṛtvā pañcavāraṃ praṇamya punaḥ pradakṣiṇaṃ 
kuryāt | pūjāsāphalyasiddhyarthaṃ pradakṣiṇamāvaśyakam |
<p. 100> padātpadāntaraṃ gacchet karau calanavarjitau | stutirvācā 
hṛdidhyānaṃ caturaṅgaṃ pradakṣiṇam | āsannaprasavā nārī 
tailapūrṇaṃ yathā ghaṭam | vahantīśanakairyāti tathā kuryāt 
pradakṣiṇam || tat pradakṣiṇam trividham || savyamapasavyaṃ 
savyāpasavyaṃ ceti | devaṃ svasya dakṣiṇabhāge kṛtvā kriyamāṇaṃ 
savyam | tadviparītamapasavyam | ubhayamilitaṃ savyāpasavyam | 
trividhamapi indradigādīndradikparyantaṃ kartavyam | savyāpasavyaṃ 
somasūtrasthānādi somasūtrasthānāntaṃ vā kartavyam | tatra savyaṃ 
brahmacāriṇāmapasavyaṃ yatīnāṃ savyāpasavyaṃ gṛhivānaprasthayoriti 
kaścana pakṣaḥ | savyaṃ sādhāraṇamapasavyaṃ yatīnāmeva 
savyāpasavyaṃ dīkṣitānāmevetyaparaḥ pakṣaḥ ||

[praṇāmavidhiḥ] ||

	praṇāmaścaturvidhaḥ | aṣṭāṅgaḥ pañcāṅgstryaṅga ekāṅgaśca 
| aṣṭāṅgodvividhaḥ | daṇḍapraṇāmaḥ kevalapraṇāmaśca | padbhyāṃ 
karābhyāmurasā śirasā vācā kriyamāṇo daṇḍapraṇāmaḥ | 
pādadvayena karadvayenorasā śirasā vācā manasā dhiyā dṛṣṭyā ca 
kriyamāṇo daṇḍapraṇāma iti pakṣāntaram | atra 
manasetyananyamanaskatvamucyate | dhiyeti 
śivamahimānusandhānarūpastotraṃ vivicyata iti bhedaḥ | pādadvayena 
jānudvayena karadvayena urasā śirasā manasā vācā dṛṣṭyā ca 
kriyamāṇa ityapi pakṣāntaram | pādadvayena bāhudvayena urasā śirasā 
manasā vācā dṛṣṭyā ca kriyamāṇa ityapi kaścana pakṣaḥ | śirasā 
hastvābhyāṃ karṇābhyāṃ cibukena bāhubhyāṃ ca bhuvaṃ saṃspṛśya 
kriyamāṇaḥ kevalapraṇāmo'ṣṭāṅgaḥ | śirasā hastābhyāṃ 
jānubhyāṃca bhuvaṃ spṛṣṭvā kriyamāṇaḥ pañcāṅgaḥ | śiro hastau 
bāhū ca jānuni nidhāya kriyamāṇaḥ pañcāṅga iti pakṣāntaram |
<p. 101> śirasi hastābhyāmañjalibandhanaṃ tryaṅganaskāraḥ | kevalaṃ 
śirasaivānamanamekāṅganamaskāraḥ | ete praṇāmā 
deśakālabalādyapekṣayā yathā saṃbhavaṃ viniyoktavyāḥ ||

[agnikāryavidhiḥ] ||

	itthaṃ parameśvaraṃ stutipradakṣiṇanamaskāraissantoṣya 
svāminnagnikāryaṃ karomīti vijñāpya śivādājñāṃ gṛhītvā 
sāmānyārghyakaro'gnyagāraṃ gatvā 
nirīkṣaṇādicatussaṃskāraiśśuddhe hastamāne 
mṛtsikatānyataranirmitesthaṇḍile araṇisūryakāntādinirmitaṃ 
śrotriyāgāgārasamāhṛtaṃ vā'gniṃ prajvālya huṃphaḍantāstreṇa 
kravyādāṃśamagniṃ nir(-)ṛtikoṇe nirasya mūlenāgniṃ nirīkṣya 
huṃphaḍantāstreṇaprokṣaṇatāḍane vidhāya 
vauṣaḍantakavacenābhyukṣya hāṃ haṃ hāṃ vahnimūrtayenama iti 
saṃhāramudrayā vahnicaitanyaṃ pūrakavāyunā hṛtpuṇḍarīkasthitena 
vahninā saṃyojya tatsahitaṃ suṣumnāmārgeṇa dvādaśāntaṃ prāpayya 
paramaśivasaṃpṛktaṃ kṛtvā recakena piṅgalayā nissārya hāṃ hrūṃ 
vahnicaitanyāya nama iti tamudbhavamudrayā jvaladagnau nikṣipet | tadanu 
sayojātādimantrairnamontaiḥ pañcabhiragniṃ saṃpūjya 
vauṣaḍantaśaktimantreṇa dhenumudrayā'mṛtīkṛtya 
kavacenāvakuṇṭhyāstreṇasaṃrakṣya hṛdayenābhyarcya 
pārameśvaravīryamiti vibhāvya vāgīśvarīṃ vāgīśvaraṃ ca 
samarasāvīśadiggatau dhyātvā vāgīśvarīgarbhanāḍyā 
mātmasaṃmukhaṃ vāgīśvareṇa tadvīryaṃ kṣipyamāṇaṃ vibhāvayet | 
tataḥ svāhāntamūlenāhutipañcakaṃ datvā hāṃ śivāgniṃstvaṃ 
hutāśanetināma kṛtvā 
garbhādhānādipañcasaṃskārādisaṃskṛtamagniṃvibhāvya pitarau 
hṛdā'bhyarcya visṛjya sāmānyārghyajalena vauṣaḍantakavacena kuṇḍaṃ 
mekhalāṃ ca saṃprokṣyamekhalāyādikṣu 
pūrvottarāgrāndaśadarbhānkavacenāstīryamekhalāyāḥ 
pūrvadakṣiṇapaścimottaradikṣu brahmaviṣṇurudrānantānsamabhyarcya 
agnyarmakaṃ rakṣateti vijñāpya | <p. 102> pañcavaktrayutaṃ raktaṃ 
saptajihvāvirājitam | daśahastaṃ triṇetrañca sarvābharaṇabhūṣitam || 
raktavastraparīdhānaṃ paṅkajopari saṃsthitam | baddhapadmāsanāsīna 
daśāyudhasamanvitam | śivāgniṃ dhyātvā tasyordhvavaktre kanakā 
bahurūpā'tirikteti jihvātrayaṃ pūrvādivaktreṣu 
suprabhākṛṣṇāraktāhiraṇmayīti jihvācatuṣṭayaṃ dhyāyet | 
tatohāmagnayenama iti saṃpūjya hāṃ hrūmagnaye svāheti 
tilāhutipañcakaṃ hutvā | agne tvamaiśvaraṃ tejaḥ pāvanaṃ paramaṃ 
yataḥ | tasmāttvadīpahṛtpadme sthāpya santarpayāmyahamityagniṃ 
vijñāpyāgneḥ hṛdayakamale āsanamūrtisadāśivāvāhanapūrvakaṃ 
sarvopacāraissaṃpūjya agnivaktraiśśivavaktresannidhānaṃvibhāvya 
svāhāntamūlena samidannājyalājasarṣapatilādibhiśśataṃ tadardhaṃ vā 
yathāśakti hutvā brahmāṅgānāṃ daśāṃśāhutiṃ hutvā hauṃ 
śivāya vauṣaḍityūrdhvavaktre pūrṇāhutiṃ datvā svāhāntamūlena 
caruṃ grāsatrayaparimitaṃ hutvā brahmāṅgānāmekaikāhutiṃ 
hutvā'camanaṃ pradāya candanatāṃbūlānidatvā 
bhasmapādyāṣṭapuṣpikayā saṃpūjayet | ājyādyabhāve 
patrapuṣpādibhirvā juhuyāt | tataḥ stotrapradakṣiṇanamaskāraissantoṣya 
parāṅmukhārghyaṃ datvā śivamutthāpya liṅgasthe śive saṃpūjayet | 
tataḥ paristaraṇadarbhānsaṃgṛhyāgramadhyamūlānyājyasiktāni kṛtvā 
ekaṃ darbhaṃ samādāya śeṣamagraprabhṛti dahet | tamekaṃ darbhamagnau 
nikṣipya tadbhasmanā lalāṭe tilakaṃ kuryāt | 
tadbhasmadhāraṇamāyuśrīkīrtivardhanaṃ vijayārogyakarañca | tatastasya 
dakṣiṇabhāge caturaśraṃ maṇḍalaṃ kṛtvā maṇḍalāt prāgbhāge 
pūrvādyuttarāntāsu mahādikṣu rudramātṛgaṇayakṣā 
nīśānādikoṇeṣu grahāsurarākṣasanāgān maṇḍalamadhye 
īśānāgneyanair(-)ṛtakoṇeṣu nakṣatrarāśiviśvadevān 
vāyuvaruṇadiśormadhye kṣetrapālañcābhyarcyārghyaṃ datvā 
jalamiśrānnena rudrādibhyo baliṃ datvā'camanaṃ dadyāt | 
rudrādīnāmabhyarcane namontāstattannāmamantrāḥ | balidāne 
svāhāntāḥ | kṣetrapālasyaikavacanamanyeṣāṃ <p. 103> bahuvacanamiti 
bhedaḥ | tataḥ prāgbhāge caturaśramaṇḍale indrādiviṣṇvantānāṃ 
lokapālānāṃ baliṃ dadyāt | tatomaṇḍapādbāhyāṃkaṇe 
gomayamaṇḍale vāyasādibhyassamayabhedibhyaḥ svāhā | agnyādibhyaḥ 
svāhā | sarvebhyograhavāstudevebhyaḥ svāhā | iti pṛthakpṛthak baliṃ 
datvāśvabhūtapatitapretādibhyo'pyekaṃ baliṃdadyāt | yadvā (-)
saṃkṣipya sarvoddeśena ye rudrārudrakarmāṇo raudrasthānanivāsinaḥ | 
(saumyāścaivatu ye kecit saumyasthānanivāsinaḥ |) mātaro rudrarupāśca 
gaṇānāmadhipāśca ye || vighnabhūtāstathā'nye ca digvidikṣu 
samāśritāḥ | sarve suprītamanasaḥ pratigṛhnaṃtvimaṃbalim || siddhiṃ 
juṣantu naḥ kṣipraṃbhayebhyaḥ pāṃtumāṃsadeti 
mantreṇaikaṃbaliṃkṣipet || sarvamidaṃ balikāryamagnikāryādhikāriṇaiva 
kartavyaṃ na sarvaiḥ | agnikāryādhikāre satyapi homopakaraṇavaikalye 
tadaśaktauvā homamantrān homasaṅkhyāpekṣayā daśaguṇāvṛttyā japet 
| tataśśivajñānapūjāṃ kuryāt ||

[śivajñānapūjāvidhiḥ] ||

	śivajñānāni kāmikādayo divyāgamāḥ | tatra kāmikaṃ tribhedaṃ 
parārddhagrantham | yogajaṃ pañcabhedaṃ lakṣagrantham | sūkṣma 
mekatantraṃ padmagrantham | sahasraṃ daśabhedaṃ śaṅkhagrantham | 
aṃśumān dvādaśabhedaṃ pañcalakṣagrantham | suprabhedamekatantraṃ 
trikoṭigrantham | vijayamaṣṭabhedaṃ trikoṭigrantham | niśvāsamaṣtabhedaṃ 
koṭigrantham | svāyambhuvaṃ tribhedaṃ sārdhakoṭigrantham | 
analamekatantraṃ triṃśatsahasragrantham vīratantraṃ trayodaśabhedaṃ 
lakṣagrantham | rauravaṃ ṣaṭbhedamaṣṭārbudagrantham | makuṭaṃ 
dvibhedaṃ lakṣagrantham | vimalaṃ ṣoḍaśabhedaṃ lakṣagrantham | 
prodgītaṃ ṣoḍaśabhedaṃ trilakṣagrantham | lalitaṃ 
tribhedamaṣṭasahasragrantham | siddhaṃ caturbhedaṃ sārdhakoṭigrantham | 
santānaṃ saptabhedaṃ ṣaṭsahasragrantham | śarvoktaṃ pañcabhedaṃ 
dvilakṣagrantham | pārameśvaraṃ saptabhedaṃ dvādaśalakṣagrantham | 
<p. 104> kiraṇaṃ navabhedaṃ pañcakoṭigrantham | vātulaṃ 
dvādaśabhedaṃ lakṣagrantham | evamaṣṭāviṃśatibhedā divyāgamāḥ | 
parārdhaśaṅkhapadmaṣaṭpañcāśatsahasrādhikaiḥ 
ṣaḍuttaraṣaṣṭyālakṣanyūnaṃ padmaṃcetyetāvatsaṃkhyā granthāḥ | 
tadupabhedāḥ aṣṭottaradviśatasaṅkhyāḥ | itthaṃbhūtān sarvānapi 
divyāgamān yathālābhaṃ katicidvā ekaṃ vā tatrāpi 
svapūjopayogisaṃhitāmātraṃ vā lakṣaṇaśāliṣu pustakeṣu lekhayet | 
pustakeṣu dvāviṃśatyaṃguladīrghaṃ caturaṃgulavistāraṃ pustakaṃ 
lakṣmībhadram | ekaviṃśatyaṃguladīrghaṃ tryaṃgulavistāraṃ 
śrīrakṣam | viṃśatyaṃguladīrghaṃ pavahīnatryaṃgulavistāraṃ 
candrakāntam | idamuttamatrayam | aṣṭādaśāṃguladīrghaṃ 
ardhādhikāṃguladvayavistāraṃ nalinam | saptadaśāṃguladīrghaṃ 
triyavādhikāṃgulatrayavistāraṃ śrīnivāsam | ṣoḍaśāṃguladīrghaṃ 
dviyavādhikāṃguladvayavistāraṃ śrībhadram | idaṃ madhyamatrayam | 
pañcadaśāṃguladīrghaṃ yavādhikāṃguladvayavistāraṃ 
lakṣmīnivāsam | caturdaśāṃguladīrghamaṃguladvayavistāraṃ 
umābhadram | trayodaśāṃguladīrghaṃ yavahīnāṃguladvayavistāraṃ 
vīrabhadram | evaṃvidheṣu pustakeṣu yajamānasyayānyanukūlāni 
patrīyacatuṣṭayāṃśatṛtīyāṃśayormaddhyemaddhyagatasiṣiravanti 
kārayitvā yavodaramānaiḥ kārpāsasūtrairābadhnīyāt | eteṣāṃ 
śivajñānapustakānāṃ pūjanāya śivasya dakṣiṇapaścime 
vāyavyabhāge vā trastriṃśaddhastaprabhṛtiṣu trihastaparyanteṣu 
parimāṇeṣvanyatamaparimāṇavadvidyākośagṛhaṃ kṛtvā 
sugandhicandanādyanuliptabhittikasya tasya madhye nāgadantādiracitaṃ 
suvarṇarekhādicitritaṃ vidyāsihmāsanaṃ nidhāya tatra 
dukūlādikamāstīrya tanmadhye 
svarṇarūpyatāmrakāṃsyārakūtalohadāru veṇuvidalikādikṛtāṃ 
vidyāratnakaraṇḍarūpāṃ mañjūṣāṃ nidhāya tasyāṃ pustakāni 
nidaddhyāt | teṣu sarvebhyaśśivajñānebhyonamaḥ iti 
gandhapuṣpadhūpadīpanaivedyaissaṃpūjya || sarvajñānapradaṃ 
śambhuṃ sarvājñānavighātakam | kāyena manasā vācā 
vidyāpīṭhāśrayaṃbhaje iti stutvā namaskuryāt | pustakālābhe <p. 105> 
caturaśramaṇḍale aṣṭadalapadmaṃ tadāvārakamaṣṭādaśadalapadmaṃ ca 
likhitvā karṇikāyāṃ hauṃ śivāyanamaḥ | hāṃ vāgīśāyanamaḥ | iti 
vāgīśvarasahitaṃ śivaṃ saṃpūjya pūrvādiṣu daśasu daleṣu 
kāmikādīn suprabhedāntān śivenādhikaraṇāntaranirapekṣeṇa 
sākṣānnirmitatayā śaivasaṃjñāna divyāgamān saṃpūjya aṣṭādaśasu 
daleṣu vijayādivātulāntān anādirudrādyadhikaraṇena śivena nirmitatayā 
raudrasaṃjñān pūjayet | atha guruṃ svapīṣṭhasthaṃ gatvā tasya pādau 
prakṣālya śivabuddhyā gandhādibhissaṃpūjya puṣpāñjalitrayaṃ kṛtvā 
sāṣṭāṅgaṃ triḥ praṇamyotthāya bhūmau jānunī nyasya 
kṛtāñjalipuṭaḥ kṣamasveti brūyāt | yadimadhulubdho yathā bhṛṅgaḥ 
puṣpātpuṣpaṃ vanāntare | jñānalubdhastathā śiṣyo gurorgurvantaraṃ 
vrajet iti śāstramanusṛtyādhikajñānārthamanyaṃ gurumāśrayati(,) 
tathā'pi pūrvagurumapi yathāpūrvaṃ pūjayet | 
tataśśivasamīpamāgatyāṣṭapuṣpikayā śivaṃ saṃpūjya 
viśeṣārghyaṃ datvā praṇāmapurassaramabhitaḥ prārthanāṃ kṛtvā 
nyūnaṃ bā'pyadhikaṃ vā'pi yanmayā mohataḥ kṛtam | sarvaṃ tadastu 
saṃpūrṇaṃ tvatprasādāt prahomameti saṃprārthya | aparādhasahasrāṇi 
kriyante'harniśaṃ mayā | dāso'yamiti māṃ matvā kṣantavyaṃ 
bhaktavatsala || svāminkṣudreṇa dāsena malīmasadhiyā mayā | kadarthito 
vāyadbhaktivaśāt prītaḥ kṣamasvataditi vijñāpayet | 
tatassadyojātādikrameṇa 
pañcasuśirassuśivamabhyarcyāstrādihṛdayāntānyaṃgāni ca 
prātilomyena saṃpūjya pūrvavadyatheṣṭamūrdhvamukhobhaveti 
saṃprārthya hāṃ hauṃ śivāya sāṅgāya parāṅmukhārghyaṃ svāheti 
parāṅmukhārghyaṃ datvā sadyādīni brahmāṇyastrādīnyaṅgāni ca 
garbhāvaraṇarūpāṇi devasyāṃgeṣu yojayet | anyebhyo'pi 
tattadāvaraṇadevebhyaḥ parāṅmukhārghyaṃ dadyāt | 
huṃphaḍantāstreṇa karadvayāṃguṣṭhatarjanyagrābhyāmūrddhvaṃ 
puṣpaṃ prakṣipannārācamudrayā mantrānutthāpya hāṃ haṃ hāṃ 
śivamūrtayenamaḥ | iti divyamudrayā śivasya hṛdayasthāne saṃyojya 
teṣāṃ <p. 106> tatra layaṃ vibhāvayet | tadanu gurugṛha vidyāpīṭha 
saptaguru mahālakṣmī gaṇapati dvārapālebhyo'pi parāṅmukhārghyaṃ 
datvā svasvamantreṇatānvisarjayet | tataḥ parivāradevebhyopi 
parāṅmukhārghyaṃ datvā pratyekaṃ sapuṣpairvastrairācchādya 
astramantreṇa peṭakasya pārśveṣu nidaddhyāt | tataśśivamantraṃ 
samuccārya padmapīṭhālliṅgamādāya dukūlādibhissaṃveṣṭya 
peṭakamadhye vinyasya bhīmarudraṃ smaran rakṣeti śivājñāṃ vijñāpya 
pidhānaṃ kuryāt | tataḥ miśrapūjāṃ kuryāt | 
prāgakṛtacaṇḍapūjaśśivasyodvāsanānantaramāvāhanādisarvopacāra(-)
sahitāṃ caṇḍapūjāṃ kuryāt ||
	itthaṃ prātarmadhyāhnasāyārdharātriṣu prātarādiṣukāleṣu vā 
prātarādikāladvaye vā prātaḥkālamātrevā ghaṭikātrayeṇa pūjā 
kartavyā | saṃkrāntyuparāgāṣṭamīcaturdaśyādivyatiriktakāleṣu 
bubhūkṣuṇā rātrau pūjā varjanīyā | tenāpi trikālapūjā kriyatece 
dastamayaṃ samārabhya ghaṭikātrayamadhye sāyaṅkālapūjā 
samāpanīyā | mumukṣostu nakālaniyamaḥ | yadvā bubhukṣorapi na 
kālaniyamaḥ | yathāsaṃbhavakāle tu yathāsaṃbhavanāḍikāḥ | 
ātmārthayajanaṃ kuryādyathāśaktyanurodhata ityapyāgamadarśanāt | 
evaṃ prapañcopacārān kartumaśaknuvan ṣoḍaśa pañcopacārān kuryāt 
| āvāhanāsana pādyārghyācamanasnāna vastropavīta gandhapuṣpa 
dhūpadīpa naivedya mukhavāsa 
stotrasahitapraṇāmapradakṣiṇasahitavisarjanāni ṣoḍaśopācarāḥ | yadvā(-)
āsanāvāhana pādyācamanārghyasnāna vastra gandhapuṣpa naivedya 
tāṃbūla dhūpadīpārātrika bhasma culakodakāni ṣoḍaśopacārāḥ | 
āvāhanāsana pādyācamanārghya snāna vastragandhapuṣpanaivedyāni 
daśopacārāḥ | gandhapuṣpadhūpadīpanaivedyāni pañcopacārāḥ | 
yadyapi pārthivaṃ gandhapuṣpādyaṃ kandamūlaphalādikam | āpyaṃ 
vāri payo vastraṃ dadhi gomutrakādikam || āgneyaṃ hemaratnādi 
dīpamābharaṇādikam | vāyavyaṃ cāmaraṃ dhūpaṃ vyajanaṃ 
tālavṛntakam || nābhasaṃ geyavādyādyaṃ vīṇāveṇusvanādikam |
<p. 107> ete pañcopacārāstu kathitāśśāstravedibhiriti pañcopacārāḥ 
prapañcena darśitāḥ | athāpyaśaktānāṃ gandhādinaivedyāntopacārā 
eva kramāt pārthiva nābhasa vāyavya taijasāpyāḥ pañcopacārāh | 
sarvopacārāśśivasyāvāhanavat 
niśvāsocchvāsarūpacandrārkagatinirodhena kartavyāḥ 
ityāgamaprasiddheḥ keṣuci dupacāreṣu mātrāgaṇanena 
kālaniyamo'pyāgameṣu darśitaḥ | āvāhane dvādaśa mātrāḥ | pādye 
pañca | ācamane tisraḥ | arghye ekam | gandhe ṣaṭ | dhūpe dvādaśa | dvipe 
ṣaṭ | naivedye caturviṃśatiḥ | ārātrike sapta | nīrājane ṣoḍaśa | 
bhasmārpaṇe sapta | chatre pañca | cāmare daśa | vyajane tisra iti | evaṃ 
candrārkagatinirodhena kriyamāṇeṣūpacāreṣu tattanmantrāḥ manasaiva 
japtavyāḥ | mantrāśca prāsāda śivamantra pañcabrahma 
ṣaḍaṅgarūpāstattadupacāreṣu yathāvidhi viniyoktavyāḥ | 
tatrāvāhanapādya vastra vilepanabhūṣaṇadarpaṇacchatracāmara tālavṛnta 
japastotra namaskoraṣvanyeṣu ca viśeṣoktirahiteṣūpacāreṣu mantrānte 
namaśśabdaḥ | 
arghyasnānadhūpadīpanaivedyapānīyamukhavāsanīrājanapavitrajapapū(-)
jāsamarpaṇeṣu svāhāśabdaḥ | mārjana secana 
puṣpapūrṇāhutiṣuvauṣaṭśabdaḥ | malasnānaśodhana pāśacchedana 
prokṣaṇa tāḍanabhedana vighnanivāraṇeṣu huṃphaṭśabdaḥ | rakṣāyāṃ 
phaṭśabdaḥ | ācamanesvadhāśabdaḥ | evamuktaniyamaiḥ 
pañcopacārānapi kartumaśaktaḥ kevalamaṣṭapuṣpikayā'rcayet | āsane 
prathamaṃ puṣpaṃ dātavyaṃ śuddhacetasā | mūrtidhyānaṃ hṛdā 
kāryaṃ puṣpeṇaivāpareṇatu || pañcapuṣpapradānena pañcāṅgāni 
prakalpayet | śivaṃ tathā'ṣṭamenaiva kathitācāṣṭapuṣpikā | 
pañcāṅgānimūrddhādīni pañcabrahmāṇi netravarjitāni hṛdayādīni 
vā | etāni cāṣṭapuṣpāṇi sarvasādhāraṇāni tu | sarvasiddhipradānīha 
tathā sarvāśrameṣu ca || sarveṣāṃ caiva varṇānāṃ sarvasādhāraṇāni 
ca | ekakālaṃ dvikālaṃ vā trikālaṃ vā prapūjayet || 
prātarmadhyāhnasamaye tathā cāstamite ravī | <p. 108> pūjayetparayā 
bhaktyā aṣṭapuṣpavidhānataḥ || daridrāṇāmanāthānāṃ 
bālastrībāliśeṣu ca | bhogināṃ vyādhijuṣṭānāṃ tathā 
dhyānārpitātmanām | śivaśāstrānuraktānāṃ nānāsiddhihitātmanām 
| anuraktaviraktānāṃ kathitāsā'ṣṭapuṣpikā iti kālottaravacanāt | bhogo 
rājyaparipālanam | tadvanto bhoginaḥ teṣāṃ rājyaparipālanaṃ 
kurvatāmityarthaḥ | rājyaparipālanena bahuṣu śivasthāneṣu 
śivabhaktānāṃ gṛheṣu ca śivapūjāpravartanena bahupuṇyaṃ labhyate | 
śivaśāstrānuravatānāṃ tadvyākhyānatadadhyayananiratānāmityarthaḥ | 
śivaśāstravyākhyānena hi loke yathāvat śivapūjāpravartanena 
bahupuṇyaṃ labhyate | tadadhyayanena cāgre svayaṃ 
yathāvadbahukālapūjanena bahupuṇyaṃ labhyata iti ||

[kapilāpūjāvidhiḥ] ||

	iti śivapūjāṃ samāpya kapilāpūjāṃ kuryāt | yathā kapilāṃ 
gāṃ nandā subhadrāsurabhi suśīlā sumanassaṃjñāṃ 
pañcagotrarūpāyai kapilāyainama iti  gandhapuṣpādibhirabhyarcya 
saurabheyi jaganmātardevānāmamṛtaprade | gṛhāṇa varade 
grāsamīpsitārthaṃ ca dehime iti grāsaṃ datvā vanditā'si vasiṣṭhena 
viśvāmitreṇa hahnunā | kapile harame pāpaṃ yanmayā duṣkṛtaṃ kṛtamiti 
saṃprārthya gāvo mamāgrato nityaṃ gāvaḥ pṛṣṭhata eva me | gāvo me 
hṛdayecāpi gavāṃ madhye vasāmyahamiti japet | etaṃ naro japenmantrī 
trisaṃdhyaṃ niyataśśuciḥ | vimuktassarvapāpebhyaśśivalokaṃ prapadyate 
||

[parārthālayadarśanam] ||

	tataḥ parārthālayasamīpasthaḥpūjānte śivālayaṃ gatvā 
tatsevāmapi kuryāt | <p. 109> tatrāyaṃ kramaḥ (-) devālayasamīpaṃ gatvā 
gopuradvārabāhye vā balipīṭhasya bāhye vā sthūlaliṅgātmakasya 
vimānasya namaskāraṃ kuryāt | tato bhadraliṅgasya balipīṭhasya 
dhvajastambhasya vṛṣabhasyāpi namaskāraṃ kṛtvā | (ślo) antaḥ praveśe 
śivadarśane ca śivārcanetatphalasiddhilābhe | dehyabhyanujñāṃ bhagavan 
prasannastvatpādapadmapraṇatāyamahyamiti vṛṣabhaṃ saṃprārthya 
balipīṣṭhāgradeśe sāṣṭāṅgaṃ śivaṃ praṇamet | dehaṃ 
vastreṇācchādya na praṇamet | śivasyāgrapṛṣṭha vāmabhāga 
garbhagṛheṣu ca na praṇamet | pratyaṅmukhe cottaradiṅmukhe ca liṅge 
vāmabhāge praṇamet | praṇamyaca devasya purataḥ puṣpāñjaliṃ kṣipet | 
tataḥ pradakṣiṇaṃ kuryāt | garbhagṛhepradakṣiṇamarcakasyaiva | 
antarmaṇḍale pradakṣiṇaṃ dīkṣitānāmeva | antarhārādiṣu sarveṣām | 
tatrāntarhāre pradakṣiṇamekaguṇam | madhyahāretriguṇam | 
maryādāyāṃ caturguṇaṃ | mahāmaryādāyāṃ pañcaguṇaṃ | 
kṣetrāvavauṣaḍaguṇaṃ | evaṃ balakālādhikārānurūpepradeśe 
ekaviṃśatiṃpañcadaśavā saptavāpañcavātrīṇivā pradakṣiṇāni 
kuryāt | atyantamanavasare ekaṃ pradakṣiṇaṃ vā kuryāt | evaṃ 
pradakṣiṇaṃ kurvan garbhagṛhentarmaṇḍale ca saṃbhāvitaṃ 
somasūtralaṅghanaṃ na kuryāt | tallaṅghanavarjanārthaṃ garbhagehe 
somasūtraprabhṛti savyāpasavyameva kartavyam | 
tatobahirantarmaṇḍalamātre savyāpasavyam | tatvaindrādi somasūtrādi vā 
kāryamiti prāguktam | pradoṣetu vṛṣādicaṇḍanāthāntaṃ vṛṣabhaṃ 
somasūtrakam | punarvṛṣaṃ caṇḍanāthaṃ nāladeśasya pārśvataḥ || 
punaḥ prayāyāccaṇḍañca tathaiva vṛṣapṛṣṭhakam | evaṃ 
savyāpasavyaṃ tu pradakṣiṇamihocyate || ādyantaṃ vṛṣadevasya 
catussthānamudāhṛtam | tricaṇḍasthānasaṃyuktaṃ dvisthānaṃ 
somasūtrakamityuktaprakāreṇa kartavyam | somasūtraṃ ca 
prāsādādbahirnālapradeśe prāsādavistāramānaṃ tadardhamānaṃ vā | 
tasya laṅghane doṣaḥ | sūtrādbahirlaṃghane tu nadoṣaḥ || tadabhyantare'pi 
saṅkaṭe tṛṇādikamantardhāya laṅghanīya | tṛṇaiḥ kāṣṭhaistathā 
parṇaiḥ pāṣāṇairloṣṭakādibhiḥ | antardhānaṃ punaḥ kṛtvā 
somasūtraṃ tu laṅghayet iti vacanāt | kvacidapasavyasya <p. 110> niṣedho 
dṛśyate | somasūtradvayaṃ yatra tatra vā viṣṇumandiram | apasavyaṃ na 
kurvīta kuryādeva pradakṣiṇamiti || tato dvārapālaṃ nandikeśvaraṃ ca 
namaskṛtya tattadanujñayā'ntaḥ praviśya vighnarājaṃ 
puṣpāñjalivikiraṇamastakāhatipūrvakaṃ namaskṛtya maṇḍapaṃ 
prā(?)pasya devadevaṃ namaskṛtya mastake hṛdaye vā'ñjaliṃ baddhvā 
yathādhikāraṃ vaidikāgamika paurāṇika laukika drāviḍādi stotraiḥ 
stuvīta | tatrācāryasyaiva garbhagṛhaṃ praviśya sevā | itareṣāṃ 
brāhmaṇānāmardhamaṇḍapaṃ praviśya | 
kṣatriyāṇāmardhamaṇḍapadvāramukhe'vasthāya | vaiśyānāṃ 
vṛṣāgre | śūdrāṇāṃ vṛṣapṛṣṭhe | vaiśyaśūdrāṇāṃ vṛṣāgre 
vṛṣapṛṣṭhe ca gomayena caturaśramaṇḍalaṃ kṛtvā tatraiva 
puṣpāñjalirdātavyaḥ | evaṃ 
nṛttamūrtyādīnāmapipuṣpopahārapūrvakaṃ praṇāmaḥ kāryaḥ | evaṃ 
praṇāmānantaraṃ caṇḍeśvaraṃ praṇamet | itthaṃ 
pīṭhādicaṇḍāntanamaskārānantaraṃ devālaye 
saṃbhāvitānāmaparādhānāṃ kṣālanātha devasya sannidhau 
yathāśakti devasyamūlamantraṃ japtvā devasya pṛṣṭhīkaraṇaṃ vinā 
nirgacchet | aparādhāśca śivālayamadhye vāhanārohaṇa 
sopānahasaṃcāragopurapratimācchāyālaṃghana nirmālyasparśa 
tallaṅghana śivabalipīṭhamadhyasañcāra pramadāsparśa 
rāgapūrvakatadvīkṣaṇa vṛthāhāsa gānabhāṣaṇa 
sottarīyapradakṣiṇanamaskāraikahastanamaskāra 
vāmabhāgādinamaskārākālanamaskāraprabhṛtayaḥ | eteṣu 
saṃbhāvitān varjanīyānaparādhān kṣamāpya nirgacchet | evaṃ śivaṃ 
sevamānene grāmabhūṣaṇādipatrapuṣpaparyantena dravyeṇavā 
saṃmārjanādinā śarīravyāpāreṇa vā 
devālayopakāraparyavāsāyivāṅmātreṇa vā kaiṅkaryaṃ 
kṛtvaivasevanīyam | pratidinaṃ sevāyāmaśaktaścet aṣṭamyādiṣu sevete | 
aṣṭamyāmaṣṭabhirdivasaiḥ parvaṇi pakṣeṇa saṃkrāntau māsena ca 
kṛtasya pāpasya kṣayaḥ | pradoṣe trividhakaraṇārjitānāṃ 
mahattarāṇāmapi pāpānāṃ kṣayaḥ | viṣuvāyanoparāgamahotsavādiṣu 
sevayā śivapadaprāptiḥ | tataḥ gṛhamāgatya yathāvasaraṃ svalpamātraṃ 
vā siddhāntaśāstraśravaṇaṃ tadabhyāsaṃ vā 
dīkṣitaissahādīkṣitasannidhiṃ parihṛtya kuryāt | <p. 111> 
naprakāśyamidaṃ jñānamabhaktānāṃ varānane | rakṣaṇīyaṃ 
prayatnena taskarebhyo yathādhanamiti vacanāt | atha madhyāhnasamaye 
prapañcena saṃkocenāṣṭapuṣpikāmātreṇa vā pūjayet | 
kutaścidvaikalyāt parigṛhītaliṅgārcanālābhe tulyānuṣṭhāyinā 
pareṇārcite liṅge saṃkṣepeṇāṣṭapuṣpikāmātraṃ kuryāt | praṇavo 
mātṛkā māyā vyomavyāpī ṣaḍakṣaram | prāsādo'ghoramantraśca 
sapta sādhāraṇāmatāḥ | evaṃ yathākathaṃcit śivamabhyarcya kāle 
bhoktumicchan sarvasmādapi pākādagryamuddhṛtya tatrārdhaṃ śivāya 
nivedya ardhena yathādhikāraṃ vaidikaṃ śaivaṃ ca homaṃ kuryāt | 
vaidiko vaiśvadevahaumaḥ | śaivaḥ cullīhomaḥ ||

[cullīhomaḥ] ||

	tasyāyaṃ kramaḥ | (buddhimiti) cullīṃ 
nirīkṣaṇādibhissaṃśoddhyatatrāgniṃ pūrakakuṃbhakābhyāṃ 
bindunābhisthānābhyāṃ sahaikīkṛtya bhautikabaindavajāṭharāgnitrayaṃ 
recakena nissārya piṅgalayā cullikāgnau nikṣipya tadanantaraṃ agnaye 
namaḥ | somāya namaḥ | sūryāya namaḥ | bṛhaspataye namaḥ | prajāpataye 
namaḥ | sarvebhyo devebhyo namaḥ | sarvebhyo viśvebhyo namaḥ | agnaye 
sviṣṭakṛte namaḥ | ityagnāvāgneyādipūrvāntamagnyādīn 
saṃpūjyasvāhāntaistattanmantrairhutvā tānvisarjayet ||

[nirmālyabhojanam] ||

	tato niveditaṃ taccheṣaṃ vā bhuṃjīta | śivaniveditabhojane 
phalavacanāni bahūni śrūyante (-) madīyabhuktanirmālyaṃ pādāṃbu 
kusumaṃ dalam | dharmamarthaṃ ca kāmañca mokṣaṃ ca dadate kramāt iti 
|| tanniṣedhavacanānyapi śrūyante na dhārayet kvacicchaṃbhornirmālyaṃ 
naca bhakṣayedityādīni | eteṣāṃ śivadīkṣāsahita tadrahitaviṣayatvena 
vyavasthā | nirmālyaṃ nirmalaṃ śuddhaṃ nirmalatvā daninditam | <p. 112> 
tasmādabhojyaṃ nirmālyamaśuddhai raśivātmakaiḥ || 
jihvācāpalyasaṃyuktaśśivasaṃskāravarjitaḥ | śivanirmālyabhojī cet 
rauravaṃ narakaṃ vrajediti śivapurāṇavacanāditi kecit | 
kāmikādisiddhāntatantreṣu dīkṣitānāmeva samayācāravidhānena 
nirmālyaṃ naca bhuñjīteti śivabhaktānnaṃ na nindayedityādīni 
niṣedhavacanāni nirmālyabhakṣaṇe'ghoraṃ pramādādayutaṃjapediti 
prāyaścittavidhānāni ca śrūyante | ataḥ svādyānicādanīyāni 
peyānyanyāni yāni ca | deyāni tāni vai śaṃbho raśnīyāddāsabhāvataḥ 
ityādipurāṇavacanāni vaidikapaurāṇikapāśupatādivihita 
śivasaṃskāreṇa ye dīkṣitāsteṣāmeva śivanirmālyaṃ grāhyam | natu 
kāmikādisiddhāntatantreṇa dīkṣitānamiti kecit | kāmika eva(-)
aśuddhātmā'śucirlobhānmadbhuktaṃ pāvanaṃ param | 
bhakṣayannāśamāpnoti rasabhoktā yathādvijaḥ || malliṅgadhāriṇoloke 
deśikā matparāyaṇāḥ | madekaśaraṇāsteṣu yogyaṃ naivānyajantuṣu iti 
vacanāt(,) upavāsasahasrāṇi prājāpatyaśatāni ca | śivaprasādasiddhasya 
koṭyaṃśenāpi nosamāḥ ityādivātulāgamaprabhṛtivacanadarśanācca | 
siddhāntatantre dīkṣitānāmapi śivaniveditaṃ praśastameva | 
śivanirmālyaniṣedhaprāyaścittavacanāni tu devasvaṃ devatādravyaṃ 
naivedyaṃ ca niveditam | caṇḍabhuktabahiḥkṣiptamiti 
pañcavidhanirmālyaviṣayāṇi | kāmike devasvaṃ devatādravyaṃ 
naivedyaṃ ca niveditam | caṇḍadravyañca nirmālyaṃ nirmālyaṃ 
ṣaḍvidhaṃ bhavet || grāmādīśasya devasvaṃ devadravyaṃ paṭādikam | 
naivedyaṃ kalpitaṃ tasmai devocchiṣṭaṃ niveditam || caṇḍadravyaṃ tu 
taddattaṃ nirmālyaṃ preritaṃ bahiriti nirmālyaṣāḍvidhya 
nirmālyopabhogadoṣasaṃkīrtana tatprāyaścittopadeśānantarameva 
niveditākhyanirmālyasvīkārānumatyartha 
maśuddhātmā'śucirlobhādityādisārdhaślokadvayasya paṭhitatvāt | 
evañca siddhāntatatre.ṣu śivaniveditaniṣedhavacanāni <p. 113> 
taduktaśivadīkṣārahitaviṣayāṇītyapare || suprabhede (-) sadāśivasya 
nirmālyaṃ manuṣyāṇāṃ na bhojanam | paśunāṃ ca gajānāṃ ca 
jalevā'tha vinikṣipet || athavā vahninā dahyādbhūmau vā 
khātayedbudhaḥ iti sadāśivanirmālyasya 
manuṣyamātrasādhāraṇyenābhojyatvaṃ prattipādya 
tasyabhūvanhigogajādiṣveva pratipattivarṇanācca sadāśivanirmlāyaṃ 
dīkṣitānāmapyabhojyameva | teṣāṃ śivanirmālyaṃ praśastamiti 
vacanāni tu sakalanirmālyaviṣayāṇi | pratimāsu ca sarvāsu na 
caṇḍo'dhikṛtobhavedi ti sakaleṣu caṇḍādhikāraniṣedhāt | 
kārṇesakalānāṃ ca naivedyaṃ sarveṣāṃ bhojanaṃ bhavediti 
sakalanaivedyānumativarṇanāt | tadapi śivadīkṣitaistatparicārakaireva 
bhoktavyam | suprabhede (-) sadāśivasya nirmālyamityādyuktyanantaraṃ 
sakalānāṃ tu nirmālyaṃ paricārakabhojanam | tadapyanyajanānāṃ tu 
bhojane doṣakṛdbhavet ityuktatvādityapare | sadāśivanirmālyeṣvapi 
manuṣyādisthāpitaśivaliṅgārpiteṣveva niṣedhaḥ | natu caraliṅgādiṣu | 
teṣu caṇḍādhikārābhāvāt | bāṇaliṅge care lohe ratnaliṅge svayaṃbhuvi 
| pratimāsu ca sarvāsu na caṇḍo'dhikṛto bhavet || liṅgesvāyaṃbhuvebāṇe 
ratnajerasanirmite | siddhapratiṣṭhiteliṅgena caṇḍodhikṛtobhavet | iti ca 
vacanādityeke | calaliṅgādiṣu caṇḍādhikāro nāstīti vacanāni 
vaidikapaurāṇika vāmadakṣiṇatantrādiviṣayāṇi | natu 
kāmikādisiddhāntaviṣayāṇi | sthirecare tathā ratne mṛddārauśailakalpite | 
lohacitramaye bāṇe sthitaścaṇḍoniyāmakaḥ || siddhāntenetare tantre 
navāme naca dakṣiṇe iti || avyaktavyaktaliṅgeṣu maṇḍale sthaṇḍile'nale | 
care sthire tathā ratne maṇicitrādike tathā || gandhānnasaṃbhave liṅge 
mṛdbhasmaphalakalpite | tathā puṣpamaye liṅge caṇḍapūjā niyāmiketi ca 
kālottarādiṣu viśeṣadarśanāt | ato 
nirmālyavidhiniṣedhayoścarasthirādiviṣayatvenanavyavasthā | kintu 
nirmālyaviśeṣaviṣayatvena | tāṃbūlaṃ bhasma tailaṃ ca 
gandhapuṣpamapūpakam | phalādi bhakṣaṇadravyaṃ (-) nirmālyamiti <p. 114> 
nocyata iti vacanāditikecit | kāmike (-) sveṣṭaliṅge ca yaddattaṃ caruvattanna 
saṃśayaḥ | naivedyaṃ bhrātṛputrāṇāṃ bhaginīnāṃ ca dāpayediti 
carudṛṣṭāntavacanāt | kāraṇe (-) sphāṭikaṃ bāṇaliṅgañca sthāpitaṃ 
carameva vā tanniveditanirmālyaṃ na nirmālyaṃ prakalpayet || bālānāṃ 
yuvatīnāṃ ca bhojanaṃ balavarddhanamityanirmālyatvapratipādanācca 
caraliṅgādiniveditānnamapi bhojyameva | kintu pūjakasya na bhojyam | 
naivedyaṃ bhrātṛputrāṇāmityādiviśeṣavacanāt | tāṃbūlādimātrasya 
grāhyatvavacanaṃ tu manuṣyādisthāpita liṅgaviṣayamityapi kecit | 
naivedyaṃ kalpayitvā tu śivāyeti tadūrddhvataḥ | nivedyaṃ 
mahyamucchiṣṭaṃ bhuṅkte pratyahamādarāt || so'yaṃ matsadṛśaḥ 
proktaḥ carudravyastathābhavediti kāmike nivedanakarturapi 
taducchiṣṭabhojanapratipādanātpūjakasyāpi śivaniveditaṃ bhojyameva | 
tasya niveditabhojananiṣedhavacanāni tu 
saṃhārarudrādiniveditaviṣayatvenayojyānītyapi kecanavadaṃti | 
sadāśivamūrtau paramaśivāvāhanapurassaraṃ tatpūjānirūpaṇāvasāna 
eva tanniveditaniṣedhasyadivyāgameṣubahuśaśśravaṇāt 
vidhiniṣedhasahasraśabalitaṃ sarvavidhamapi 
śivanirmālyaṃvarjanīyamityevayuktam | śrūyate ca mahāndoṣaḥśrūyate 
ca mahāphalam | phalaṃ tatraparityājyaṃdoṣohibalavattara iti vacanāt | 
nacakāmike (-) patraṃpuṣpaṃ phalaṃ toyamannaṃ pādyamathauṣadham | 
anivedya nabhuñjīta bhagavantaṃ sadāśivamityaniveditabhojane'pi 
niṣedhaḥśrūyate iti vācyam | 
tasyātithisatkārarahitabhojananiṣedhavattaccheṣabhojanavidhiparatva(-)
saṃbhavāt(,) annādyamauṣadhaṃ toyaṃ patraṃ puṣpaṃ phalādikam(,) | 
śivāya datvātaccheṣaṃ bhojyaṃ bhuñjīta buddhimānitiṃ 
siddhāntaśekhare tathaivapratipādanāccetyevamitarevarṇayanti | evaṃ 
nirmālyavidhiniṣedhavacanānāṃ vicāre nava pakṣāssaṃpannāḥ | 
śivasaṃskārarūpadīkṣāvatāmeva 
śivanirmālyānumatiranyeṣāntanniṣedha ityādyaḥ pakṣaḥ | 
śivasaṃskāravatsvapi vaidikadīkṣāvatāmevātyāśramiprabhṛtīnāṃ 
tadanumatiḥ natukāmikādisiddhāntatantroktadīkṣāvatāṃ <p. 115> 
tanniṣedhatadbhakṣaṇaprāyaścittavidhānadarśanāditi dvitīyaḥ pakṣaḥ | 
niveditavyatiriktapañcavidhanirmālyaviṣaya eva 
niṣedhaprāyaścittopadeśaḥ | niveditaṃ tu teṣāmapi grāhyamiti tṛtīyaḥ 
pakṣaḥ | niveditamaddhye'pi śivaliṅganiveditaniṣedhāt sakalaniveditameva 
grāhyamiti caturthaḥ pakṣaḥ | śivaliṅganiveditaṃ na sarvaniṣiddhaṃ(,) kintu 
manuṣyādipratiṣṭhāpita sthiraliṅganiveditameva | 
caraliṅgādiniveditantugrāhyam | tatra caṇḍādhikārābhāvāditi 
pañcamaḥ pakṣaḥ | kāmikādigata niveditaniṣedhatadanumativacanānāṃ 
sthira carādiviṣayatayā na vyavasthā(,) kāmikādisiddhāntamārge 
carādipūjāyāmapi caṇḍasadbhāvāt | kintu annādiviṣayo niṣedha | 
phalāpūpatāṃbulādiviṣayā'numatiriti vyavasthā | 
taditareṣuviśeṣavacanasadbhāvāditiṣaṣṭhaḥpakṣaḥ | 
caraliṅgādiniveditamannādikamapigrāhyameva | kintu 
bhrātrādibhyodeyaṃ(,) natu pūjakenabhoktavyamiti saptamaḥpakṣaḥ | 
śivārpaṇabuddhyāśivaniveditaṃ pūjakenāpi bhojyamityaṣṭamaḥ pakṣaḥ 
| phalaniṣedhavacanayorniṣedhavacanasya balīyastvāt 
sarvasyāpiśivanirmālyasyavarjanameva yuktamiti navamaḥpakṣaḥ || eteṣu 
navamaḥ pakṣastāvadatyantamayuktaḥ | śivanirmālyasvīkāre 
mahāphalapratipādakānāṃ bahūnāṃ 
divyāgamapurāṇādivacasāmaprāmāṇyaprasaṅgāt | nahyārṣeṣu 
vacaneṣu varṇamātramapyaprāmāṇyaṃ sahate | nitarāṃ śivavākyeṣu | 
yeṣvarthavādakatayā prāmāṇyopapādanamapi mahate pratyavāyāyeti 
sarvadivyāgamaghaṇṭāghoṣaḥ | śrūyate ca mahāndoṣa ityādi vacanaṃ tu 
yatra vidhiniṣedhayorubhayorapyanyatraprāmāṇyāvakāśaḥ tatra tayoḥ 
dvayoḥ kvacinmelane niṣedhobalīyānityetatparam | 
yathādvādaśyāmāmalakaprāśastyavacanaprāmāṇyamarkavāramelanara
hitadvādaśyāṃ sāvakāśaṃ arkavāre tanniṣedhavacanaprāmāṇyaṃ 
dvādaśīmelanarahite'rkavāre sāvakāśam | dvādaśyarkavāramelane 
satyāmāmalakaphalaniṣedhavacanadvayaprāptau niṣedhavacanaṃ balīya iti | 
phalavacanānāṃ sarvathaivāprāmāṇyopapādakaṃ niṣedhavacanānāṃ 
balīyastvaṃtu prāmāṇikā nādriyante | ato vidhiniṣedhavacanānāṃ 
viṣayavyavasthāpradarśanameva yuktam ||

	(ślo) tāṃ tu pradarśayiṣyāmaḥ pūrvadarśitavartmanā | 
sarvāgamāvirodhena sarvaśaivānumodinīṃ || śaivānāṃ bhojanaṃ 
trividham | śivapūjāsamāptau bāhyakuṇḍe śivāgnikāryavat 
tadanantaraṃ śivāgnikāryāntaramātmabhojanamiti bhāvanayaikam | 
naivedyasamaye nivedyamānadravyāṇāṃ rūpārpaṇātmakaṃ śive 
nivedanasyārambhamātrakṛt mātmabhojanaṃ tu śivāya 
tadrucyarpaṇātmakanivedanapūraṇamiti bhāvanayā dvitīyam | prathamaṃ 
nivedanasamaya eva parasvadādiyāgīyahaviriva sūkṣmarūpatayā 
naivedyaṃ rucyāsaha śivena upabhuktamevātmabhojanaṃ śivadāsasya 
karma taducchiṣṭasvīkaraṇarūpamiti bhāvanayā tṛtīyam | tatrādyaṃ 
suprabhede vahnikāryapaṭaleprapañcitam (-) agnikāryasya cānte tu 
prāṇāgnauhomamācaret | tatpārśve vahniśālāyāṃ 
bhojanasthānamucyate || gṛhevā'pi prakartavyaṃ prāṇāgniyajanaṃ param | 
tatsthānaṃ gomayāliptaṃ śuddhaṃ kṛtvā viśeṣataḥ || 
piṣṭacūrṇairalaṃkṛtyasavitānaṃ sadīpakam | sauvarṇaṃ rājataṃ 
tāmraṃ kāṃsyaṃ vā kadalīdalam | pātrametat tu 
saṅgrāhyaṃśodhayitvā yathārhakam || pātre'śeṣāṇi saṃyojya 
svātmasthaṃ śivamarcayet | ātmātu yajamāno'sau 
buddhistatpatnikāsmṛtā || keśaromāṇidarbhāssyurjihvādyā 
yajñapātrakam | hṛtpuṇḍarīkavedyāṃ tamantasthāgnau supūjayet || 
romadarbhānparistīrya praṇavaṃ śivasaṃyutam | uccārya pariṣicyātha 
śivenodbhukṣya mantravat || śivamantraṃ jale japtvā 
brahmāṇyaṃgānyanukramāt | śivaṃ dhyātvā śivāyeti jalaṃ pītvā 
hṛdā punaḥ || śivāya juhuyādīśamantrādyairbrahmapañcabhiḥ | 
madhyamānāmikāṃguṣṭhairādāyānnaṃ śanaiḥśanaiḥ || 
yaccāmṛtetyādi naiva jalaṃ pītvā viśeṣataḥ | pañcāhutīśca juhuyāt 
prāṇamantraistu pañcabhiḥ || pātrasaṃsparśanaṃ kṛtvā 
pa~ścādbhuñjīta sādhakaḥ | ācamya ca 
vidhānenādityābhimukhasaṃsthitaḥ || udaraṃ śivamantreṇa 
savyenābhimṛśettataḥ | dakṣiṇāṃguṣṭhakenāṃbhaḥ <p. 117> 
pādāṃguṣṭhe tu dakṣiṇe || srāvayettu śivaṃ smṛtvā hṛnmantraṃ tu 
samuccaran | culakodakametatsyāt svātmanaḥ pādamūlataḥ || 
prāṇāgnihotramityevaṃ nityametadudāhṛtam | agnikāryamidaṃ proktaṃ 
śṛṇutvaṃ kuṇḍalakṣaṇamiti || idaṃ bhojanamaniveditānnenaiva kartavyam | 
tadarthamaniveditānnasadhāvaḥ parārthapūjāyāmekabhāgaṃ nivedyaṃ 
syādekabhāgaṃ hutaṃ bhavet | ekabhāgaṃ tu balyarthaṃ 
śeṣamācāryabhojanamiti āgamavacanairdarśitaḥ | ātmārthapūjāyāṃ 
pākādardhaṃ samuddhṛtya tasyārdhaṃ śaṃbhave'rpayet | agnāvardhena 
juhuyāt tadvividhiśca nigadyata ityādi 
cullīhomaprakaraṇāgamavacanairdarśitaḥ | dvitīyabhojanaṃ tu 
vātulottaredarśitam (-) rūpaṃ samarpya dravyasya rucimapyarpayecchive | 
ubhayārpaṇahīnaṃ cet naivedyaṃ niṣphalaṃ bhavet || 
tattatprasādabhogāntaṃ naivedyārpaṇamucyate | prasādadānahīnaṃ cet 
naivedyamapi niṣphalamityādinā | idamārabdhāsamāpta 
nivedanakriyeṇānnena kartavyam | naivedyopacārasamaye devasya purato 
yannaivedyaṃ nihitaṃ tasya tadānīṃ rūpārpaṇenārabdhā nivedanakriyā 
rucyarpaṇaparyantamanuvartata iti 
tadevārabdhāsamāptanivedanakriyamannam | tacca devapitrādyuddeśena 
dattamagnaṃ tatsamarpaṇabuddhyeva pūjakaśśivasamarpaṇabuddhyā 
bhuñjīta | tattṛtīyaṃ bhojanaṃ | malliṅgadhāriṇo loke 
deśikāmatparāyaṇāḥ | madekaśaraṇāsteṣu yogyaṃ naivānyajantuṣu || 
svādyānicādanīyāni peyānyanyāni yāni ca | deyānitānivai śaṃbho 
raśnīyāddāsabhāvataḥ || dāsamārgaprapannāye śaive pāśupate sthitāḥ 
| taireva peyaṃbhojyaṃ cāghrātavyaṃ ca mumukṣubhiriti 
kāmikāgamādiṣu prasiddhamidaṃ bhojanaṃ niveditenaiva kartavyam | 
devasya purato mumukṣubhirnaivedyopacārasamaye yannihitaṃ 
tattadānīmeva sūkṣmarūpeṇa rucyāsaha śivenopabhuktamiti 
niveditamucyate | tadeva śivocchiṣṭaṃ śuśrūṣārthaṃ brāhmaṇadāsyaṃ 
prapannaśśūdrastaducchiṣṭamiva śivadāsyaṃ prapannaḥ bhuñjīta | evaṃ 
ca śivanirmālye yāni sāmānyato niṣedhavacanāni tāni 
śivadāsyabhāvanārahitapaśurūpamanuṣyamātraviṣayāṇi | <p. 118> yāni 
tu dīkṣitān śivadāsyabhāvanāvata evādhikṛtya tanniṣedhavacanāni tāni 
niveditātiriktapañcavidhanirmālyaviṣayāṇīti vyavasthādvayaṃ 
prācīnaireva darśitam | atra dvitīyavyavasthā nirmālye ṣaḍvidhe 
bhojyamekameva niveditamityādyāgamaprasiddhā | prathamavyavasthā 
śivapurāṇe spaṣṭaṃ prapañcitā | tatrahi (-) anarhaṃ mama naivedyaṃ 
pādāṃbu kusumaṃ dalam | itīśvareṇa kathitamiti kecinmaharṣayaḥ || 
vadanti tatkathaṃ svāmina yathārthaṃ kathayasvame iti jaiminipraśne (-)
devadevasya vacasoviṣayastatra jaimine | ye 
vīrabhadraśapitāśśivabhaktiparāṅmukhāḥ || śaṃbhoranyeṣu deveṣu ye 
bhaktā ye na dīkṣitāḥ | ye śuddhakarmiṇaśśambhoranyatra 
samabuddhayaḥ || teṣāmanarhamīśasya tatprasādacatuṣṭayamiti 
vyāsavacanaṃ dṛśyate | anyāni cādīkṣitānāmabhaktānāṃ 
śivanirmālyamayogya mityarthe kāmikādiprasiddhāni vacanāni 
prāgudāhṛtāni | nanu śivanirmālyaṃ sakalapātakaharaṃ 
sakalavyādhinivartakamakhilayajñaphalapradamaśeṣatīrthasnānatulyaṃ 
bhuktimuktyekasādhanamiti śivaśāstrajñairuddhuṣyate | 
bhaktidīkṣārahitairnabhakṣyaṃ naspraṣṭavyamityapyucyate | 
kathametadupapadyate | tathā sakalapāpanivartanaśaktyādiyuktaṃ 
sarvaprāyaścittādivacchivanāmakīrtanavadvā 
sarvasādhāraṇībhavitumeva hi yogayam | kathaṃ keṣāṃcit pariharaṇīyaṃ 
syāt | ataśśivanirmālyaṃ nikṛṣṭamityeva keṣāṃcit pariharaṇīya 
māsīditi kuto na bhavati | haradattācāryairapi 
samamuktarītyotkarṣāpakarṣasādhāraṇyenaivoktam (-) utkarṣataḥ 
pariharatyapakarṣato vā kā vāsanā bhavati kasya kṛte na vidmaḥ | 
yaddīkṣitasya patitasya ca tulyarūpaṃ pratyādiśanti munayaḥ 
kamanīyamannam || caṇḍāla caṇḍilacitānala śauṇḍikānāṃ gobrāhmaṇa 
jvalanadīkṣitayoṣitāṃ vā | sparśaḥkathaṃbhavati bhāvanayā niṣiddhaḥ 
spṛṣṭeṣu vā śivakathā vihitā viśuddhiḥ || varjyānnamāhurapi dīkṣita 
magnikalpaṃ bhojyānnameva kṛtarājaparikrayaṃ tam | śaṅkhāsthi 
pāvanamapāvanamasthi nṝṇāmitthaṃ <p. 119> sthite vacanamatra 
parāyaṇaṃ naḥ iti || tasmādvivicyedaṃ kathanīyamiti | kimutkarṣataḥ 
śivanirmālyaṃ keṣāṃcitpariharaṇīyaṃ apakarṣatoveti | ucyate | 
śivanirmālyaṃ sakalapāpaharatvādisarvotkṛṣṭaguṇaśālītyatra 
tāvannavivādāvakāśaḥ | yeṣu purāṇāgameṣu keṣāṃcittanniṣedhaṃ 
kṛtaḥ teṣveva tathāvidhaguṇaśālītyapi pratipāditatvāt | śrūyante hi 
purāṇāgameṣu vacanāni (-) pādodakaṃ ca nirmālyaṃ bhaktyā dhāryaṃ 
prayatnataḥ | na taṃ spṛśanti pāpāni manovākkāyajānyapi || bhakṣaye dyo 
naro bhaktyā pavitramiti śaṃsitaḥ | śuddhātmā brāhmaṇastasya pāpaṃ 
kṣipraṃ vinaśyati || matprasādodakaṃ puṣpaṃ sadādhārya mihāśritaiḥ | 
rogibhiśca viśeṣeṇa viṣadigdhaiśca yatnataḥ || sveṣṭaliṅge ca 
yaddattañcaruvattannasaṃśayaḥ | rājasūyasahasrasya phalaṃ prāpnoti 
nārada || pṛthūdakaṃ mahātīrthaṃ gaṅgā ca yamunānadī | narmadā 
sarayūrviprāstathā godāvarīnadī || sadāsannihitāstvetāśśaṃbhoḥ 
snānodake mune | śaṃbhossnānodakaṃ sevyaṃ sarvatīrthamayaṃ hi tat || 
ayutaṃ yogavāṃ dadyācchrotriyāyāhitāgnaye | mama pādajale snātvā 
tatphalaṃ samavāpnuyāt ityādīni ca || vaidyaśāstre ca (-) nirmālyasalilaṃ 
prāśya devadevasya śūlinaḥ | kṣayakuṣṭhajvaraśvāsairmucyate 
kilviṣairapi iti || rāmāyaṇe'pi (-) tatra devarṣigandharvā vasudhātalavāsinaḥ 
| bhavāṃgapatitaṃ toyaṃ pavitramiti paspṛśuriti || bhāgavate'pi (-) kiṃ vā 
śivākhyamaśivaṃ na vidustvadanye 
brahmādayastadavakīryajaṭāḥśmaśāne | 
tanmālyabhasmanṛkapālavasatpiśācairye mūrddhabhirdadhati 
taccaraṇāvasṛṣṭamiti || evaṃ paramapāvanasyāpi śivanirmālyasya sparśe 
keṣāṃcinniṣedhaśśivaliṅgasparśe niṣedha iva 
teṣāmanadhikāraprayuktaṃ eva | yathāhiṃ pūrvaṃ 
laukikaśilāviśeṣarūpamapi śivaliṅgaṃ pratiṣṭhāsaṃskāreṇa 
nirastamāyāvikārabhūtāśuddharūpaṃ cinmayaṃ jātamiti 
tadanantaramadīkṣitānāmaspṛśyamāsīt(,) evaṃ nirmālyamapi 
nirīkṣaṇādisaṃskārabṛndena tathābhūtaṃ jātaṃ tadanantaraṃ śivena 
svopabhogayogyamityugra <p. 120> bhuktañcetyativiśuddhaṃ 
jātamatasteṣāmaspṛśyamāsīt | etadabhiprāyeṇoktaṃ vātulottare (-)
supratiṣṭhitaliṅgeṣu na yathāpūrvabhāvanā | tathā śivaprasādasya 
pūrvanāmanasaṃsmaret iti || evaṃ bhūtaṃ śivanirmālyaṃ dīkṣayā 
vidhūtakalmaṣāṇāṃ chinnapāśānāṃśivabhaktānāmeva 
śivaliṅgamiva spṛśyaṃ tadā jñayā bhojyaṃ ca | te hi 
śivabhaktāśśivadīkṣayā 
pratidivasaparicīyamānabhūtaśuddhidaṃḍamuṇḍakalānyāsena ca 
śivaliṅgavacchivanirmālyavaccāprākṛtarūpāssaṃpannāḥ | 
hastapādādisādharmyādrudrādrānmamavapurdharān | prākṛtā neva 
mantrāno nāvajānāti buddhimān iti vāyusaṃhitāvacanāt | 
yattusakalapāpaharatvādiguṇavatve sarvaprāyaścittavatkimiti 
sarvasādhāraṇaṃ na jātamiti śaṅkitaṃ tadapyetena nirastam | 
atiśuddhaśivanirmālyasparśa evānyeṣāmanadhikārasyoktatvāt | nahi 
brahmahatyādimahāpātakaharamiti aghamarṣaṇādi vaidikasūktaṃ 
vedaśravaṇe'pyanadhikāriṇāmatraivarṇikānāṃ sādhāraṇaṃ bhavati 
naca tāvatāvaidikasūktasya kaścidapakarṣaḥ | kiṃcotkarṣa eva | 
tadabhiprāyeṇaiva purāṇoṣvīśvaravacanaṃ 
aśuddhātmā'śucirlobhānmadbhuktaṃ pāvanaṃ param | 
bhakṣayannāśamāpnoti śūdrohyadhyayanādiva iti || yattu 
śivanāmavadativiśuddhamapi śivanirmālyaṃ sarvasādhāraṇaṃ kimiti na 
jajātamiti śaṅkitaṃ tatra drūmaḥ | ati viśuddhamaprākṛtamapi śivanāma 
śivājñayā sarvasādhāraṇaṃ jātam | tadghaṭitaṃ vaidikaṃ 
pañcākṣaraṃ jīvaratnamapi | tathāhi vāyusaṃhitāyām (-) kalau kaluṣite 
kāle durjayeduratikrame | apuṇyatamasācchanne loke dharmaparāṅmukhe || 
kṣīṇevarṇasamācāre saṃkare samupasthite | sarvādhikāre saṃdigdhe 
niścite vā viparyaye || gurūpadeśevihiteguruśiṣyavyatikrame | kenopāyena 
mucyante bhaktāstava maheśvare tyaṃbikāyāḥ praśne | śivavacanam (-)
āśrityaparamāṃ vidyāṃ hṛdyāṃ pañcākṣarīṃ mama | bhaktyā ca 
bhāvitātmano mucyante kalijānarāḥ || manovākkāyajairdoṣairvaktuṃ 
smartumagocaraiḥ | dūṣitānāṃ kṛtaghnānāṃ nirdayānāṃ 
khalātmanām || baddhānāṃ <p. 121> vakramanasā mapi 
matpravaṇātmanām || mamapañcākṣarīvidyā saṃsārabhayatāriṇī | 
mayaiva masakṛddevipratijñātṃ dharātale || patito'pi vimucyeta madbhakto 
vidyayā'nayeti || punaśca (-) karmayogyo bhavenmartyo'patito yadi sarvathā | 
karmāyogyena yatkarma kṛtaṃtannarakāyahi || tataḥ kathaṃ vimucyeta 
patitovidyayā'nayeti aṃbikāpraśne | śivavacanam (-) satyametat tvayā 
proktaṃ tathā'pi śṛṇu sundari | rahasyamiti matvaitat gopitaṃ yanmayā 
purā || svakarmapatitomartyaḥ pūjayedyadi mohataḥ | nārakī syānnasandeho 
mama pañcākṣaraṃ vineti || evaṃ 
śivājñayāsarvasādhāraṇyāpādanādevedamājñāsiddhamityapi tatra 
vyavahṛtam | tadalpākṣaramarthāḍhyaṃ vedasāraṃ vimuktidam | 
ājñāsiddhamasaṃdigdhaṃ vākyametaccivātmakamiti || 
tasmādatarkanīyaśśivanāmno mahimeti tasyapatita 
caṇḍālādisādhāraṇyaṃ yuktamevetyalaṃ prapañcena || 
prakṛtamanusarāmaḥ ||

	yattu sadāśivasya nirmālyaṃ manuṣyāṇāṃ na 
bhojanamityudāhṛtaṃ(,) taccaṇḍasamarpitasadāśivanirmālyaviṣayam || 
kāmike (-) nirmālyaṃ tu samānīya caṇḍeśāya nivedayet || yato nirmalatāṃ 
yāti tannirmālyaṃ prakīrtitam || caṇḍasyācamanaṃ datvā nirmālyaṃ tu 
visarjayet || agādhe'mbhasivā'gnau vā gavāṃ vā vinivedayediti 
caṇḍasamarpaṇānantarameva jalādiṣu pratipattividhānāt | tatraiva (-)
caṇḍabhojyaṃ durādharṣaṃ varjanīyaṃ prayatnataḥ iti(,) devasvaṃ 
caṇḍabhojyaṃ vā nānyabhogāya kalpyata iti ca caṇḍadravyasya 
sarvābhojyatvapratipādanena tāvanmātrasyaiva jalādiṣu 
pratipatyapekṣatvācca | nanvevaṃ sati sarvamapi śivaliṅga 
nirmālyamabhojyamevetyuktaṃ bhavati | lehyacoṣyānnapānādi 
tāṃbūlaṃsragvilepanam | nirmālyaṃ nikhilaṃ tubhyaṃ pradattaṃ tu 
śivājñayeti caṇḍasamarpaṇamantraliṅgānusāreṇa sarvasyāpi 
śivanirmālyasyacaṇḍāyasamarpaṇīyatvāvagamāditi kecit | maivam | 
kāmike (-) parārthapūjāyām aiśānyāṃ pūjayeccaṇḍaṃ 
gandhapuṣpādibhiḥ kramāt | tasmai samarpayetsarvaṃ nirmālyaṃ 
yatprakalpitamiti sarvasva <p. 122> nirmālyasya caṇḍeśāya 
samarpaṇīyatvapakṣamuktvā liṅgamūrdhnisthamityeke 
piṇḍikāsthamathāpare | aiśānyāṃpiṇḍikāsthaṃ vā 
bāhyecaṇḍagṛhenayediti 
gandhapuṣpanirmālyaikadeśasamarpaṇapakṣasyāpyuktatayā 
tannyāyenaniveditānne'pyekadeśasamarpaṇapakṣāṃgīkāronnayanāt | 
anyatraca (-) śivopabhuktaṃ sraggandhamannapānādikaṃ tathā | niveditamiti 
proktaṃ sarvapāpaharaṃ param || nirmālye ṣaṭvidhe bhojyamekameva 
niveditamiti caṇḍadravyātpṛthakniveditasadbhāvasya tadbhojyatāyāśca 
sākṣādeva pratipādanācca | ātmārthapūjāyāṃ tu 
naitacchaṅkāvakāśaḥ | kāmika eva śivapūjānirūpaṇānantaraṃ ante 
caṇḍeśvaraṃ yajedityupakramya vāṇe lohe cale siddhe na 
caṇḍeśassvayaṃbhuvīti caṇḍapūjāniṣedhāt | 
ajite'pyātmārthapūjāyām (-) na dvāripūjā kartavyā na 
caṇḍeśanivedanam | nāmamantrahavistatra na nityotsavameva ca iti 
tatpratiṣedhāt | yadi tu prāgudāhṛtakālottaravacanānusāreṇa 
caṇḍapūjākriyate(,) tathā'pi na doṣaḥ | aṃśumati caṇḍeśārcanapaṭale (-)
kevalaṃsahajaṃ caiva svatantraṃ ca tridhāmatam | ātmārtha kevalaṃ 
proktaṃ maṇḍale tu samarpayet || yāmāṅgaṃ sahajaṃ jñeyaṃ 
caṇḍarūpaṃ pratiṣṭhitam | grāmāṅgaṃ cet 
svatantraṃsyāccaṇḍeśasyārcanaṃ tridheti 
caṇḍeśārcanatrevidhyamupakramyātmārthayajanāntacaṇḍapūjāyāṃ (-)
vilepanaṃ ca dānaṃ ca datvā tanmūlamantrataḥ | naivedyaṃ 
caivatāṃbūlaṃ tanmūlenaiva dāpayediti pṛthageva 
gandhapuṣpādikamuktvā kevalasyārcanaṃ proktaṃ sahajasyārcanaṃ 
śṛṇu | antarmaṇḍaladeśe tu maṇḍalasya ca gocare || caṇḍeśaṃ 
sthāpayedvidvānnirmālyenaivacārcayediti 
yāmāṅgacaṇḍeśvarapūjāyāmeva nirmālyasamarpaṇasyoktatvāt | 
siddhāntasārāvalayāmapi caṇḍapūjāprakaraṇe (-) naivedyaṃ 
tadvidhānoktaṃ datvā tāṃbūlasaṃyutam || 
yāmāṅgaścecchivenopamuktaṃ cāpi nivedayedityuktatvācca | 
sadāśivasyanirmālyaṃ caṇḍeśāyasamarpayediti 
ātmārthapūjāgatasūkṣmavacanānurodhena caṇḍeśāya 
nirmālyasamarpaṇapakṣe'pi nadoṣaḥ | parārthapūjoktarītyā 
tadekadeśasamarpaṇasaṃbhavāt | <p. 123> smṛtinibandhaneṣu ca (-)
viṣvaksenāya dātavyaṃ naivedyañca śatāṃśakam | pādodakaṃ 
prasādaṃ ca liṅge caṇḍeśvarāya cetiniveditaśatāṃśasya 
caṇḍāṃśasyaiva caṇḍabhāgatvapratipādanācca | evaṃ sadā śivasya 
nirmālyamiti suprabhedavacanasya kāmikavacanādyanusāreṇa 
yatsadāśivanirmālyaṃ caṇḍeśāya samarpitam 
tanmanuṣyāṇāṃnabhojyamityarthaḥ || athavaivaṃ tadabhiprāyaḥ | śivasya 
nirmālyaṃ śivadāsyabhāvarahitānāṃ paśuprāyāṇāṃ 
kevalamanuṣyāṇāṃ nabhojyam | ataḥ kāmyatayā 
parārthapūjāyāmātmārthapūjāyāṃ vā samṛddhamahāhavirnivedane 
sati tāvadbhojanāsamarthānāṃ devālaye paricārakāṇāṃ 
pūjakagṛhavāsināmanyeṣāṃ ca śivadīkṣāvatāṃ 
śivabhaktānāmalābhe tebhyodattāvaśiṣṭaṃ 
yathākathañcinmanuṣyamātrena dātavyam | kiṃtu gogajebhyo deyam | 
agādhe'mbhasyagnauvā kṣeptavyaṃ bhūmau vā khātavyamityetatparam | 
yathā'śvamedhādikratuṣu (-) ṛtvijāṃ haviśśeṣabhakṣaṇasāmarthyā 
bhāve (-) ṛtvigbhyodattāvaśiṣṭaṃhaviranupanīteṣu varṇāntareṣu 
nadātavyam | kiṃtūpanīteṣu brāhmaṇādiṣudātavyamagnau 
vākṣeptavyamityetatparaṃ haviśśeṣānbhakṣayitu mṛtvijaścenna 
śaknuyuḥ | viprebhyassaṃprayaccheyuḥ kṣipeyurvā hutāśana iti vacanam | 
yathā vā brāhmaṇocchiṣṭabhoktṛtaddāsaśūdrābhāve 
taducchiṣṭamapsukṣeptavyaṃ bhūmau vā 
khātavyamityetparamaśaktaubhūmau nikhane dapsuvā praveśayeditivacanam 
| etadabhiprāyeṇaivoktaṃ haradattācāryaiḥ (-)
yadbrāhmaṇastvamasinākasadāṃ nikāye tubhyaṃ niveditamabhojyamiti 
smaranti | ucchiṣṭamīśvara viśiṣṭamapi dvijānāṃ bhūmau 
nikheyamathavā'mbhasimajjanīyamiti | asya ślokasya 
ucchiṣṭabhoktṛdāsasadbhāve'pi taducchiṣṭaṃ bhūmau nikheya 
maṃbhasivā majjanīyamiti na tātparyam | ucchiṣṭamannaṃ 
dātavyaṃśīrṇāni vasanāniceti dāsena prapannāya 
śuśrūṣuśūdrāyocchiṣṭadānasmaraṇāt || jīrṇānyupānacchatravāsaḥ 
kūrcānyucchiṣṭāśanaṃ śilpavṛttiśceti 
śuśrūvuśūdradharmasmaraṇācca | evameva tubhyaṃ niveditaṃ 
bhojyamityatrāpi <p. 124> śivaniveditabhojanārhasya śivadāsyaṃ 
prapannasyālābhe yasmaikasmaicinnadātavyaṃ kintu khananādinaiva 
tatpratipādanāyamiti tātparyam | itthamanena ślokenācāryai rutkarṣata eva 
nirmālyaṃ dāsātiriktaiḥ parihāryaṃ natvapakarṣata iti vibhāvitameva | 
utkarṣata ityādyanantaraślokaistu śivotkarṣanirūpaṇagranthe 
tatprasādotkarṣanirūpaṇaṃ nopayogīti vibhāvanāya 
prauḍyāsamamuktarītiravalaṃbitā | yānitu sveṣṭaliṅgasamarpitamapi 
bhrātṛputrabhaginyādibhya eva deyamityevaṃ pratipāditāni 
tānyagnikāryarūpabhojanakartṛśivārcakaviṣayāṇi | tena 
tatsvayaṃbhoktumaśakyam | śivāgnikāryarūpasvabhojanenaiva prasaṅgāt 
(kḷpti iti kośāntare) āpattirūpasvakāryasyāpi siddheḥ | adīkṣitebhyastu 
taddānaṃpratisiddhaṃ iṣṭyādi haviśśeṣavadupekṣādoṣaparihārāya 
nyāyato bhakṣaṇenaiva pratipādanīyam | dīkṣitānāñca tadbhojanaṃ 
mahāphalapradam | ataḥ kebhyo deya mityākāṃkṣāyāṃ 
svagṛhadīkṣāvatve'pi ye'gnikāryānadhikāriṇaḥ 
strībālādayastebhyodeyamityevaṃ parāṇi | yattu kāmike (-)
nirmālyalaṃghanaṃ kṛtvā dakṣiṇasyāyutaṃ japet laṅghanena 
samassparśassame vikrayabhakṣaṇe iti laṅghananirmālyasparśe'pi 
dīkṣitānāṃ prāyaścittavidhānam | yacca (-) yannirmālyena saṃspṛṣṭaṃ 
tadbhujā puruṣeṇa vā | pādonaṃ tatra pūrvoktaṃ 
sparśalaṃghanabhakṣaṇa iti nirmālyatadbhakṣayitṛspṛṭasya sparśe 
prāyaścittavidhānaṃ tatra sarvatrāpi nirmālyapadaṃ bahiḥ 
kṣiptanirmālyaviṣayam | tasmin prāyaścittaprakaraṇe devasvaṃ 
devatādravyaṃ naivedyaṃ niveditam | caṇḍadravyaṃ ca nirmālyaṃ 
nirmālyaṃ ṣaḍvidhaṃ bhavediti bahiḥ kṣipte viśiṣya 
nirmālyasaṃjñākaraṇāt | piṇḍikāsthaṃ na nirmālyamapideve 
visarjitamitidevavisarjanānantaramapi bahiḥ kṣeparyantasparśaprāyaścitta 
pa(pī)rihārāya prāyaścittaprakaraṇe devasvaṃ devatādravyamiti 
padairnirmālyatvābhāvavarṇanācca | anyathā 
prāyaścittavidhānagatanirmālyaśabdānāṃ <p. 125> 
sarvanirmālyaviṣayatve tatra bahiḥkṣipteti viśiṣya 
nirmālyasaṃjñākaraṇasya vaiyaryaprasaṅgāt | visarjanānantaramapi bahiḥ 
kṣepaparyantaṃ nirmālyatvābhāvavarṇanasyāsāmañjasyaprasaṅgācca | 
devabhūmyādisparśa tatsaṃspṛṭasparśeṣu doṣabhāvena 
sparśaprāyaścittagatanirmālyaśabdānāṃ 
viśeṣaviṣayatvāvaśyaṃbhāvācca | bahiḥ kṣiptañca taducyate 
yanmahāhavirnivedanādiṣu bhaktaparicārakebhyo dattāvaśiṣṭaṃ 
gogajādibhyo bahirnītaṃ jalādiṣu kṣiptaṃ bahirbalyarthaṃ dattaṃvā | 
tatsarvaṃ vacanabalāddhūpopasthānānantaraṃdhūpavada spṛśyameva
nanvevaṃ tarhi tatra nirmālyabhakṣaṇādiprāyaścittopadeśānāṃ bahiḥ 
kṣiptamātraviṣatve devasva devatādravyanivedyacaṇḍadravyāṇāṃ 
bhakṣaṇādiṣu prāyaścittavidhānaṃ nalabhyata iti cenna | tatraiva 
nirmālyabhakṣaṇopekṣaṇadānavikrayalaṃghanasparśeṣu 
nirmālyatadbhakṣayitṛ spṛṣṭabhakṣaṇalaṃghanasparśeṣu ca 
prāyaścittavidhānānantaraṃ 
devāyatanavastvanyaddevagrāmādisaṃbhavam | vrīhyādi yena 
kenaivopādhinā'dāyabhakṣaṇam || karoti yassa 
saṃmūḍhomalinaḥstenakṛnmata ityādinā devasva 
devatādravyanivedyacaṇḍadravyāṇāṃ bhogadānayoḥ 
pṛthagevasteyaprāyaścittavarṇanāt | sūkṣmāgame (-) nirmālyasya 
nivedyasya laṅghane dānakarmaṇi | cāndrāyaṇaṃ carettattuyonāgānāṃ 
vinikṣipediti nirmālyātpṛthak nivedyagrahaṇādapi 
prāyaścittopadeśagatanirmālyaśabdānāṃ viśiṣya nirmālyasaṃjñika 
bahiḥ kṣiptamātraviṣayatvaṃ jñāyate | anyathā teṣāṃ 
ṣaḍvidhanirmālyaparatve nivedanasyāpi tadantarbhūtatayā prāk 
nivedanagrahaṇaṃ vyarthaṃ syāt | yattu kāmika eva (-)
snānapānīyadugdhādyairyadi sikto bhavettadā | snāyāt prakṣālayet 
dvedhānābhe rūrddhvamadhastathā || calaliṅge'pyayaṃ nyāyo vihito 
yajñamandire iti śivasyābhiṣekasamaye abhiṣekajala dugdhadadhyādikaraṇa 
sekenāpyūrddhvatadadhogātra vibhāgena snānaprakṣālana vidhānaṃ tat 
śivābhiṣekajalādibindūnāmarcakaṃ prati apavitratābhiprāyeṇa na 
bhavati | śivābhiṣekajalādiprāśastyasya prākprapañcitatvāt | <p. 126> 
kintu tadanantaramarcakena kariṣyamāṇaṃ śivasya gandhavilepanādikaṃ 
tannirmālyasaṃsiktagātreṇa kartumayuktam(,) gurorabhyaṅgasnapanaṃ 
kṛtavatā tattailabindusaṃsiktagātreṇa śiṣyeṇa 
gurorgandhavilepanādikamivetyābhiprāyeṇa | evamanyānyapyevaṃ 
saṃbhāvitāni vacanāni netavyāni | taditthamagnikāryabuddhyā 
bhuñjānerniveditaśeṣaṃ bhoktavyaṃ | dāsyabuddhyā 
bhuṃjānairniveditaṃ bhoktavyamiti vyavasthā niravadyā | tathā ca 
vāyusaṃhitāyāmapi darśitam (-) tatassvayañca bhuñjīta śuddhamannaṃ 
yathāsukham | niveditaṃ vā deveśe taccheṣaṃ  vā'tmaśuddhaye || 
śraddadhāno na lobhena na caṇḍāya samarpitam | gandhamālyādi 
yacchānyattatrāpyeṣa samo vidhiḥ || na tu tatra śivo'smīti buddhiṃ 
kuryādvicakṣaṇa iti || niveditaṃ bhuñjānaḥ 
svahṛtpuṇḍarīkāntaravahnimadhyagataśivabhāvanayā svasya 
śivāgnikārya rūpa (śivasyājñākartṛtāmiti) 
śivapūjākartṛtāmabhipretya śrīśivo'hamiti buddhiṃ na kuryāt | kintu 
śivadāsyabuddhimeva kuryādityarthaḥ | evaṃ niveditānnabhojanaṃ 
kurvatā prāṇāhutayo'pi nievedite naiva kartavyāḥ prāṇāgnihotraṃ yaḥ 
kuryāccivasyaiva prasādataḥ | aśvamedhāyutaṃ puṇyaṃ siddhe siddhe 
bhavennaraḥ iti śivapurāṇavacanāt ||

[bhojana vidhiḥ] ||

	athabhojanavidhiḥ || svāhāntaiḥ 
svasūtroktamantraiḥhutvātānvisarjayet | evamagnikāryaṃ 
nirvartyadhautāṃghrikarassamācāntaśśibhaktaissadācāraissahito 
hīnajātīyānadīkṣitānekapaktau pariharan bhojanasthānamāsādya pīṭhe 
prāṅmukha upaviśya caturaśreṇa 
hastamānenācāryaputrasādhakasamayikrameṇa 
catustridvyekarekhāṅkitaparitobhasmarekhāṃkitena maṇḍalena 
bhūṣitabhūtale suvarṇarajatatāmralohānyatamanirmitaṃ <p. 127> 
kāṃsyanirmitaṃ vā saptadhā bhasmanā śodhitamaghorābhimantritaṃ 
tadabhāve kadalīpalāśapadmacūtamadhūkādyaninditapatraṃ vā pātraṃ 
niveśya tatra ghṛtenopastirya pariveṣitaṃ dvirabhighāritaṃ savyañjanaṃ 
śuddhamannamastreṇa saṃprokṣyatryakṣaramṛtyuñjayapūrvakeṇa 
mṛtyuñjayāya vauṣaḍiti mantreṇa saptavāramabhimantrya yathāvarṇaṃ 
pariṣecanādikaṃ kṛtvāgrāsārddhamātreṇānnena nāgakūrmakrakara 
devadattadhanaṃjayebhyaḥ upaprāṇavāyubhyaḥ svāheti 
svasyadakṣiṇabhāge gomayopalipte maṇḍale dadyāt | 
tatassavyahastakaniṣṭhikayā sravaṇena nāgādibhyaśculakodakaṃ datvā 
māṣamajjanārhaṃ śivaṣṭajalamamṛtamantreṇa prāśya 
prāṇāhutipañcakaṃ kuryāt | tena prāṇāpānavyānodānasamānānāṃ 
krameṇa tadāvāhitānāmātmabhūtayonayaḥ pātālatalavāsinaḥ pitaro 
devā ityeteṣāṃ ca tṛptiṃ bhāvayet | tato 
yathākiñciducchiṣṭānnamādāya narakavāsibhyaḥ svāheti bhūmau 
datvā uttarāpośanānantaraṃ taccheṣajalaṃ kaniṣṭhāṃgulyāni srāvya 
hastodvartanādi śuddhācamanāntaṃ karma kṛtvā 
bhuktadoṣaśuddhyarthaṃ dakṣiṇakarāṃguṣṭhajalena 
dakṣiṇapādāṃguṣṭhāgrasthakālāgnirudraṃ secayet | aniveditabhojināṃ 
tu bhojane viśeṣaḥ prāgeva suprabhedodāharaṇena darśitaḥ | 
niveditabhojināmaniveditabhojināñca bhojanakālādanyatra 
yadanyadauṣadhatāṃbūlapānīyādi bhojyaṃ gandhapuṣpādi bhogyaṃ 
vopatiṣṭhate(,) tatsarvaṃ manasā vā devāya samarpyaiva bhoktavyam | patraṃ 
puṣpaṃ phalaṃ toya mannapānādyamauṣadham | anivedyanabhuñjita 
bhagavantaṃ samāhita iti kāmikavacanāt | upabhogāya purato vastu 
yadyadupasthitam | tattatsamarpya devāya vidadhītātmasāttataḥ iti 
vātulavacanācca | yattu (-) annādyamauṣadhaṃ toyaṃ patraṃ puṣpaṃ 
phalāṃdikam | śivasya datvā taccheṣaṃ bhojyaṃ bhuñjita 
buddhimānityauṣadhāṃderniveditaśeṣasya bhojanavidhānaṃ(,) tat 
kāryārthamaniveditabhojanaṃ kurvato bhojanamadhyagrāhyau 
ṣadhādini(?)yam | anyatra śivadāsānāṃ śivocchiṣṭameva grāhyam | kiñca 
bhaktena yatkiñcitphalamuddiśyayā kriyā laukikī vaidikī vā kartumiṣyate 
sā sarvā'pi <p. 128> śivarādhanarūpeti bhāvena kartavyā | 
tattatkriyājanyasukhamapi śivastadbhokteti śive samarpyatadbhuktabhave 
sukhaṃ mayā bhujyata iti bhāvena bhoktavyam | evaṃ vinaiva 
svayatnamupanatāśśabda sparśarūparasagandhākhyā viṣayāśca 
śivasamarpaṇa pūrvakaṃ taducchiṣṭabuddhyaivasvendriyairanubhavitavyāḥ 
| tattadviṣayānubhavajanyaṃsukhamapi taducchiṣṭabuddhyaivabhoktavyam | 
yā yā kriyā vidhātavyā prastutā jāyate puraḥ | tāṃ tāṃ 
kuryānmahādevasamarpitadhiyā sudhīḥ || indriyādāgataṃ 
kiñcidyatsukhaṃ tacchivārpitam | kṛtvā prasādaṃ bhoktavyaṃ 
tadindriyamukhenacetivātulaśravaṇāt || <p. 128> tadarthaṃ ca bhaktena sadā 
sāvadhānena bhāvyam | saṃyogeṣu viyogeṣu sāvadhānonirantaram | 
gacchantiṣṭhansvapanjāgradbhuñjāno maithunerataḥ | 
yaśśivārpitacetaskobhaktimāṃstu na cānyathetibṛhatkālottare śravaṇāt | 
evaṃ kriyāsamarpaṇapūrvakaṃ kriyāṃ kurvataḥ 
viṣayasamarpaṇapūrvakaṃ viṣayānanubhavata 
stattajjanyasukhasamarpaṇapūrvakaṃ sukhaṃ bhuñjānasya ca 
sāvadhānasya bhaktasya pūrvajanmavāsanānte kvacit kvacit 
pramādānniṣiddhakriyāṃ kurvato'pi niṣiddhaviṣayānanubhavato'pi 
niṣiddhasukhaṃbhuñjānasyāpinapāpalepobhavati | kiṃtu sarvaṃ 
śivasamārādhanamitibhāvayatassarvamapi śivaprītaya eva bhavati | 
tatrātmabhogārthaṃ nṛttāvalokanaharmyopavanadīrghikādikrīḍārūpāṃ 
kriyāmārabhamāṇastattatkriyāsamaye saṃbhāvitānāṃ 
vākpāṇipādapāyūpastharūpakarmendriyavyāpārasādhyānāṃ 
śrotratvakcakṣurjihvāghrāṇarūpa jñānendriyajanyatattadviṣayasādhyā(-)
nāñca sukhānāṃ samarpaṇārthaṃ svakīye 
śrotrādijñānendriyapañcake vāgādikarmendriyapañcake ca 
krameṇādhiṣṭhātṛtvena sannihitānāmīśānādīnāṃ 
śrotrādivāgādīni svakīyaśrotrādiṣvaikyenānusaṃdhāya 
tattadindriyavyāpārasāddhyasukhānyaiśānādi mūrtīradhiṣṭhātrāśive 
nānubhūyamānāni vibhāvya tānyeva sukhāni 
śivocchiṣṭabuddhyāstrayaṃ bhuñjita | 
ayatnopanamadviṣayasukhasamarpaṇaṃ tattadviṣayopabhogasamayeṣu 
sāvadhānena kartumarhasi(?) prātarvāśivapūjāvasāne vā bhaviṣyad etat 
samayaparyantaṃ bhāvitāyatnopanamacchanda (?)sa <p. 129> 
gandhātmakaviṣayānubhavatajjanyasukhāniśivāyārpayāmīti 
yugapadevārpayet | evaṃ yugapadviṣayārpaṇaṃ hṛdayādiṣu vā 
hṛdayādisthānabhāvitasyasāṃbaśivasya śrotrādiṣu vā(,) 
hṛdayādisthānabhāvitasya sadāśivasya 
kramādīśānādimukhagataśrotrādiṣu vā svakīyaśrotrādyaikyena 
saṃhiteṣvīśānādīnāṃ śrotrādīṣu vā kartavyam | sarvatrāpi samarpaṇe 
namontaśivamantra evamantraḥ | tasya ca śivāyedaṃ namameti artho 
bhāvanīyaḥ | sacārthomakārasya jīvavācakrasya ṣaṣṭhyantatayā labhyata 
iti sarvametadatirahasyam | evaṃ 
pratidinaṃprātaśśivacintanaṃśakyasnānavibhūtirudrākṣadhāraṇa(-)
saṃdhyopāsanapūrvakaṃ trikālaṃ dvikālamekakālaṃ vā 
catvāriṃśatā ṣoḍaśabhirdaśabhiḥ 
pañcabhirupacārairaṣṭapuṣpikāmātreṇa (-mānneṇa) vā śivaṃ pūjayan 
yathāvasaraṃśivaśāstrāṇyadhīyānaśśivakathāssamākarṇayan 
bhojanakāle śivāgnikāryabuddhyā śivaniveditaśeṣaṃ vā 
śivadāsyabuddhyā śivaniveditaṃ vā svīkurvan 
anyattāṃbūlapānīyagandhapuṣpādibhogyajātaṃ śivasamarpitaṃ jānan 
cikīrṣitaṃ karmajātaṃ tatphalarūpāṇāṃ sukhānāṃ śivopabhogyatvaṃ 
vibhāvya śivārādhanabuddhyā kurvāṇaḥ ṣvayatnamanapekṣya 
upanatānapi viṣayān tattadviṣayopasthitisamayeṣu yugapadvā 
śivārpitānvidadhānaḥ sarvāṇyapi sukhāni 
śivocchiṣṭabuddhyaivānubhavan 
bahirlaukikakāryavicārakālepyanantaśivanāmānusandhānena 
saphalayannantaradhvani gamāgamābhyāṃ viharaṃtīṃ 
niratiśayaprakāśāmabhūtarūpiṇīmānandalekhāmapi samayeṣvākalayan 
pañcākṣaraparadevatāmaśeṣopaniṣadanviṣyamāṇacaraṇāṃbujamakhila
devatāsārvabhauma mapārakararuṇāṃbudhi 
māśritarakṣādhurandharamaṃbikayāsaha nijahṛdayajalaruhakuhare 
viharamāṇamānandasandohamūrti 
paramaśivamanavaratamantardṛśāvalokayan iṣṭabandhubhissaha sukhamāsit 
||

velūradhīśacinayommavibhorudāre
citte ca dhāmni cirādabhivardhamānām |
<p. 130> arcāvidhāṃ paśupate ramarābhinandyā
mitthaṃ samācakalamīśvaraśāsanena ||

sadrājayoganijacaṃcuranāhatājñā(-)
śaktyādisārasamudañcitadivyatejāḥ |
āvāhanakramakalānipuṇo'tidhīraḥ
śrībommabhūpatilakaśśivapūjakassyāt ||

karotu jvarakaṇṭheśassvakīyārcanacandrikām |
ākalpasthāyinīmenāṃ dyusthale candrikāmiva ||

hariḥ om ||

śubhamastu | gurubhyonamaḥ ||

bhajāmijvarakaṇṭheśa mṛtyuñjayapadāṃbujam |
yadāśrito nagvavyājādbhāti jaivātṛkassadā ||

[śivārcanācandrikā samāptā] ||

